<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2KI" style="id" />
  <para style="h">2 Manguüa</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Manguüa</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Manguüa</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Manguüa</para>
  <para style="mt1">2 Manguüa</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow aming tukah dowi chekhai; nachenganchepaw tawngbak mih Jihudi Kristianuüa mih risi Jeremiah ruiah mih naown pahai ka tuak khai. Now arui khin dow 560-536 BC takra kowi chekhai. 1 hai 2 Manguüa bowih mih auown khe dow pabowih sang chowdiah; tawkche akung kowi dow ta changah pre bowih khai. Mami bowih dow Israeluüa hai pur prakowi kowh maru-uüa vüi kowi ruiah mih chekhai. Mami bowih kowi arui uowi mih dow Israel pren ta chowng pre bak mih kowi kowh manguüa lawnguan, amatni kowh marow kri piak mih lawnguan hai risi Elija kowi Thurai pawta kung kowi risi Elisa ta chang lup mih lawnguan chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih kowi kowh lang pankri mih tüngsangra paw lusa manguüa mih tawng khe paw ia thawp Thurai pren dowi chekhai. Lusa manguüa dow tawng khe paw Thurai iawng ia kruitown maru dowi. Naiawng rakowi Isu matia ngengche mih uang chowng mang takla pami chekhai.</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Achinawmma: Achinawmma pami dow angak uowi dowi mih maru chekhai. Naiawng mih maru dow ku dowi, dai dowi, kuan dowi hai sai maru dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Babulawn: Babulawn dow lusa maru lai achap sang uowi mih khin khe kowh thawpah mih kimkrowng chekhai. Nami kimkrowng dow akung kowi pren ming uang chowng khai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Mukuang: Baibul kowi kowh mukuang pahai arui uowi mih dow auan uowi pre chaing chekhai. Tawngbak khe nami dow mukuang pren kowi kowh tek mih paw na chekhai, now a-i khi-ah mih mukuang kowi kowh tek mih paw na chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Ari aiang: Baibul kowi kowh ari aiang pami dow alai kowh Israeluüa chowng khe Mosi kowi kowh Thurai peah mih chekhai. Nami dow aia mik kowi achinawmma aia maru-uüa naia uowila kownkow nachünah kown mih müa aia maru-uüa vüi Thurai peah mih chekhai. Ari aiang chün dowi mih dow angak chekhai. Naiawng rakowi ari aiang chün dowi mih maru vüi dow ripra uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Pren tabak mih 1:1-17:41</para>
  <para style="io2">Risi Elisa 1:1-8:15</para>
  <para style="io2">Juda hai Israel kowh manguüa 8:16-17:8</para>
  <para style="io2">Samari marow piak mih 17:5-41</para>
  <para style="io1">Juda manguüa</para>
  <para style="io2">Ezekiel hownia Josua 18:1-21:26</para>
  <para style="io2">Josua chowm mang mih khin 21:1-23:30</para>
  <para style="io2">Judauüa kowh achur mang 23:31-24:20</para>
  <para style="io1">Jerusalem piak mih 25:1-30</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2KI 1" />
  <para style="s">Mang Ahazia kowi Elija tüng pe angak mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 1:1" />Israel mang Ahab kowng kung kowi Moab prenchakuüa dow Israeluüa kowi kingküaah khai.<verse eid="2KI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 1:2" />Akat khe Samari marow kowi kowh Israel mang sar Ahazia dow aia kowh kim aluk krowng kowi kowh towklak chawn hownia iu dowh khai, now aia dow lainowmma ka arau khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow aia kowh maru-uüa kowi cham chinah pre sum ia khai. Naiawngün maru-uüa kowi aia krawi tek pe mih, “Filistinuüa kowh Ekrawn marow kowi kowkowi büa diah. Now ang kowh mami arau iung tak chünchü mih Baal-Zebub thurai kowi kowlünta ang büah madiah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 1:3" />Nachenganchepaw Tisbe marow kowi kowh Elija kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu tek pe mih, “Samari marow kowi kowh mang uang chinah mih maru-uüa hown kowtakrum diah. Now amatni kowi en natek pe kown mih, ‘Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi Thurai uowi dowi bow? Tawngplawng kowchow nakowpaw prengia kownkow Ekrawn marow kowi kowh Baal-Zebub thurai tut-e enni kowtuk kowi khai? <verse eid="2KI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 1:4" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG tek aia kowh arau naiung kown nadowk pe; aia nakowng ngengche kown pe,’ pape diah,” pakhai. Nahanow Elija dow nami laiklow nakowtek kownkow kowkowi khai bowt.<verse eid="2KI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 1:5" />Nami kung kowi dow naiawngün maru-uüa mih mang tut-e uang plan büah khai bowt. Nakhowk khe amatni kowi mang hawt lüntaah mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow enni uang lüa plan khai?” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 1:6" />Amatni klangah mih, “Anging hown maru uang takrum lowk ia. Aia mih en tut-e nauang plan kownkow tek anging khai. Now maiawng natek en kownkow CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi Thurai uowi dowi bow? Tawngplawng kowchow nakowpaw prengia kownkow Ekrawn marow kowi kowh Baal-Zebub thurai tut-e en kowtuk chin maru-uüa khai? Naiawng rakowi en kowh arau naiung kown nadowk; en nakowng ngengche kown!’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 1:7" />Mang tek pe amatni mih, “Enni hown uang takrum now naiawng uang tek enni mih maru powm tawng iawng chow?” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 1:8" />Amatni klangah mih, “Aia dow ut pawi tawnguat khupma chekhai, now kelang kowi dow chak pik hown kowh kekawm sükma chekhai,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 1:8">Mang tek pe mih, “Aia dow Tisbe marow kowi kowh Elija chowtaih!” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 1:9" />Nami kung kowi siphai 50 ia hai amatni kowh siphai aluchow kowi Elija tut-e mang mih kowchinah khai. Nakhowk khe Elija dow chut luk kowi chowm phülü chekhai. Nami aluchow dow Elija tut-e kowkowiah now tek pe mih, “Aw Thurai maru, mangkri tek iu dowm diah pe,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 1:10" />Nachenganchepaw siphai aluchow kowi Elija klangah mih, “Ang che Thurai maru na khai hanow mukuang hownia maih pacham uang klaah, now en hai en kowh siphai 50 ia kowi pacham uang kamah lah,” pakhai. Nahanow mukuang hownia maih uang kla hanow nami siphai aluchow hai siphai 50 ia kowi uang kamta bowk khai.<verse eid="2KI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 1:11" />Nami laiklow tata hanow akeng mih siphai 50 ia hai amatni kowh siphai aluchow kowi Elija tut-e mang mih kowplan chinah khai. Nami aluchow tek pe Elija mih, “Aw Thurai maru, mangkri tek kawmat mat iu dowm diah pe,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 1:12" />Nachenganchepaw siphai aluchow kowi Elija klangah mih, “Ang che Thurai maru na khai hanow mukuang hownia maih pacham uang klaah, now en hai en kowh siphai 50 ia kowi pacham uang kamah lah,” pakhai. Nahanow mukuang hownia maih uang kla hanow nami siphai aluchow hai siphai 50 ia kowi uang kamta bowk khai.<verse eid="2KI 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 1:13" />Nami kung kowi paw akeng mih siphai 50 ia hai amatni kowh siphai aluchow kowi Elija tut-e mang mih kowplan chinah khai iawk. Nachenganchepaw nami leng dow nami siphai aluchow mih hungh kowi kowpünah now Elija pur kowi kowtabawk krawm khai. Now aia tek pe Elija mih, “Aw Thurai maru, sakrauma hown ang hai mami siphai 50 ia kowi hauang saita anging diah. <verse eid="2KI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 1:14" />Uang rik uang pre thum mih siphai aluchow pre ia kowi hai amatchi kowh siphaiuüa kowi dow mukuang hownia maih uang kla hanow kamta bowk khai. Nachenganchepaw khaleng dow sakrauma hown pe sing ang diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 1:15" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu tek pe Elija mih, “Iu dowm now aia hown kowtawi diah. Aia kowi hangkow kram diah,” pape khai. Naiawng rakowi nami maru hown Elija dow mang tut-e kowtawi khai.<verse eid="2KI 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 1:16" />Nakowi kowting khe Elija tek pe mang mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi Thurai uowi dowi bow? Tawngplawng kowchow nakowpaw prengia kownkow Ekrawn marow kowi kowh Baal-Zebub thurai tut-e en kowtuk chin maru-uüa khai? Naiawng mih lup en chang rakowi en kowh arau naiung kown nadowk; en nakowng ngengche kown!’ pakhai,” pape khai. <verse eid="2KI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 1:17" />Naiawng rakowi Elija tut-e kowh CHAKRAMANG laiklow iawng mang Ahazia dow kowng khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 1:17">Ahazia kowh dow lowk iachow paw chapa uowi dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia kowh naumow Joram mih chowm mang khai. Naiawng Joram chowm mang mih dow Juda kowi kowh Jehosafat kowh chapa Jehoram chowm mang mih pre ning khe chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 1:18" />Ahazia changah mih lup maten dow “Israel Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2KI 2" />
  <para style="s">Mukuang pren kowi CHAKRAMANG pünla Elija mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 2:1" />Khanawng li hown <char style="w">mukuang pren</char> kowi Elija kowi CHAKRAMANG napünla kown mih khin dow uang towm khai bowt. Nakhowk khe Elija hai Elisa iüah dow Gilgal marow hownia uang lawt khai. <verse eid="2KI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 2:2" />Now Elija tek pe Elisa mih, “Makowi ta uowi diah towbowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Bethel marow kowi ang malowkchow nakowkowi kown mih CHAKRAMANG chin ang khai,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:2">Nachenganchepaw Elisa klangah mih, “Masing CHAKRAMANG ming hai en ming lüklau se ang takham khowk, mapaw ang plawt en kown nadowi,” pape khai. Naiawng rakowi amatchi dow Bethel marow kowi kowkowi khai.<verse eid="2KI 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 2:3" />Now nami marow kowi kowkup iüah dowi rawn khe nakowi kowh risiuüa dow Elisa tut-e uangah hanow tek pe mih, “En kowh chakramang Elija kowi ani dow en hownia CHAKRAMANG napawta kown mih en tuk bow?” pabüah khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:3">Nakhowk khe Elisa klangah mih, “Ow, ang tuk. Tawkchedow nami lawnguan kowi hang tek büah tham bowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 2:4" />Nami kung kowi Elija tek pe Elisa mih, “Makowi ta uowi diah towbowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Jeriko marow kowi ang nakowkowi kown mih CHAKRAMANG chin ang khai,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:4">Nachenganchepaw Elisa klangah mih, “Masing CHAKRAMANG ming hai en ming lüklau se ang takham khowk, mapaw ang plawt en kown nadowi,” pape khai. Naiawng rakowi amatchi dow Jeriko marow kowi kowkowi khai.<verse eid="2KI 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 2:5" />Now Jeriko marow hown atawnchow kowtowm iüah khe nakowi kowh risiuüa dow Elisa tut-e uangah hanow tek pe mih, “En kowh chakramang Elija kowi ani dow en hownia CHAKRAMANG napawta kown mih en tuk bow?” pabüah khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:5">Nakhowk khe Elisa klangah mih, “Ow, ang tuk. Tawkchedow nami lawnguan kowi hang tek büah tham bowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 2:6" />Nami kung kowi Elija tek pe Elisa mih, “Makowi ta uowi diah towbowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi ang nakowkowi kown mih CHAKRAMANG chin ang khai,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:6">Nachenganchepaw Elisa klangah mih, “Masing CHAKRAMANG ming hai en ming lüklau se ang takham khowk, mapaw ang plawt en kown nadowi,” pape khai. Naiawng rakowi amatchi pre ia tarü khai.<verse eid="2KI 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 2:7" />Now Elija hai Elisa iüah dow Jawrdan aw pang re-e iowng iüah khai. Nakhowk khe amatchi hown alak sangrumchow re-e risiuüa uang iowng 50 ia khai. <verse eid="2KI 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 2:8" />Nami kung kowi dow Elija mih aia kowh uanchow kerah hanow iu bawpla tui khai. Nahanow Jawrdan aw tui dow hawmlawm pra hai lakuai prakowi taak lang khai. Now Jawrdan aw rephai akang khawngma mih iawng haipown iüah khai.<verse eid="2KI 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 2:9" />Paipra pown kowi amatchi kowting khe Elija tek pe Elisa mih, “En hownia CHAKRAMANG iu pawta ang dowi rawn en vüi tawng chow ang nachangla en kown mih tek ang diah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:9">Nakhowk khe Elisa tek pe mih, “Sakrauma hown en kowh <char style="w">nowng changra</char> kür pela ang pre phow diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 2:10" />Nakhowk khe Elija tek pe mih, “En lü mih dow akratma mih uanh chekhai. Nachenganchepaw en hownia CHAKRAMANG iu pawta ang mih khin khe en che krawi khi ang khai hanow en naka kown. Tawkche en krawi khi ang dowi hanow en naka kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 2:11" />Elija hai Elisa iüah dow naiawng talawpla se taiua mang iüah khai. Nakhowk khe maih kawrnga kari hai maih kawrnga ün amatchi takra kowi uang takhia hanow amatchi kowi kraah khai. Now Elija kowi dow khanawng li hown mukuang pren kowi CHAKRAMANG pünla khai bowt. <verse eid="2KI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 2:12" />Nami khita hanow Elisa dow kar se tek mih, “Aw apa, apa! Israel kowi kowh kawrnga kari hai kawrnga luk kowi kowh chowm mih siphaiuüa kowi ang khi khai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Aw apa, apa! Israel kowi kowh kawrnga kari hai kawrnga luk kowi kowh chowm mih siphaiuüa kowi ang khi khai </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami laiklow Hebrai lai hown kowh tekah mih chim dowi chekhai.</char></note>!” pakhai. Nami hownia now Elija kowi katpaw Elisa khi dowi bowt chekhai. Nakhowk khe Elisa dow sak piak rakowi aia kowh tawnguat mih thekta kruang khai.<verse eid="2KI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 2:13" />Nami kung kowi dow Elisa mih Elija kowh ta dowh mih uanpowngchow kowlüm khai, now plan mang kownkow Jawrdan aw pang re-e kowiowng khai. <verse eid="2KI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 2:14" />Now Elija kowh nami uanpowngchow hown iu bawp tui hanow aia tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG Elija kowh Thurai tawng kowi chow?” pakhai. Now aia iu bawp tui hanow tui dow hawmlawm pra hai lakuai prakowi taak lang khai, now aia dow aw paipra pown kowi haimang khai.<verse eid="2KI 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elija kowh arah Elisa ta paw mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 2:15" />Jeriko marow hownia kowh 50 ia mih risiuüa dow naiawng Elisa chang mih haikhi hanow awda büah khai. Amatni tatek mih, “Elija kowh lümla kür mih Elisa tut-e chowbowt!” pabüah khai. Amatni dow Elisa hown kowtakrum hanow aia pur kowi krawng kowi tabawk krawm se chupah büah khai. <verse eid="2KI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 2:16" />Now amatni tek pe Elisa mih, “Mow, mami re-e akürma kangowh mih anging uowi 50 ia lowmow. En che pe anging ana now Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi en kowh chakramang Elija kowi anging kowkrawi cham sow. CHAKRAMANG kowh lümla dow aia kowi cham pawla hanow hungh kowi chepaw, lawngrawi kowi chepaw cham towta hüah ün tarawng,” pabüah khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:16">Nakhowk khe Elisa tek pe amatni mih, “Kowkowi kla dowi tham,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 2:17" />Nachenganchepaw amatni dow Elisa rukrai pat naiawng tek pe rengreng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Elisa tek pe mih, “Kowkowi büah bowt,” pakhai. Nahanow risiuüa dow nakrawi cham Elija kownkow tarü khai bowt. Amatni dow sum ni mowr krawi cham chepaw Elija kowi krawi ka büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 2:18" />Nami kung kowi dow amatni mih Elisa uowi rah Jeriko marow kowi uang plan büah khai. Nakhowk khe Elisa hawt tek pe amatni mih, “Nakowkowi dowi kown mih ang tek enni khowk nadowi bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elisa iung tui mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 2:19" />Akat khe Jeriko marowchakuüa tek pe Elisa mih, “Aw anging kowh chakramang, mami marow kowi kowh süng dow klangiungma mih en tuk. Nachenganchepaw tui pachap mih mapaw iung dowi chekhai, now luprak paw phaw dowi chekhai,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="2KI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 2:20" />Nakhowk khe Elisa tek pe mih, “Bia sar hown ang tut-e uang pawla awisa sangrum diah,” pakhai. Nahanow amatni dow bia sar hown Elisa kowi uang pawla pe awisa khai.<verse eid="2KI 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 2:21" />Now Elisa dow Jeriko marowchakuüa kowh tui chawt kowi kowkowi khai. Now nami awisa dow tui kowi aia pruiah hanow tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG ming hown mami tui mih iungta khowk. Khaleng hownia bowt now mami tui khamra hownia maru nakowng kown nadowi bowt, now masiuüa pawm paw naiut kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="2KI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 2:22" />Nami tui dow ani mowr pat Elisa tek iawng aiungma reng tak chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elisa kowi ngeuüa hawmh khareah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 2:23" />Akung kowi Elisa dow Jeriko marow hownia Bethel kowi kowkowi khai. Now tiama rawng kowi chowreng tak khe Bethel hownia ngeuüa hawmh akawmma uang lawt hanow aia kowi uang khareah khai. Amatni tek pe mih, “Owi, lukiala, lukiala, mami hownia powt,” pabüah khai. <verse eid="2KI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 2:24" />Nakhowk khe Elisa dow iu ngeu hanow amatni kowi khita khai, now CHAKRAMANG ming hown amatni kowi aia peah piati khai. Nahanow kaurawng hownia tawmma uang lawt pre pum hanow ngeuüa hawmh pungmadawng hownia 42 ia kowi uang makta nak khai. <verse eid="2KI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 2:25" />Nami kung kowi dow Bethel hownia Karmel hungh kowi aia kowkowi khai. Now nami hungh hownia dow Samari marow kowi aia uang plan khai.<verse eid="2KI 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2KI 3" />
  <para style="s">Moabuüa hown Israeluüa tasen mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 3:1" />Juda pren kowi mang Jehosaphat chowm mang mih lairaiat ning khe Ahab chapa Joram dow Israeluüa luk kowi chowm mang khai. Aia dow Samari marow kowi laipre ning mowr chowm mang khai. <verse eid="2KI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 3:2" />Aia dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang khai. Nachenganchepaw aia dow a-u a-pa khowt chang lup ngak dowi chekhai. Baal thurai vüi kowi a-pa chowkah mih hua ün aia piakta pe khai. <verse eid="2KI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 3:3" />Tawkchedow Israeluüa kowi kowh Nebat chapa Jeroboam pe changah lup ngak iawng aia paw chang reng tak chekhai. Nami hownia dow aia tarip dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 3:4" />Moab pren mang Mesa kowh dow ruapur tawn uowi ahuma chekhai. Aia dow ning towng Israel mang kowi <char style="w">mangmu</char> iawng hai ruapur chah 100,000 pum, now ruapurla 100,000 pum pawi peah reng chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 3:5" />Tawkche Ahab kowng kung kowi dow Moab pren mang mih Israel pren mang kowi kingküaah khai. <verse eid="2KI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 3:6" />Naiawng rakowi mang Joram dow Samari marow hownia uang lawt hanow aia kowh siphai maten kowi kuaah lawmah khai. <verse eid="2KI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 3:7" />Nami klen kowi Juda pren mang Jehosafat kowi paw maiawng aia krawi phowng pe satang khai, “Moab pren mang uang kingküa ang khai. Naiawng rakowi Moabuüa kowi ang hown en tawi sen kown bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:7">Nakhowk khe mang Jehosafat krawi tek pe mih, “Ow, tawi sen kown taih. Achi dow pabuk sang mih iawng towbowt. Ang kowh maru-uüa hai kawrnga hawmh dow en kowh iawng tuakah towbowt. <verse eid="2KI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 3:8" />Tawkche tawng mih tiama hownia chow amatni kowi a-i kowsenah kown?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:8">Nakhowk khe Joram klangah mih, “Edawm pren kowi kowh süngrüp süngkangma iawng a-i nakowsenah kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 3:9" />Now akung kowi Edawm pren mang hai Juda pren mang dow Israel mang kowi tawi tabawngla khai. Now amatni dow süngrüp süngkangma iawng ranit ni mowr mang büah khai. Tawkche nakowi dow amatni kowh siphai hawmh hai tawncher hawmh nakhamah kown mih tui hing uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 3:10" />Nakhowk khe Israel mang tek mih, “Kramra uowi lai bowt kowbow! Moabuüa rut kowi a-i mang sum ia kowi naap a-i kownkow CHAKRAMANG uang pawla mih chekhai bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 3:11" />Nakhowk khe mang Jehosaphat tek pe mih, “Tawng chow achang takla mih CHAKRAMANG tut-e nalünta a-i kownkow mami re-e risi uowi ne dowi bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:11">Mang Joram kowh maru iuk lowk ia tek mih, “Mami re-e Safat chapa Elisa uowi lowk ia. Aia dow Elija kowh akhowng mih chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 3:12" />Jehosafat tek pe mih, “Aia hown dow CHAKRAMANG laiklow uowi chekhai,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi Israel pren mang, Edawm pren mang hai Jehosafat büah mih Elisa tut-e kowkowi khai.<verse eid="2KI 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 3:13" />Nakhowk khe Israel pren mang kowi Elisa tek pe mih, “En hown tawng chow ang tatawng? En u en pa kowh risiuüa tut-e phai kowkowi diah snow,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:13">Israel mang tek pe mih, “Nadowi iow! Tawngplawng kowchow panow Moabuüa rut kowi a-i mang sum ia kowi naapta kownkow CHAKRAMANG ngengche uang pawla a-i mih chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 3:14" />Elisa klangah mih, “Ang chang pe lup mih lowra nowngia chang mih masing CHAKRAMANG ming lüklau se ang tek khowk, mami re-e Juda pren mang Jehosafat che tawi uowi dowi e dow tuak paw ang tuak en dowi tham diah, now khowng paw ang khowng en dowi tham diah. <verse eid="2KI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 3:15" />Tuk tep tingteng mih maru kowi kawmat ang tut-e uang pawla lowk ia diah,” pape khai. Now tuk tep tingteng mih maru tep tingteng mih khin khe dow CHAKRAMANG kowh kür mih Elisa luk kowi uang towm khai. <verse eid="2KI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 3:16" />Nakhowk khe Elisa tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek mih maiawng, ‘Mami lawngrawi kowi kowh akang khawngma mih aw kowi ahuma thai kuam büa diah. <verse eid="2KI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 3:17" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow li uang mih hai uang uang mih enni khi dowi chepaw mami lawngrawi kowi kowh akang khawngma mih aw dow tui nauang tek mawp kown. Nakhowk khe dow enni hai enni kowh tawncher hawmh mih naka kham tui kown towbowt,’ pakhai. <verse eid="2KI 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 3:18" />Nami lup dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e aiachow taih. Nami klen kowi Moab pren paw enni rut kowi aia naapta enni kown. <verse eid="2KI 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 3:19" />Nakhowk khe tap uowi mih marow maten hai pankrima mih marow maten enni napiakta pe kown. Now uih mih singh maten paw enni nakripta pe kown, awchawng paw enni nathiata pe kown, now aiungma mih laih maten paw huaklu atekma enni nachang pe kown,” pape khai. <verse eid="2KI 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 3:20" />Now auai rau dow rau towng kowh phuchua chang khin khe Edawm pren hownia tui uang lawt hanow Israeluüa uowi rah kowi tui uang tek mawp khai.<verse eid="2KI 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 3:21" />Now amatni kowi nauang senah kownkow mang sum ia uang tarü khowk pami satang dow Moabuüa ta khai. Naiawng rakowi Moabuüa dow nowng dowk tasen müa rutchün khawkleng mih kachakuüa maten kowi hawah khai. Now nahawt dowk tasen kownkow amatni kowi dow pren sünghi kowi towah khai. <verse eid="2KI 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 3:22" />Now auai rau murpa awr rü hanow tui luk kowi sat uang sawt mih khi büah khai. Tui kowi naiawng sat uang sawt kowh aringma tui phaw mih kowi vi padow Moabuüa ka tuak khai. <verse eid="2KI 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 3:23" />Nakhowk khe awda se amatni tek mih, “Pai iow, vi le! Mang lala tasen kowh kowng mih chowbowt. Moabuüa low, chu, amatni kowh uanh a-i kowrupta pe bowt lah,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="2KI 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 3:24" />Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa kowh tangbung khupra re-e Moabuüa uang ting khe Israeluüa mih uang lawt hanow amatni kowi uang senah khai, now amatni kowi kawikrawiah büah khai. Israeluüa dow amatni kowi senla se amatni pren kowi kowkup khai. <verse eid="2KI 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 3:25" />Now amatni kowh marow maten piakta pe büah khai. Amatni kowh aiungma mih laih maten paw atekma pat kuak pe huaklu khai, amatni kowh tui chawt maten paw thiata pe khai, now uih mih singh maten paw kripta pe büah khai. Tawkche achur kowi amatni kowh Kir-Hareset marow kri dow ta lat lowk tak chekhai. Naiawng rakowi iaiba ap mih siphai hawmh dow nami marow uang rumta lut hanow senah büah khai.<verse eid="2KI 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 3:26" />Moab pren mang dow aia sum mih tatuk hanow saidawng dowk mih siphai 700 ia hown Israel siphaiuüa pungmadawng iawng Edawm pren mang tut-e kowkowi kownkow sangkrang khai. Tawkche aia dow kownowng kowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 3:27" />Naiawng rakowi aia kung kowi kowh nata chowm mang kown mih achapa ta kowi pawla hanow marow tap luk kowi aia kowkowi khai, now achapa kowi dow tikah hanow aia changla phuchua khai. Naiawng rakowi Moabuüa kunmarau lai kowh Israeluüa kowi senah khai.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Naiawng rakowi Moabuüa kunmarau lai kowh Israeluüa kowi senah khai. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami laiklow dow Hebrai lai hown kowh arui uowi mih chim dowi chekhai.</char></note>Naiawng kowh Israeluüa dow nami marow hownia powt hanow amatni pren kowi plan büah khai bowt.<verse eid="2KI 3:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2KI 4" />
  <para style="s">Elisa kowh awdara lup</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 4:1" />Akat khe risiuüa kowh masi pungmadawng hownia mamaimow lowk ia mih Elisa tut-e kar se uang tek pe mih, “En kowh nar ang hua kowng khai bowt. Aia dow CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kram mih en tuk chekhai. Nachenganchepaw ang hua tut-e kakra uowi mih maru dow ang kowh chapa pre ia kowi pawla hanow nachangla nar kownkow kawmat uang khai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 4:2" />Nakhowk khe nami masiuüa kowi Elisa lüntaah mih, “Tawng iawng chow ang nowng khowng en kown? En kim kowi tawng chow uowi mih tek ang diah?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:2">Nami masiuüa klangah mih, “Palang chachow kowi kanrawn sau apalangchow klen kowi ang kowh dow tawngpaw uowi dowi chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 4:3" />Elisa tek pe mih, “En kowh kimping namkhetuüa tut-e kowkrawi kowi diah, now amatni hownia ia mowr ahuma kowkrawi lai tuikawng khaw diah. <verse eid="2KI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 4:4" />Nami kung kowi dow en chapa enni kim kowi kowkowi hanow büngta kim diah. Now palang hownia naiawngün tuikawng maten kowi lowkchow lowkchow tek pat chi klin pe kanrawn sau büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 4:5" />Naiawng rakowi nami masiuüa dow Elisa tek iawng chang khai. Aia dow achapa pre ia kowi nacham krawi lai tuikawng khaw kownkow cham chinah khai. Now achapauüa uang plan kung kowi dow büngta kim büah khai. Now achapa pre ia dow aia tut-e uang pawla pe tuikawng khaw khai, now aia dow naiawngün tuikawng khaw kowi aia kowh palang chah kowi kowh sau hawt klin khai. <verse eid="2KI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 4:6" />Tuikawng khaw maten tek bowk kung kowi aia tek pe achapa mih, “Uang pawla tuikawng khaw lowk diah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:6">Nakhowk khe achapa tek pe mih, “Lowkchow paw tuikawng khaw uowi dowi bowt,” pape khai. Nahanow palang chah hownia kowh sau uang kla mih dow taing khai bowt.<verse eid="2KI 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 4:7" />Nami kung kowi dow nami masiuüa mih Thurai maru Elisa tut-e uang hanow nami lawnguan uang tek pe khai. Nakhowk khe Elisa tek pe aia mih, “Kowmang now nami kanrawn sau cham sumah diah, now pela pekra diah. Nami klen kowi marat mih hown dow en chapa enni nowng sing tak kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel nadowi mih masiuüa kowh chapa kowi Elisa singah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 4:8" />Akat khe Elisa mih Sunem marow kowi kowkowi khai. Nakowi dow kurengma mih masiuüa uowi lowk ia. Nami masiuüa dow aia kim kowi natawi cha hawm kownkow Elisa kowi uang hawah rengreng chekhai. Nahanow Elisa dow kowtawi cha pe khai. Nami kung hownia now nakowi uang towng aia dow nami masiuüa kim kowi kowchala hawm reng chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 4:9" />Akung kowi nami masiuüa tek pe ahua mih, “Makowi kowh uang reng mih dow Thurai kowh chimsaima mih maru pami ang tuk. <verse eid="2KI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 4:10" />Chu, achi kowh anaima mih kimluk kowi aia vüi achi thawp pe towklak lowk diah sik. Now nakowi dow aia vüi sawlawnma lowk, pawitang lowk, chowm rah lowk, now <char style="w">maibu towngh</char> lowk achi tow pe diah sik. Nahanow achi tut-e aia uang khe nakowi aia naia uowi kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 4:11" />Akat khe Elisa mih nami marow kowi kowplan kowi khai. Nakhowk khe aia dow aluk kowi kowh towklak kowi kowiüa khai. <verse eid="2KI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 4:12" />Anar Gehazi kowi Elisa tek pe mih, “Paimi masiuüa kowi kowhaw diah,” pakhai. Now nami masiuüa dow Gehazi pur kowi uang iowng khai. <verse eid="2KI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 4:13" />Anar Gehazi kowi Elisa tek pe mih, “Nami masiuüa kowi maiawng tek pe diah, ‘Angching vüi lainowmma en kawm khowk. En vüi tawng chow angching nachang en kown? Mang tut-e lah, siphai aluchow tut-e lah en vüi kowi angching nakowtalawp en kown mih lawnguan uowi ne bow?’ pape diah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:13">Nami masiuüa tek pe mih, “Tawngpaw achang kla dowi. Ang tasin taken miuüa dow ang lakke mih srui pe ang reng chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 4:14" />Akung kowi Gehazi kowi Elisa lüntaah mih, “Nami masiuüa vüi tawng chow achi nachang pe kown?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:14">Nakhowk khe Gehazi klangah mih, “Aia kowh dow lowk iachow paw chapa uowi dowi chekhai, now ahua paw lawngtang khai bowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 4:15" />Akung kowi Elisa tek pe Gehazi mih, “Aia kowi kowhaw diah,” pakhai. Now Gehazi dow nami masiuüa kowi kowhaw hanow nami masiuüa mih kimplawt re-e uang iowng khai.<verse eid="2KI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 4:16" />Nakhowk khe nami masiuüa kowi Elisa tek pe mih, “Ning thowi kowh maiawng khin khe en naka chapa lowk ia kown,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:16">Nachenganchepaw nami masiuüa tek pe mih, “Aw chakramang, en dow Thurai kowh maru. Sakrauma hown hauang dai ang diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 4:17" />Tawkche pre sum la kung kowi dow nami masiuüa mih kum nau khai bowt. Now nami masiuüa dow Elisa tekla pe mih khin uang ting hanow pen chapa khai bowt.<verse eid="2KI 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 4:18" />Nami ngeuüa dow awr iuk awr sown khai bowt. Now akat khe aia dow a-pa tut-e kowkowi khai. Nakhowk khe a-pa dow laih kowi kowh ngen luprak miuüa tut-e chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 4:19" />Nami ngeuüa dow awr kar hu hanow tek pe a-pa mih, “Ang lu rau! Ang lu rau!” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:19">Nakhowk khe nar lowk ia kowi nami ngeuüa pa tek pe mih, “Nami ngeuüa kowi a-u tut-e kowpawla diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="2KI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 4:20" />Nami nar dow nami ngeuüa kowi a-u tut-e kowpawla khai, now a-u dow achapa kowi sat downg mowr paiah khai. Now nami ngeuüa dow kowng khai. <verse eid="2KI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 4:21" />Nami masiuüa dow achapa kowi mih Elisa kowh sawlawnma kowi kowiüaah khai. Now aia dow büngla pe kim hanow lawt khai.<verse eid="2KI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 4:22" />Aia dow ahua tut-e kowchin maru hanow krawi tek pe mih, “En mih kawmat mat nar lowk ia hai kawrngaramchük apum uang chin ang diah. Thurai maru tut-e alenma kowkowi hanow ang uang plan iawk kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 4:23" />Ahua krawi lüntaah mih, “Tawng rakowi chow aia tut-e ani en kowkowi kown? Ani dow Lacher pawi paw nadowi, now Tanai Ni paw nadowi,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:23">Amasi krawi tek pe mih, “Tawngpaw own dowi,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 4:24" />Nami kung kowi dow nami masiuüa mih kawrngaramchük luk kowi dau pe uan khai. Now anar kowi tek pe mih, “Kawrngaramchük kowi alenma pe mangah diah. Ang tek en dowi matchang mapaw hangkow naura ba,” pakhai. <verse eid="2KI 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 4:25" />Naiawng hai aia dow Karmel hungh kowi Thurai maru tut-e kowtowm khai bowt. Nami masiuüa alak sangrumchow reng tak khe Elisa haikhita khai. Nakhowk khe anar Gehazi kowi aia tek pe mih, “Pai iow, Sunem marow kowi kowh masiuüa! <verse eid="2KI 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 4:26" />Kowiowm hanow aia hown kowtakrum diah. Now aia kowi en nalüntaah kown mih, ‘En iung reng tak bow? En hua paw iung reng tak bow? Now en kowh chapa paw iung reng tak bow?’ pape diah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:26">Naiawng uang lüntaah khe Sunem marow hownia kowh masiuüa klangah mih, “Ow, iung bowk tak chow,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 4:27" />Tawkche Karmel hungh kowi Thurai maru tut-e aia uang ting khe dow krawng kowi uang tabawk krawm now dowk pe khawk khai. Nakhowk khe nami masiuüa kowi nalang sütta kownkow Gehazi uang khai. Nachenganchepaw Elisa tek pe Gehazi mih, “Nami masiuüa kowi hangkow hang diah. Aia dow lainowmma tuak kawm tuak krat khai. Tawkche nami lawnguan kowi tawngpaw CHAKRAMANG tek ang dowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 4:28" />Nakhowk khe nami masiuüa tek pe Elisa mih, “Aw ang kowh chakramang, ang lü en chapa bow? Now hauang dai ang pami paw ang tek en khowk nadowi bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 4:29" />Nami kung kowi Elisa tek pe Gehazi mih, “Kamrüt diah. Ang kowh raitua pawla hanow alenma nami masiuüa hown kowtawi diah. Tiama rawng kowi hang cham klangla maru; maru klang en chepaw hang cham klangla diah. Nami masiuüa kim kowi kowting hanow ang kowh raitua mih ngeuüa lumowr kowi kowtow pe diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 4:30" />Nakhowk khe nami ngeuüa u tek pe Elisa mih, “Masing CHAKRAMANG ming hai en ming lüklau se ang tek khowk, en che tawi dowi now mapaw ang mang kown nadowi,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi nami masiuüa hown dow Elisa kowtawi khai.<verse eid="2KI 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 4:31" />Nami takra kowi Gehazi dow alenma kowrik kowi hanow nami ngeuüa lumowr kowi Elisa kowh raitua kowtang pe khai. Nachenganchepaw nami ngeuüa mih chü paw chü dowi, now lai paw lai dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Gehazi dow Elisa hown kowtakrum kownkow kowplan khai. Now tek pe Elisa mih, “Paimi ngeuüa awr sing dowi tak,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 4:32" />Now Elisa dow nami masiuüa kim kowi uang ting hanow aia kowh towklak kowi kowkowi khai, now aia kowh sawlawnma kowi ngeuüa uak iüata hüah mih dow aia kowkhi khai. <verse eid="2KI 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 4:33" />Nakhowk khe aia malowkchow kowkup hanow aia uai büngta towklak khai, now CHAKRAMANG tut-e awr lü khowng khai. <verse eid="2KI 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 4:34" />Nami kung kowi dow nami ngeuüa uak luk kowi kowtamaw hanow nawr kowh nawr, mik kowh mik hai rut kowh rut aia tungah khai. Nahanow nami ngeuüa kowh dow pik uang den khai bowt. <verse eid="2KI 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 4:35" />Nami kung kowi dow aia awr rü hanow towklak kowi aia krawi len khai. Now nami ngeuüa luk kowi aia kowplan tamaw khai iawk. Nakhowk khe dow nami ngeuüa mih awr sik ranit kat hanow awr kü mik khai bowt.<verse eid="2KI 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 4:36" />Nakhowk khe Gehazi kowi hawah now Elisa tek pe mih, “Mami ngeuüa u kowi kowhaw bowt,” pakhai. Now Gehazi dow nami ngeuüa u kowi kowhaw khai. Nami masiuüa uang ting khe Elisa tek pe mih, “En kowh chapa kowi pawla bowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="2KI 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 4:37" />Nami masiuüa dow kim lak kowi uang kup hanow Elisa kowi uang dowk pe khawk khai, now krawng kowi tabawk krawm se chupah khai. Nami kung kowi dow pawla chapa hanow aia lawt khai bowt.<verse eid="2KI 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akru uowima mih kan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 4:38" />Nami kung kowi dow Elisa mih Gilgal marow kowi kowplan khai. Nakhowk khe nakowi mih khown kuak thüm chekhai. Akat khe risiuüa dow aia pur kowi chowm hanow aia kowh laiklow sünta khai. Nakhowk khe anar kowi Elisa tek pe mih, “Risiuüa vüi puh mangtara hown koweng pe kan dit,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2KI 4:39" />Nakhowk khe risiuüa pungmadawng hownia risi lowk mih dowm kowi nakrawi lek pramna kownkow tarü khai, now aia dow kowkhi tingtua rui khai. Now auih dow ahuma klekla hanow aia uang thupla khai. Now naiawngün dow rawah hanow puh hown aia engah khai. Tawkche naiawngün dow akru uowima pami aia tuk dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="2KI 4:40" />Now risiuüa kowi nape chaah kownkow nami kan uang then pe khai. Nachenganchepaw risiuüa uown cha hanow kar se amatni tek mih, “Aw Thurai maru, mami kan dow akruma le!” pabüah khai. Naiawng rakowi nami kan dow amatni nowng cha dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2KI 4:41" />Nakhowk khe Elisa tek mih, “Uang pawla kawmdi sangrum diah,” pakhai. Now nami kawmdi mih puh kowi iu pruiah hanow aia tek mih, “Mami kan mih ang iungta khowk; enni naia cha kown towbowt,” pakhai. Nami kung kowi dow puh kowi mih piakla pat mih akru uowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maru iun 100 ia kowi Elisa pe chaah chakkham mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2KI 4:42" />Akat khe Baal-Salisa marow kowi kowh uowi mih maru lowk ia dow Elisa tut-e uang khai. Aia dow rik ngenah mih iakmow hown kowh kawmpah awp ia pirmi pah hai luprak sar sangrum Elisa vüi uang pawla pe khai. Nakhowk khe anar kowi Elisa tek pe mih, “Naiawngün chakkham risiuüa kowi pe chaah diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2KI 4:43" />Nakhowk khe anar tek pe Elisa mih, “Maru iun 100 ia kowi makhowtchow mih chakkham tawng iawng chow nalawk kown?” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:43">Nachenganchepaw Elisa klangah mih, “Risiuüa kowi nami pe chaah diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow risiuüa chak kung kowi paw namarat sangrum tak kown mih CHAKRAMANG tek khowk chekhai,” pape khai. <verse eid="2KI 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="2KI 4:44" />Naiawng rakowi Elisa kowh nar mih risiuüa pur kowi nami chakkham uang then pe khai. Now CHAKRAMANG tek iawng risiuüa ki cha bowk kung kowi paw nami chakkham mih ta lat sangrum tak chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2KI 5" />
  <para style="s">Naman kowh par rawka iung mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 5:1" />Naman dow Siria pren mang kowh siphai aluchow chekhai. Aia dow mang tut-e kri kraingma hai ringkawra uowima mih maru chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Siria siphaiuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG pe awngah mih dow Naman rakowi chekhai. Aia dow tasen kiakma. Tawkche aia kowh dow par rawka uowi chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 5:2" />Akat khe Siria siphaiuüa mih Israeluüa kowi uang senah khai. Nakhowk khe amatni dow Israel masiuüa ngeuüa kowi khümla lowk ia khai. Nami masiuüa ngeuüa dow Naman masi kowh narma uang chowng khai. <verse eid="2KI 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 5:3" />Akat khe Naman masi kowi nami masiuüa ngeuüa tek pe mih, “Samari marow kowi kowh risi hown ang kowh chakramang kowtakrum akat e naiung kown. Nahanow aia kowh par rawka mih nami risi naiungta pe kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 5:4" />Israel pren hownia kowh nami masiuüa ngeuüa kowh laiklow mih Naman kowtek pe mang khai. <verse eid="2KI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 5:5" />Nakhowk khe mang tek pe mih, “Kowkowi bowt. Israeluüa kowh pren mang vüi ang krawi sak en chasak lowk sow,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi Naman dow tai 340 set, kuh 65 set hai tawnguat 10 theng pawla hanow tarü khai bowt. <verse eid="2KI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 5:6" />Israel mang vüi kowi krawi sak pe mih cha kowi arui uowi mih, “Mami chasak dow ang kowh siphai aluchow Naman hown en tut-e uang krawi sa en khai. Aia kowh par rawka mih en iungta pe diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 5:7" />Israel mang dow nami chasak phatta hanow aia kowh tawnguat mih thekah khai. Now aia tek mih, “Ang Thurai chekhai bow? Maru kowh asak napaw kown mih hai nape kown mih nowng changra ang kowh uowi khai bow? Tawngplawng kowchow par rawka uowi mih maru kowi naiungta kownkow Siria pren mang ang tut-e uang tuk chin khai? Aia dow uang hau ran kownkow sangkrang mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 5:8" />Naiawng Israel mang thek tawnguat mih lawnguan dow Thurai maru Elisa tawi ta khai. Naiawng rakowi mang kowi Elisa krawi tek pe mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow en tuk thek tawnguat khai? Nami maru kowi ang tut-e uang chinah diah. Nahanow Israel pren kowi risi uowi lowk ia pami aia natuk kown towbowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="2KI 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 5:9" />Naiawng rakowi Naman dow aia kowh kawrnga kari maten hai kawrnga ün pawla hanow Elisa tut-e kowkowi khai, now kimplawt re-e aia kowiowng khai. <verse eid="2KI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 5:10" />Nakhowk khe Elisa mih prang kowi Naman tut-e kowchin maru lowk ia hanow krawi tek pe mih, “Jawrdan aw kowi kowlu ranit kat diah. Nahanow en kowh par rawka naiung kown towbowt, now en nachimsai kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 5:11" />Nachenganchepaw Naman dow kunmarau lai kowh nami hownia powt khai. Aia tek mih, “Ang ka tuak mih dow prang kowi aia uang lawt hanow ang tut-e nauang kown. Now ang kowh par rawka phaw mih rah maten kowi nakrawi ham ang rut hanow ang vüi kowi CHAKRAMANG tut-e naawr lü kown mih chowdiah. <verse eid="2KI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 5:12" />Israel pren kowi kowh aw maten lak-e Damaska marow kowi kowh Abana hai Farpar aw lang iung tak. Abana hai Farpar aw kowi lu hanow ang nowng tasia tasau dowi tham ü?” pakhai. Naiawng aia tekla hanow atawm kunmarau aia plan khai bowt.<verse eid="2KI 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 5:13" />Nakhowk khe anaruüa mih aia re-e uangah hanow uang tek pe mih, “Chakramang, paimi risi che akratma mih lup pe chang en e dow en chang dowi tham ü? Nachenganchepaw en kowh par rawka naiungla kownkow kowlu kown mih chowtaih aia tek en. Naiawng rakowi en kowlü mih lang iung kown nadowi ü?” pabüah khai. <verse eid="2KI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 5:14" />Naiawng rakowi Thurai maru Elisa laiklow iawng Naman mih Jawrdan aw kowi kowtamir ranit kat khai. Nahanow aia kowh par rawka dow iung khai bowt, now aia kowh pik dow ngeuüa kowh pik iawng uang klangiung khai bowt.<verse eid="2KI 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 5:15" />Nami kung kowi dow Naman hai aia kowh maru-uüa maten mih Thurai maru tut-e kowplan khai iawk. Now Elisa pur kowi uang iowngah hanow Naman tek mih, “Palusama kowi Israeluüa kowh Thurai klen kowi akeng mih Thurai lang uowi dowi bowt mih kawmat dow ang tuk khowk. Naiawng rakowi sakrauma hown ang uang pawla en mih awmrawm sung kawmat paw ang diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 5:16" />Nachenganchepaw risi klangah mih, “Ang chang pe lup mih masing CHAKRAMANG ming lüklau se ang tek khowk, tawng iawng mih awmrawm sung paw ang paw en kown nadowi tham,” pakhai. Naman tek pe rengreng chepaw Elisa mih tawng iawng mih uanh paw paw pe kown nau dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 5:17" />Nami kung kowi Naman tek pe mih, “Tawngpaw en paw ang dowi chepaw sakrauma hown mami pren hownia pe pawla ang bawn diah. Kawrngaramchük pre pum nowng pawla mowrchow taih ang napawla kown. Nahanow Israel pren hownia kowh mami bawn hown ang nathawp phuchuara lowk kown. Khaleng hownia bowt now CHAKRAMANG klen kowi akeng mih thurai tut-e tikah mih uanap hai akeng mih uanap ang phuchua kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="2KI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 5:18" />Tawkche ang kowi CHAKRAMANG alawt takla mih sia uowi pachap. Ang kowh mangkri dow Rimawn thurai chup kim kowi kowkowi hanow krawng kowi tabawk se Rimawn thurai kowi kowchup reng chekhai. Naiawng aia tabawk khe ang paw tawi tabawk takla reng. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia tabawk mih khin khe ang tawi dowkah reng chekhai. Nami lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG pacham lawt ang lah,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lawpha rakowi Gehazi ka piati mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19-20" style="v" sid="2KI 5:19-20" />Elisa tek pe Naman mih, “Saktuak thaulangma hown kowmang towbowt,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 5:19-20">Nahanow Naman dow mang khai bowt. Naman cham ting sangrumchow taih tak khe Thurai maru Elisa kowh nar Gehazi sakdawng kowi tatek mih, “Aram chenchap Naman uang pawla mih uanh tawngpaw paw pe dowi kowi ang kowh chakramang pe mangta khai. Naiawng rakowi masing CHAKRAMANG ming lüklau se ang tek khowk, aia kung kowi ang nakawikrawi hanow aia hownia ang nakrawi paw uanh sangrum kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 5:19-20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 5:21" />Nahanow Gehazi dow Naman kung kowi krawi ta iowm khai. Naiawng Gehazi uang iowm mih khita hanow aia hown nauang takrum kownkow Naman mih kawrnga kari hownia iu dowm khai. Nakhowk khe Gehazi kowi Naman lüntaah mih, “Tawng chowdiah chow?” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 5:22" />Nakhowk khe Gehazi klangah mih, “Tawngpaw na dowi. Tawkchedow kawmat mih Efraim hungma mawngma süng hownia ang kowh chakramang tut-e risi klanguüa uang pre ia. Nami klanguüa kowi napeah kownkow tai 30 set ngia hai tawnguat pre theng en tut-e nauang paw kownkow aia uang chin ang mih chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 5:23" />Nakhowk khe Naman tek pe mih, “30 setchow ü? 60 set mih pawla bowk bowt,” pakhai. Naiawng hai tai maten napawla bowk kown mih Gehazi kowi Naman tek pe rengreng chekhai. Now aia dow Gehazi kowi tai 60 set mih im pre buk kowi krawi phang pe khai. Now tawnguat paw aia krawi pe pe pre theng khai. Now naiawngün dow anar pre ia rut kowi Naman appe khai. Nahanow aia kowh nar pre ia dow Gehazi pur kowi naiawngün uanh rik kawtla khai. <verse eid="2KI 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 5:24" />Now Elisa uowi rah hungh re-e uang ting mih khin khe dow Gehazi mih nami nar pre ia tut-e kowh im pawta khai bowt, now naiawngün dow aia kim kowi kowpawla khai. Nami kung kowi dow Naman kowh nar pre ia kowi aia pe mangta khai bowt.<verse eid="2KI 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 5:25" />Nami kung kowi dow Elisa kim kowi aia kowkowi khai. Nakhowk khe Elisa lüntaah mih, “Gehazi, tawng kowi chow en cham kowi?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 5:25">Gehazi klangah mih, “Tawng kowi paw ang cham kowi dowi da,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 5:26" />Tawkche Elisa tek pe mih, “En hown nauang takrum kownkow kawrnga kari hownia Naman iu dowm khe nakowi ang kowh lümla tawi uowi mih en tuk dowi bow? Tangka pawisa, khupdip tawngklai, kanrawn khang, grep krum, chia, ruapur, rua hai narla narma en napaw kown mih tataing dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 5:27" />Naiawng rakowi Naman kowh par rawka mih chowngchowng saksakma en hai en krungchakuüa tut-e pacham phaw lah,” pakhai. Now Elisa pur hownia powt hanow Gehazi kowh dow par rawka phaw kowh nangkhe iawng pik akawma phaw khai.<verse eid="2KI 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2KI 6" />
  <para style="s">Marek awr tapowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 6:1" />Akat khe risiuüa tek pe Elisa mih, “Anging kowh kim dow lainowmma sowm chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 6:2" />Jawrdan aw kowi pe kowi anging diah, now nakowi mih lowk ia e lowk chi anging nakrawi tu kimchüng kown. Nahanow anging nathawp kim sar lowk kown,” pabüah khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:2">Elisa klangah mih, “Naiawng now tarü büah bowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 6:3" />Nakhowk khe amatni pungmadawng hownia maru lowk ia tek pe Elisa mih, “Sakrauma hai en kowh naruüa hown en matia paw tawi diah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:3">Now Elisa klangah mih, “Ow, tawi kown taih,” pape khai. <verse eid="2KI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 6:4" />Nahanow Elisa dow amatni hown kowtawi khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:4">Amatni dow Jawrdan aw kowi kowting hanow krawi tu kimchüng büah khai. <verse eid="2KI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 6:5" />Nachenganchepaw lowk ia mih kowh dow krip singh thüm khe apung hownia marek taplet chuak hanow tui kowi dowta khai. Naiawng rakowi kar se aia tek mih, “Uh, ang kowh chakramang, nami dow ang cham laila mih marek chekhai le,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 6:6" />Nakhowk khe Thurai maru Elisa lüntaah mih, “Tawng mih re-e chow nami marek cham dowh?” pakhai. Now nami maru mih aia kowh marek dowra Elisa kowi tüng pe khai. Now Elisa dow tu müa lowk hanow marek dowra re-e iu hürah khai. Nahanow nami marek dow awr tapowng khai. <verse eid="2KI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 6:7" />Nakhowk khe nami maru kowi Elisa tek pe mih, “Kowpaw bowt,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi nami maru mih haiiaw rut hanow haipaw marek khai bowt.<verse eid="2KI 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siria pren kowi kowh siphaiuüa mikdu mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 6:8" />Akat khe Siria pren mang dow Israeluüa hown tasen thüm chekhai. Nakhowk khe aia dow aia kowh prengia pek miuüa hown talawp talai khai. Now tawng mih arah re-e chow nakrawi chang tangbung khupra kown mih amatni kowi aia tek pe khai.<verse eid="2KI 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 6:9" />Nachenganchepaw nami khin khe Israel mang kowi maiawng hai Thurai maru krawi peah satang khai, “Kaneu ba, nami arah kowi hangkow kowi büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Siria siphaiuüa dow nami arah kowi kowtarü thüm khowk,” pakhai. <verse eid="2KI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 6:10" />Naiawng rakowi Israel mang dow Thurai maru Elisa tekah mih arah kowi kowchin maru hanow nakowi kowh maru-uüa nauowi kaneu kownkow krawi tek pe khai. Naiawng hai mang dow kowmatia kowi aplan aplan ia talawng khai.<verse eid="2KI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 6:11" />Nami lawnguan kowi Siria pren mang mih lainowmma kunmarau khai. Aia kowh siphai aluchowuüa kowi hawah hanow aia tek pe mih, “Ang kowh sangkrangra Israel mang kowi mia chow kowtek pe? Naiawng mih lup a-i pungmadawng hownia mia chow chang mih tek ang büa madiah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 6:12" />Nakhowk khe siphai aluchowuüa pungmadawng hownia lowk ia mih tek pe mang mih, “Aw mangkri, a-i pungmadawng hownia miapaw na dowi chekhai. Israeluüa kowh risi Elisa dow en kowh mawk rah towklak kowi kowh en tekah mih laiklow khowm Israel mang kowi nowng tek pe bowk chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 6:13" />Nakhowk khe mang lawt ana mih, “Tawng kowi chow aia uowi mih kowkrawi cham büa diah. Enni krawi ka cham kung kowi ang uang krawi chin maru hanow aia kowi ang nauang krawi khüm sow,” pakhai. Akung kowi dow Dothan marow kowi Elisa uowi mih satang Siria pren mang kowi maru uang tek pe khai. <verse eid="2KI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 6:14" />Naiawng rakowi mang dow kawrnga hai kawrnga kari hailawm siphaiuüa akawmma kowi Dothan marow kowi kowchinah khai. Now amatni dow iak-e kowtowm hanow marow mih krawi umta lut khai.<verse eid="2KI 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 6:15" />Now auai rau dow Thurai maru kowh nar mih murpa awr rü hanow prang kowi cham lawt khai. Nakhowk khe kawrnga hai kawrnga kari hown siphaiuüa umta marow lut mih aia khi khai. Nakhowk khe Elisa kowi anar tek pe mih, “Uh, ang kowh chakramang, tawng chow achi nachangah kown?” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 6:16" />Elisa klangah mih, “Kaah kram dowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni lak-e achi kowh maru iun lang kawm chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 6:17" />Nami kung kowi Elisa chup Thurai mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, nowng khila kownkow ang kowh nar kowi en pe khi-ah diah,” pakhai. Nahanow CHAKRAMANG dow nami nar kowi iu pe khi-ah khai. Now nami nar dow Elisa riaret kowi kowh tapat lut mih hungh kowi maih kawrnga kari hai kawrnga tek mup uowi mih khi khai.<verse eid="2KI 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 6:18" />Nasenah kownkow Siria siphaiuüa uang tatawn mih khin khe CHAKRAMANG tut-e Elisa awr lü mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, sakrauma hown maiawngün maru-uüa kowi duta pe mik diah,” pakhai. Elisa awr lüah mih iawng CHAKRAMANG dow amatni kowi duta pe mik khai.<verse eid="2KI 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 6:19" />Nami kung kowi dow amatni tut-e kowkowiah hanow Elisa tek pe mih, “Enni uang mih dow tiama tawima, now marow paw enni krawi chamah mih nadowi chekhai. Ang kung phai uang krawi büa diah. Enni krawi chamah mih maru tut-e ang kowpawla enni sow,” pakhai. Nahanow naiawngün maru-uüa kowi mih Samari marow kowi Elisa kowpawla khai.<verse eid="2KI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 6:20" />Now Samari marow kowi amatni kowkup kung kowi Elisa chup Thurai mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, amatni naia khila iawk kownkow amatni kowi pe khi-ah iawk diah,” pakhai. Nahanow naiawngün maru-uüa kowi dow CHAKRAMANG pe khi-ah khai. Now amatni dow Samari marow lak kowi uowi mih tatuk büah khai bowt.<verse eid="2KI 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 6:21" />Naiawngün maru-uüa kowi khita hanow Israel mang tek pe Elisa mih, “Chakramang, kowbüah kowi ang saita ü?” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 6:22" />Nakhowk khe Elisa klangah mih, “Kowbüah kowi hangkow sai diah. Tasenra hownia kowh en uang khümla miuüa kowi en saiah iawk kown ü? Amatni kowi pe cha pe khamah now amatni kowh mangkri tut-e pe mangta diah,” pape khai. <verse eid="2KI 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 6:23" />Naiawng rakowi Israel mang dow naiawngün maru-uüa vüi pawi aiukma chang lowk khai. Now ki cha ki kham kung kowi dow amatni kowi aia pe mangta khai bowt, now amatni dow amatni kowh mangkri tut-e plan büah khai bowt. Nami kung hownia now Siria siphaiuüa mih Israeluüa pren kowi katpaw uang krawi rup uanh dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samari marow kowi Ben-Hadad senah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 6:24" />Nami kung kowi Siria pren mang Ben-Hadad dow aia kowh siphaiuüa maten kowi kuaah lawmah khai. Now amatni dow kowkowi hanow Samari marow mih krawi umta lut khai. <verse eid="2KI 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 6:25" />Amatni dow marow mih akrama kowrumta hüah khai. Naiawng rakowi Samari marow kowi dow chakkham khowk bowk khowk chekhai. Nami khin khe kawrngaramchük lu lowkchow kowi khowm padow tai 80 iun hown sumah khai, now kimtawn uatur kih apua kowi tai tanga iun hown sumah khai.<verse eid="2KI 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 6:26" />Akat khe Israel mang mih marow tap luk kowi kowlen khai. Nakhowk khe kar se masiuüa lowk ia tek pe mih, “Aw ang kowh mangkri, khowng ang diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 6:27" />Mangkri klangah mih, “CHAKRAMANG che uang khowng en dowi bowt hanow tawng iawng chow ang khowng en bowt kown? Ang kowh dow napela en kown mih püm lah, grep lah tawngpaw uowi dowi bowt chekhai,” pape khai. <verse eid="2KI 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 6:28" />Nami kung kowi mangkri lüntaah mih, “Tawng chow en own?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:28">Nami masiuüa tek pe mih, “Mani khe masiuüa lowk ia tek ang mih, ‘Chu, ani dow en kowh chapa kowi achi cha lah. Now tharau dow ang kowh chapa kowi achi nacha kown,’ pah ang khai. <verse eid="2KI 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 6:29" />Naiawng rakowi ang kowh chapa kowi engah hanow anging chata khai. Now auai ni khe dow nami masiuüa kowi ang tek pe mih, ‘Khaleng dow en kowh chapa kowi achi cha bowt lah,’ pakhai. Tawkche aia dow achapa kowi cham petta khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 6:30" />Nami masiuüa kowh laiklow tata hanow mang dow aia kowh tawnguat thekah khai. Nakhowk khe aia uowila uiting uangtak rakowi kowrmow dak kowi khupla sala uan mih maru kawmuüa khi khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawng thek kowrmow mih khin khe paw aia dow tap luk kowi len reng tak chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 6:31" />Mang tek mih, “Safat chapa Elisa kowh lu che ani ang kowdungta pe dowi hanow CHAKRAMANG mih rip chamang pacham rip ang lah!” pakhai. <verse eid="2KI 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 6:32" />Now mang dow Elisa kowi nakowpaw kownkow kowchin maru lowk ia khai. Nakhowk khe Elisa dow lawngtang aluchowuüa hown aia kim kowi hawt talawp talai khai. Nachenganchepaw nami maru uang ting dowi tak khe lawngtang aluchowuüa kowi Elisa tek pe mih, “Sai maru sak mih lowk ia dow nauang dung ang lu kownkow uang chin maru lowk ia khowk. Sünta büa diah, nami maru uang ting khowk hanow enni nabüngta pe kim kown. Aia kowi dow enni nape kupah kown nadowi. Mangkri paw nami maru kung kowi uang tawi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 6:33" />Elisa tek lai reng tak khe mang dow uang ting khai bowt. Now mang tek mih, “Mami phih dow CHAKRAMANG hownia kowh uang ting mih chekhai. Nami kowi tawngplawng kowchow CHAKRAMANG kowi ang nahawt chawng bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 6:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2KI 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 7:1" />Nakhowk khe Elisa klangah mih, “CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow sünta büa diah. Aia tek mih maiawng: Tharau kowh mami khin khe Samari marow tapplawt kowi kowh chi kowi tai paiunchow hown kawmdi lang iung mih taruk set, now iakmow laipre set kowi paw tai paiunchow hown naka kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 7:2" />Mang kowh maru iukuüa kowi kowh lang kri mih tek pe Thurai maru mih, “Ang owm dowi. Mukuang CHAKRAMANG iu pe luprak ahuma khowm padow naiawng naphaw kown nadowi,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 7:2">Nachenganchepaw Elisa klangah mih, “Naiawng phaw mih en matia mik hown en khila kown. Tawkche tawngpaw en naka chala kown nadowi,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siria siphaiuüa cham powt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 7:3" />Nami khin khe Samari marow tapplawt kowi par rawka phaw mih maru uowi tali ia chekhai. Lowkkowlowk amatni tatek mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow kowng pat makowi a-i nachowm kown? <verse eid="2KI 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 7:4" />Marow lak kowi a-i kowkowi chepaw akhawr hown a-i nakowng kown taih. Now makowi a-i uowi rengreng chepaw a-i nakowng kown taih. Naiawng rakowi chu, Siria siphaiuüa kowh tangbung khupra kowi phai a-i kowkowi diah sik. Amatni che kowngta a-i khai hanow a-i nakowng kown. Nachenganchepaw amatni che pe sing a-i khai hanow a-i nasing kown taih,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="2KI 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 7:5" />Naiawng rakowi amatni dow sat kup khe Siria siphaiuüa kowh tangbung khupra kowi kowkowi khai. Tawkche tangbung khupra rihi kowi amatni kowtowm khe nakowi mih miapaw uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 7:6" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG dow Siria siphaiuüa kowi mih kawrnga kari hai kawrnga hown aiukma mih siphai thumchak uang tarü tasen mih klow iawng chang pe khai. Nami tata hanow Siria siphaiuüa tatek mih, “Israel mang mih Hituüa kowh mang hai Aigupta pren manguüa kowi uang ngala hanow uang sen a-i mih chowbowt,” pabüah khai. <verse eid="2KI 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 7:7" />Naiawng rakowi amatni dow nami ni sat kowi khe kram kowng kowh cham powt büah khai. Nakhowk khe amatni dow amatni kowh tangbung, kawrnga hai kawrngaramchük ün ta towla hüah khai, now amatni kowh tangbung khupra paw aiawng uowi iawng ta towla hüah khai.<verse eid="2KI 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 7:8" />Nami maru tali ia dow tangbung khupra rihi kowi kowting hanow lowk mih tangbung kowi kowkup khai. Now amatni dow nakowi cha büah kham büah khai, now kuh, tai hai dawnguan ün pawla hanow cham petah büah khai. Nami kung kowi dow uang plan büah hanow akeng mih tangbung kowi kowkup büah khai, now pawla uanh sangrum hanow cham petah büah khai. <verse eid="2KI 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 7:9" />Nami kung kowi lowkkowlowk kowi amatni tatek mih, “Maiawng a-i chang mih taka dowi chaw. Ani dow a-i vüi satang iung chekhai. Tawkche mia kowi paw a-i cham krawi phuang pe dowi tak. Naiawng hai uar thowi dowi rawn che a-i krawi phuang dowi hanow a-i naka ripra kown chekhai. Naiawng rakowi chu, kawmat mat kowkowi hanow mang kimchakuüa kowi a-i kowphuang pe diah sik,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="2KI 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 7:10" />Naiawng rakowi amatni dow Samari marow kowi uang plan hanow marow tapplawt chawng miuüa kowi hawah khai. Now amatni tek pe mih, “Siria siphaiuüa kowh tangbung khupra kowi anging kowkowi chowdiah. Tawkche nakowi dow amiapaw uowi dowi, now maru klow paw uowi dowi chekhai. Tawkche kawrnga hai kawrngaramchük ün dow ta takhuowk hüah chekhai, now tangbung ün paw aiawng uowi iawng ta takhup hüah chekhai,” pabüah khai. <verse eid="2KI 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 7:11" />Nahanow marow tapplawt chawng miuüa dow marowchakuüa kowi nami satang phuang pe khai, now mang kimchakuüa kowi paw phuangla pe khai.<verse eid="2KI 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 7:12" />Nami satang tata hown krowksang uariiu reng tak chepaw mang dow awr rü khai. Now aia kowh maru iukuüa kowi aia tek pe mih, “A-i vüi kowi kowh Siria siphaiuüa sangkrangta mih ang tek a-i sow. Akhawr hown a-i uowi mih dow amatni aiawng tuk. Naiawng rakowi tangbung khupra hownia lawt hanow dowm kowi cham tapet büah khai. Amatni ka tuak mih dow nakrawi cham chakkham kownkow marow hownia a-i lawt khe asing nakhüm a-i hanow napawta a-i marow kown mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 7:13" />Nakhowk khe aia kowh maru iuk lowk ia tek pe mih, “A-i Israeluüa dow akhawr hown kowng sangrum khowk. Now kawmat kowh a-i ta sing uowi miuüa paw nakowng kown taih. Naiawng rakowi ta sing mih kawrnga tanga pum hown kowkrawi chin maru pre sum ia diah. Nahanow tawng chow own mih a-i natuk kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 7:14" />Naiawng rakowi maru iukuüa dow rui kawrnga kari pre buk khai. Now Siria siphaiuüa tawng chow own mih nakrawi mü kownkow kawrnga kari pre buk hown siphaiuüa kowi mang kowchinah khai. <verse eid="2KI 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 7:15" />Nahanow amatni dow Jawrdan aw mowr kowkrawi cham Siria siphaiuüa khai. Now sakkrowng sakkrangma hown Siria siphaiuüa powt khe kowh patiama rawng kowi ta kuakla mih tawnguat hai uanh maten dow krawi khi büah khai. Now naiawngün maru-uüa dow uang plan hanow naiawngün lawnguan maten mang kowi uang tek pe khai. <verse eid="2KI 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 7:16" />Now Samari marow kowi kowh maru kawmuüa dow lawt hanow Siria siphaiuüa kowh tangbung khupra kowi kowkowi khai, now nakowi kowh uowi mih maten dow amatni uang pawla khai. Nahanow CHAKRAMANG laiklow iawng tai paiunchow hown kawmdi lang iung mih taruk set, now iakmow laipre set kowi paw tai paiunchow sumah khai.<verse eid="2KI 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 7:17" />Maru iukuüa kowi kowh lang kri mih dow Samari marow tapplawt naming nakhet kown mih kurdik alai hownia ka mih chekhai. Tawkche akung kowi marow hownia maru kawmuüa lawt mih khin khe aia kowi dow thuala nak khai, now aia dow kowng khai. Naiawng aia kowng mih dow Thurai maru Elisa kim kowi mang uang khe kowh mang kowi Elisa tek pe iawng phaw mih chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 7:18" />Nakhowk khe kowh Elisa tek mih, “Tharau kowh mami khin khe Samari marow tapplawt kowi kowh chi kowi tai paiunchow hown kawmdi lang iung mih taruk set, now iakmow laipre set kowi paw tai paiunchow hown naka kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="2KI 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 7:19" />Nakhowk khe maru iukuüa kowi kowh lang kri mih tek pe Thurai maru mih, “Ang owm dowi. Mukuang CHAKRAMANG iu pe luprak ahuma khowm padow naiawng naphaw kown nadowi,” pakhai. Nachenganchepaw Elisa klangah mih, “Naiawng phaw mih en matia mik hown en khila kown. Tawkche tawngpaw en naka chala kown nadowi,” pape khai. <verse eid="2KI 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 7:20" />Now naiawng dow aia luk kowi uang phaw khai bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow mang kowh akhowng mih kowi dow marow tapplawt re-e maru kawmuüa thuala nak kowh kowng khai.<verse eid="2KI 7:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2KI 8" />
  <para style="s">Sunem marow kowi kowh masiuüa plan kata kim üa mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 8:1" />Aia sing pe chapa mih masiuüa kowi kowh Elisa tek pe mih, “En kowh kimchakuüa kowi pawla hanow akeng mih arah kowi cham uowi diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG mih mami pren kowi khown nauang pe klaah kown chekhai. Nami khown dow ranit ning mowr nauowi kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="2KI 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 8:2" />Naiawng rakowi nami masiuüa dow Thurai maru Elisa tek iawng chang khai. Aia dow aia kimchakuüa hown nami hownia lawt hanow Filistinuüa pren kowi ranit ning mowr kowuowi khai.<verse eid="2KI 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 8:3" />Ranit ning kung kowi dow Filistinuüa pren hownia aia uang plan khai bowt. Now aia kowh kim üa naplan ka iawk kownkow kowkowiah hanow mang tut-e aia kowlü khai. <verse eid="2KI 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 8:4" />Nakowi aia kowting mih khin khe mang dow Thurai maru kowh nar Gehazi hown hawt talawp thüm chekhai. Mangkri tek pe Gehazi mih, “Elisa changah mih awdara lup maten tek ang diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="2KI 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 8:5" />Now Gehazi dow Sunem marow kowi kowh masiuüa kowh chapa kowi Elisa sing pe mih lawnguan mang kowi lawp pe khai. Naiawng lawp pe thüm khe nami masiuüa dow aia kowh kim üa naplan ka iawk kownkow mang tut-e uang towm khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:5">Nakhowk khe Gehazi tek pe mang mih, “Aw ang kowh mangkri, mami chowbowt nami masiuüa, now mami chowbowt Elisa singah mih ngeuüa,” pakhai. <verse eid="2KI 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 8:6" />Nami lawnguan kowi mangkri lüntaah hanow nami masiuüa tek pe bowk khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:6">Naiawng rakowi mang dow aia kowh maru iuk lowk ia kowi hawah hanow tek pe mih, “Nami masiuüa kowh dawngthawnguan maten aia kowi planta pe bowk diah. Nami klen kowi akeng kowi aia cham uowi ranit ning khe kowh aia krawng bawn hownia ta kaah mih luprak sung paw aia kowi peah diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang Hazael rut kowi mang Ben-Hadad kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 8:7" />Akat khe Elisa dow Siria pren kowi kowh marow kri Damaska kowi kowkowi khai. Nakhowk khe Siria pren mang Ben-Hadad dow arau uowi khai. Now aia kowi aia kowh maru iukuüa tek pe mih, “Thurai maru uang,” pakhai. <verse eid="2KI 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 8:8" />Nakhowk khe aia kowh maru iuk Hazael kowi mang tek pe mih, “Pawla awmrawm sung hanow Thurai maru hown kowtakrum diah. Now mami ang kowh arau iung chünchü mih CHAKRAMANG tut-e aia kowi pe lüntaah madiah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 8:9" />Naiawng rakowi Hazael dow Elisa vüi Damaska marow kowi kowh aiung aiungma mih uanh chap maten krawi pawah khai, now naiawngün uanh maten mih ut 40 pum luk kowi tangla hanow Elisa hown nakowtakrum kownkow kowkowi khai. Now kowtakrum mih khin khe aia tek pe Elisa mih, “Siria pren mang en kowh nar Ben-Hadad kowh arau naiung kown chünchü mih nauang lünta en kownkow aia uang chin ang mih chowdiah chaw,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 8:10" />Nakhowk khe Elisa klangah mih, “Aia dow naiung ngengche kown taih pami kowtek pe diah. Nachenganchepaw aia dow nakowng ngengche kown mih CHAKRAMANG tek ang khai,” pape khai. <verse eid="2KI 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 8:11" />Nami kung kowi dow Hazael rukrai pat amik sang Elisa müah khai. Now Thurai maru Elisa mih kar khai.<verse eid="2KI 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 8:12" />Nakhowk khe Hazael lüntaah mih, “Chakramang, tawngplawng kowchow en kar khai?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:12">Elisa klangah mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow panow Israeluüa kowi en nachangah angak kown mih ang aiawng tuk. Amatni kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim dow en natowkta pe kown, amatni kowh klanguüa hawmh kowi en nasaita pe kown, amatni kowh ngeuüa hawmh kowi dow en natheuta pe kown, now amatni kowh kum nau mih masiuüa hawmh kowi en nakhuekta pe mu kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 8:13" />Hazael klangah mih, “Ang dow kui iawng asung uowi dowi mih maru chowtaih. Tawng iawng chow naiawng khowt mih kri kraingma mih lup ang nachang kown?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:13">Elisa tek pe mih, “Siria pren mang en nachowng kown mih CHAKRAMANG rik tek ang khowk chekhai,” pape khai. <verse eid="2KI 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 8:14" />Nami kung kowi Elisa hownia powt hanow aia kowh mangkri tut-e Hazael kowplan khai bowt. Nakhowk khe mang Ben-Hadad hawt lüntaah mih, “Tawng chow Elisa hawt tek en?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:14">Hazael klangah mih, “En kowh arau naiung ngengche kown mih aia hawt tek ang khai,” pape khai. <verse eid="2KI 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 8:15" />Tawkche auai ni khe dow Hazael mih paw uanchow lowk hanow tui kowi sikah khai, now nami uanchow dow mang kowng dowi mowr mang kowh lumowr kowi aia mumta pe hüah khai. Nami kung kowi dow aia mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="2KI 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Jehoram chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 8:16" />Juda pren kowi Jehosafat kowh chapa Jehoram chowm mang mih dow Israel pren kowi mang Ahab chapa Joram chowm mang mih tanga ning khe chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 8:17" />Jehoram chowm mih dow 32 ning khe chekhai, now aia dow raiat ning mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. <verse eid="2KI 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 8:18" />Aia kowh masi dow mang Ahab kowh chama chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow mang Ahab kimchakuüa iawng hai Israeluüa kowh akeng mih manguüa iawng tawi chang angak khai. Aia dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang khai. <verse eid="2KI 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 8:19" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG dow David kowh krungchak kowi napiakta kown mih nau dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow David kowh krungchakuüa atungma nachowm mang reng kown mih David kowi CHAKRAMANG khamta khai bowt.<verse eid="2KI 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 8:20" />Juda pren mang Jehoram chowm mang mih khin khe Edawm prenchakuüa dow Judauüa kowi kingküaah khai, now amatni matia vüi lang tow mang büah lowk ia khai. <verse eid="2KI 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 8:21" />Naiawng rakowi Jehoram dow aia kowh kawrnga kari maten pawla now Zair marow kowi kowkowi khai. Nakhowk khe Edawmuüa dow Jehoram hai aia kowh siphai aluchowuüa kowi kowrumah khai. Tawkche Jehoram hai aia kowh siphai aluchowuüa dow uar-e khe Edawmuüa rumah mih kowi nowng thüa büah khai. Nachenganchepaw Jehoram kowh siphaiuüa dow amatni lowkkowlowk kim kowi powt khai. <verse eid="2KI 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 8:22" />Naiawng hai Edawmuüa dow kawmat mowr pat Judauüa kowi kingküaah reng tak chekhai. Nami khin khe Libna marowchakuüa paw tawi kingküaah khai.<verse eid="2KI 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 8:23" />Mang Jehoram kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten dow “Juda Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 8:24" />Akung kowi aia dow kowng hanow David marow kowi aia pipu-uüa tadupra kowi maru dupah khai. Aia takcha kowi dow achapa Ahazia mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="2KI 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Ahazia chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 8:25" />Juda pren kowi Jehoram chapa Ahazia chowm mang mih dow Israel pren kowi mang Ahab chapa Joram chowm mang mih laipre ning khe chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 8:26" />Aia chowm mang mih dow 22 ning khe chekhai, now aia dow paning mowr Jerusalem marow kruitownla khai. A-u ming dow Athalia chekhai. A-u dow Israel mang Awmri kowh chu chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 8:27" />Aia dow mang Ahab kimchakuüa chang iawng tawi chang angak khai. Aia dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow Ahab kimchak masiuüa hown tachawng mih rakowi chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 8:28" />Mang Ahazia dow Israel mang Joram hown tawi tabawng hanow Siria pren mang Hazael kowi tawi senah khai. Now amatni dow Gilead süng kowi kowh Ramawt marow kowi tasen büah khai. Nakhowk khe mang Joram dow Siria siphaiuüa hownia ka arau khai. <verse eid="2KI 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 8:29" />Now aia kowh arau naiungla kownkow aia dow Jezrel marow kowi kowplan khai. Nakhowk khe aia hown nauang takrum kownkow Juda pren mang Ahazia paw nakowi uang khai.<verse eid="2KI 8:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2KI 9" />
  <para style="s">Nachowm mang kownkow Jehu kowi nümnapah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 9:1" />Nami khin khe Elisa dow risiuüa pungmadawng hownia risi lowk ia kowi hawah hanow tek pe mih, “Kamrüt diah. Now mami kanrawn sau palang pawla hanow Gilead süng kowi kowh Ramawt marow kowi kowkowi diah. <verse eid="2KI 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 9:2" />Nakowi en kowting khe dow Jehu kowi kowkrawi cham diah, now Jehu kowi mih a-auiuauüa hownia lang hawla hanow towklak kowi cham pawla diah. (Jehu kowh pa dow Jehosafat chekhai, now Jehosafat kowh pa dow Nimsi chekhai). <verse eid="2KI 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 9:3" />Now palang kowi kowh kanrawn sau Jehu lu kowi naklai pe hanow en natek pe kown mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG tek mih maiawng: Israel pren kowi nachowm mang kownkow ang nümnapta en khowk,’ napa kown. Nami kung kowi dow ho kim hanow alenma en napowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 9:4" />Naiawng rakowi nami risi klanguüa dow Gilead süng kowi kowh Ramawt marow kowi kowkowi khai bowt. <verse eid="2KI 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 9:5" />Nakowi aia kowting mih khin khe siphai aluchowuüa arasang takua talawm mih aia kowkhi khai. Nakhowk khe aia tek pe Jehu mih, “Aw siphai aluchow, ang phuang en kown mih satang uowi lowk,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:5">Jehu lüntaah mih, “Anging pungmadawng kowi mia iawng mih kowi chow en naphuang pe kown?” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:5">Nami risi klangah mih, “Aw siphai aluchow, en kowi chowbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 9:6" />Naiawng rakowi Jehu dow awr rü hanow amatchi pre ia kim kowi kowkup khai. Nakhowk khe Jehu lu kowi klai pe sau hanow nami risi tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG kowh maru Israeluüa luk kowi nachowm mang kownkow ang nümnapta en khowk. <verse eid="2KI 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 9:7" />En kowh mangkri Ahab kowh kimchak kowi en nasaita kown. Nahanow ang kowh risiuüa hai ang kowh akeng mih naruüa kowi Ahab masi Jezebel saita mih lu klai dow aia kimchak kowi ang naripah kown. <verse eid="2KI 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 9:8" />Ahab kowh kimchak dow nakowng bowk kown. Nar lah, nar nadowi mih lah Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh Ahab krungchak kachakuüa maten kowi ang nakowngta kown. <verse eid="2KI 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 9:9" />Aia kowh krungchak kowi dow Nebat kowh chapa mang Jeroboam krungchak hai Ahija kowh chapa mang Basa krungchak kowi changah iawng ang nachangah kown. <verse eid="2KI 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 9:10" />Jezebel kowi dow miapaw nadupah kown nadowi. Aia kowh uak dow Jezrel marow kowi kui hawmh nachaah kown,’ pakhai,” pape khai. Nami kung kowi dow nami risi klanguüa mih ho kim hanow alenma powt khai.<verse eid="2KI 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 9:11" />Now Jehu dow siphai aluchowuüa uowi rah kowi uang plan uang khai. Nakhowk khe siphai aluchow lowk ia lüntaah mih, “Tawngpaw own dowi ü? Paimi thukla uang mih tawng rakowi chow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:11">Nakhowk khe Jehu klangah mih, “Tawngpaw nadowi, aia dow klawk uailai reng mih enni aiawng tuk towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 9:12" />Amatni tek pe mih, “En dai taih. Aia tek en mih phuang anging diah,” pabüah khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:12">Nakhowk khe Jehu tek pe mih, “Aia tek ang mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow iawng Israeluüa luk kowi nachowm mang kownkow ang nümnapta en khowk,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 9:13" />Nahanow naiawngün siphai aluchowuüa dow lenlenma amatni kowh kowrmow klüp hanow Jehu khawk chawpra kowi be pe khai. Now tum baw hanow atünma tek büah mih, “Jehu dow mang chowbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joram hai Ahazia iüah kowi Jehu kowngta mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="2KI 9:14-15" />(Mang Joram hai Israeluüa maten dow Gilead süng kowi kowh Ramawt marow natownla reng kownkow Siria pren mang Hazael kowi senah khai. Nakhowk khe mang Joram dow Siria siphaiuüa hownia ka arau khai. Nahanow aia kowh arau naiungla kownkow aia dow Jezrel marow kowi kowplan khai). Naiawng rakowi Jehu dow Jezrel marow kowi kowkowiah hanow mang Joram kowi nasaita kown mih sangkrang khai. Aia dow a-auiua siphai aluchowuüa kowi tek pe mih, “Enni che pe chowm ang mang kown nau khai hanow Jezrel marowchakuüa tut-e a-i kowh sangkrangra nakowting dowi kownkow Ramawt hownia miapaw naia lawt kown nadowi,” pakhai. <verse eid="2KI 9:14-15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 9:16" />Nami kung kowi Jehu dow aia kowh kawrnga kari hown Jezrel marow kowi kowkowi khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Joram dow ka arau rakowi mawk reng tak chekhai. Now aia kowi kowh uang müah mih Juda pren mang Ahazia paw uowi reng tak chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 9:17" />Jezrel marow kowi kowh kimkrowng chawng mih maru dow Jehu kowh siphaiuüa uang mih khita hanow tek mih, “Siphai hawmh uang mih ang khi pathum!” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:17">Nakhowk khe Joram lawt ana mih, “Kawrnga kowi kowh chowm mih siphai kowi kowchin lowk ia diah. Now uang thawp taking tasangra kownkow amatni uang mih chünchü aia kowi kowpe lüntaah diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 9:18" />Naiawng rakowi kawrnga kowi kowh chowm mih siphai dow Jehu hown kowtakrum hanow tek pe mih, “Mangkri tek nauang thawp taking tasangra kownkow enni uang mih pe bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:18">Jehu klangah mih, “Tawng chow en tawi tuk? Ang kung kowi phai uang krawi,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:18">Nakhowk khe kangchawng mih kowtek pe mang Joram mih, “Amatni tut-e satang phowng mih maru kowting khowk diah. Tawkche aia uang plan dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 9:19" />Naiawng rakowi mang dow kawrnga kowi kowh chowm mih siphai kowi kowplan chin lowk ia khai iawk. Now nami maru dow siphaiuüa tut-e kowkowiah hanow kowtek pe mih, “Mangkri tek mih maiawng: Saktuak iungma hown kowh enni uang mih bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:19">Jehu klangah mih, “Tawng chow en tawi tuk? Ang kung kowi phai uang krawi,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 9:20" />Nami leng paw kangchawng mih kowplan now kowtek pe mih, “Amatni tut-e satang phowng mih maru kowting khowk diah. Tawkche aia paw uang plan dowi chekhai. Te kawrnga kari mih dow Nimsi kowh chu Jehu naown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowh kawrnga kari te krang dow thuklama mih maru kowh iawng chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 9:21" />Nakhowk khe Joram lawt ana mih, “Ang kowh kawrnga kari kamrüt ang diah,” pakhai. Naiawng kamrüt pe kung kowi dow Jehu hown nakowtakrum kownkow Israel mang Joram hai Juda mang Ahazia iüah mih chowlowkkow kawrnga kari hown kowkowi khai. Now Jehu kowi dow Jezrel marowchak Nabawt kowh dowm kowi amatchi kowkrum khai. <verse eid="2KI 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 9:22" />Jehu hown takrum hanow mang Joram lüntaah mih, “Jehu, nathawp taking tasangra kownkow en uang mih bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:22">Jehu klangah mih, “En u Jezebel dow arup kowi chup ün hai lainowmma chang maiaklese lup khai. Nami kowi nathawp taking tasangra kownkow tawng iawng chow ang nauangah kown?” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 9:23" />Nami kung kowi dow aia kowh kawrnga kari hown taplan hanow Joram powt mih khin khe Ahazia kowi hawla now tek pe mih, “Ahazia, nami dow kuanlama mih maru chekhai!” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 9:24" />Nachenganchepaw Jehu dow aia kowh kür maten hown uüi salangba hanow Joram kumlawng kowi haiapah khai. Nahanow nami salangba sek dow Joram sak-uih kowi kowtaplawn khai, now aia dow kawrnga kari kowi hing kowng khai. <verse eid="2KI 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 9:25" />Nakhowk khe aia kowh maru iuk Bidkar kowi Jehu tek pe mih, “Aia kowh uak krowngla now Jezrel marowchak Nabawt kowh dowm kowi kowkuakta diah. Joram kowh pa Ahab kung kowi kawrnga kari hown achi krawi ta mang mih khin khe Ahab lawnguan kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG tekah mih sam tuak madiah. Nakhowk khe kowh CHAKRAMANG tek mih, <verse eid="2KI 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 9:26" />‘Ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk. Mani khe Nabawt hai achapauüa kowi Ahab saiah mih ang khi. Nami lu klai dow nami dowm kowi aia kowi ang napaw pe kown,’ pakhai. Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG tek iawng kawmat Joram kowh uak mih Nabawt kowh dowm kowi kowkuakta diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 9:27" />Naiawng phaw mih khita hanow Juda pren mang Ahazia dow Bet-Hagan marow pra kowh mangla mih tiama iawng powt khai. Nachenganchepaw Jehu dow Ahazia kung kawikrawi se tek mih, “Nami maru kowi paw saita bowt,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi kawrnga kari hown Ibleam marow hown atawnchow mih Gur prakowi awr mangla mih pangchowng kowi aia kowi dow salangba hown krawi ap-ah khai. Tawkche aia dow Megido marow mowr kownowng powt khai, now nakowi aia mih kowkowng khai. <verse eid="2KI 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 9:28" />Now aia kowh maru iukuüa dow aia kowh uak mih kawrnga kari hown Jerusalem marow kowi kowpawla khai. Now aia kowi dow aia kowh pipu-uüa tadupra David marow kowi dupah khai.<verse eid="2KI 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 9:29" />Juda pren kowi Ahazia chowm mang mih dow Israel pren kowi Ahab kowh chapa Joram chowm mang mih lailowk ning khe chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jezebel kowi Jehu kowngta mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 9:30" />Nami kung kowi dow Jezrel kowi Jehu kowkowi khai. Nami satang tata hanow Jezebel dow sü mikkhu pawi hanow klangiungchow sui sam khai. Now tawngpawk hownia aia hawt downg klowlow khai. <verse eid="2KI 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 9:31" />Now marow tapplawt kowi Jehu iu kup mih khin khe Jezebel hawt tek pe mih, “En dow kowmatia kim iah kowi sai mih Zimri iawng chekhai. Saktuak iungma hown kowh en uang mih bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 9:32" />Nakhowk khe tawngpawk prakowi awr tau se Jehu tek mih, “Tangila ang mih mia chow uowi?” pakhai. Now <char style="w">akletia</char> maru iuk pre sum ia dow tawngpawk hownia aia kowi iu müah khai. <verse eid="2KI 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 9:33" />Now kowbüah kowi Jehu awr tek pe mih, “Nami masiuüa kowi iu kir madiah!” pakhai. Nahanow kowbüah dow Jezebel kowi iu kirta khai. Nakhowk khe aia kowh vi mih tap kowi hai kawrnga kowi krawi cheu khai. Now Jehu dow aia kowh kawrnga hown Jezebel kowh uak mih thuaah khai.<verse eid="2KI 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 9:34" />Nami kung kowi Jehu dow kim kowi kowkup hanow cha chakkham khai. Now aia tek pe mih, “Paimi ka piati mih masiuüa kowi cham dupta büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow mang chama chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="2KI 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 9:35" />Now Jehu kowh maru-uüa dow nami masiuüa kowi nacham dupta kownkow prang kowi lawt büah khai bowt. Tawkche amatni dow lu khaw hai bawng pang klen kowi tawngpaw kowkhi dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 9:36" />Now kowbüah dow uang plan hanow nami lawnguan mih Jehu kowi uang tek pe khai. Nakhowk khe Jehu tek mih, “Mami dow Tisbe marow kowi kowh aia kowh nar risi Elija kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe iawng uang phaw mih chekhai. Aia tek pe mih, ‘Jezrel kowh süng kowi dow Jezebel kowh uak mih kui hawmh nachaah kown. <verse eid="2KI 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 9:37" />Nami dowm kowi dow aia kowh uak mih naphaw krawng bawr kown. Naiawng rakowi aia kowi dow miapaw natuk matah kown nadowi bowt,’ pape khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 9:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2KI 10" />
  <para style="s">Ahab chuprek chaprek kowi Jehu saita mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 10:1" />Samari marow kowi dow Ahab kowh chuprek chaprekuüa uowi 70 ia chekhai. Now Jehu dow rui chasak hanow Samari marow kruitown miuüa kowi, lawngtang aluchowuüa kowi hai Ahab chuprek chaprekuüa kowh mingkhet miuüa kowi krawi sa pe khai. Chasak kowi aia krawi rui pe mih, <verse eid="2KI 10:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="2KI 10:2-3" />“Mangkri kowh chuprek chaprek dow enni tut-e chekhai. Now enni kowh dow kawrnga kari ün, kawrnga ün, tap uowi mih marow ün, now tasen müa rutchün khawkleng paw uowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi enni ka chasak hown krowksang mangkri chuprek chaprek hownia anowmma mih hai tataing mih maru kowi ruiah büah lowk ia diah, now pe chowmah mang diah. Nami kung kowi dow aia vüi dowk pe tasen büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 10:2-3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 10:4" />Nachenganchepaw amatni dow nami chasak phatta hanow lainowmma kram büah khai. Amatni tatek mih, “Jehu kowi dow mang Joram hai mang Ahazia iüah khowm nowngah dowi mih a-i ngam tawng iawng chow nanowngah kown?” pabüah khai.<verse eid="2KI 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 10:5" />Naiawng rakowi mang kim kowi kowh kruitown mih, marow kowi kowh kruitown mih, lawngtang aluchowuüa hai Ahab chuprek chaprekuüa kowh mingkhet miuüa dow Jehu tut-e kowchin maru hanow krawi tek pe mih, “Anging dow en kowh nar chowtaih. En tek iawng anging nachang kown towbowt. Mia iawng mih kowi paw anging natow mang kown nadowi. En tut-e iung iawng chang diah towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 10:6" />Nami kung kowi dow amatni kowi Jehu krawi plan rui pe chasak lowk iawk. Aia krawi rui pe mih, “Enni che tangila ang hai ang kowh ana pek chün kown enni nau khai hanow enni kowh mang chuprek chaprekuüa kowh lu dungta pe büa diah. Naiawngün lu dow tharau kowh maiawng khin khe Jezrel marow kowi ang tut-e uang pawla büa diah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:6">Nami khin khe naiawngün Ahab chuprek chaprek 70 ia dow Samari marow kowi kowh aluchowuüa tut-e chekhai. Amatni kowi kowh mingkhetah mih dow naiawngün aluchowuüa chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 10:7" />Jehu kowh nami chasak kata hanow Samari marow kowi kowh aluchowuüa dow naiawngün 70 ia maru-uüa kowi saita hanow dungta pe lu khai. Now naiawngün lu dow kharang hown Jezrel marow kowi Jehu tut-e krawi sa pe khai. <verse eid="2KI 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 10:8" />Nakhowk khe satang phowng mih maru lowk ia uang tek pe Jehu mih, “Mang Ahab kowh chuprek chaprekuüa kowh lu kowbüah uang pawla khowk,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:8">Naiawng rakowi mang Jehu lawt ana mih, “Naiawngün lu mih marow tapplawt kowi chunah pre chun diah, now auai rau mowr towah diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 10:9" />Now auai rau dow Jehu mih marow tapplawt kowi kowkowi khai. Now maru kawmuüa maten kowi aia tek pe mih, “Mang Joram kowi saita kownkow sangkrang mih dow ang chowtaih; nami lawnguan kowi tawngpaw enni kowh aprek uowi dowi. Nachenganchepaw maiawngün maru maten kowi saita mih amia chow? <verse eid="2KI 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 10:10" />Naiawng phaw mih hownia enni natukah kown mih dow Ahab chuprek chaprekuüa lawnguan kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG tekah iawng nauang tachih kown pami chekhai. CHAKRAMANG dow anar Elija kowi kowh tek pe iawng chang mih chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="2KI 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 10:11" />Naiawng rakowi akung kowi Jehu dow Jezrel marow kowi kowh Ahab kowh chuprek chaprekuüa, aia kowh maru iukuüa, aia kowh auiuauüa hai aia kowh uamowuüa kowi saita pe bowk khai. Nakowi dow Ahab kowh maru lowk iachow paw sing uowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="2KI 10:12-13" />Nami kung kowi dow Jehu mih Jezrel marow hownia lawt hanow Samari marow kowi kowkowi khai. Now aia dow Ruapur Thing Miuüa Kowh Bet-Eked pami arah kowi kowtowm khe Juda pren mang Ahazia kowh tasin taken miuüa hown takrum khai. Amatni kowi aia lüntaah mih, “Mia chow enni?” pakhai. Amatni klangah mih, “Anging dow Ahazia kowh tasin taken miuüa taih. Masiuüa mang Jezebel kowh chapauüa kowi hai mang Joram kowh chapauüa hown nakowtakrum kownkow Jezrel marow kowi anging cham kowi mih taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 10:12-13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 10:14" />Nakhowk khe aia kowh maru-uüa kowi Jehu peah ana mih, “Kowbüah kowi asing khümah diah,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi aia kowh maru-uüa dow amatni 42 ia kowi asing khümah khai. Now amatni kowi dow Bet-Eked kowi kowh tuikuam re-e saita büah khai; lowk iachow kowi paw towah sing büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 10:15" />Nami hownia powt hanow Rekab kowh chapa Jonadab hown Jehu takrum khai. Aia dow Jehu hown nauang takrum kownkow uang mih chekhai. Now aia hown takrum hanow Jehu tek pe mih, “Ang tangila en iawng en paw tangila ang bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:15">Nakhowk khe Jonadab klangah mih, “Ow, tangi chow,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:15">Jehu tek pe mih, “Naiawng now awr iaw rut diah,” pakhai. Nahanow Jonadab dow awr iaw rut khai, now aia kowi dow Jehu mih aia kowh kawrnga kari kowi tangla khai. <verse eid="2KI 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 10:16" />Nami kung kowi Jehu tek pe mih, “Ang hown tawi diah, now CHAKRAMANG vüi ang sakkrai mih krang en nakhi kown,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow Jehu kowh kawrnga kari hown kowtawi khai.<verse eid="2KI 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 10:17" />Now Samari marow kowi uang towm hanow ta sing uowi mih Ahab chuprek chaprekuüa kowi Jehu saita bowk khai. Nami dow Elija kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG tek pe iawng rowprowp uang phaw mih chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baal thurai kowi kowh chup miuüa kowi Jehu saita mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 10:18" />Nami kung kowi dow Jehu mih Samari marow kowi kowh maru maten kowi kuaah hanow tek pe mih, “Baal thurai kowi Ahab chupiia mih dow a-echow taih tak. Tawkche ang dow nami lak-e hu nachupiia kown. <verse eid="2KI 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 10:19" />Baal thurai vüi kowi tawncher hown aiukma nachang phuchua pawi lowk kown. Naiawng rakowi kawmat mih Baal thurai kowh risiuüa maten, aia kowi chupiia miuüa maten hai aia kowh uamowuüa maten kowi uang hawla büa diah. Miapaw ta lat dowi iawng enni nakrawi hawla kown. Uang tawi dowi mih maru kowi dow nakowngta kown,” pakhai. Tawkche naiawng Jehu kuanah mih dow Baal thurai kowi kowh chupiia miuüa kowi nasaita bowk kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 10:20" />Nami kung kowi Jehu tek pe mih, “Baal thurai vüi chang pawi kown mih satang krawi phuang diah,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi maru kawmuüa dow nami satang krawi phowng büah khai. <verse eid="2KI 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 10:21" />Nakhowk khe Jehu dow nami lawnguan mih Israeluüa uowi rah maten kowi krawi phowng pe khai. Nahanow Baal thurai kowi kowh chupiia miuüa dow lowk iachow paw ta lawt dowi kowi uang ting bowk chekhai. Amatni dow Baal thurai kim kowi kup büah khai, now kim mih hing tek mup khai. <verse eid="2KI 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 10:22" />Nakhowk khe tawnguat mingkhet mih maru kowi Jehu tek pe mih, “Baal thurai kowi chupiia miuüa vüi uang pawla pe tawnguat dit,” pakhai. Nahanow nami maru dow kowbüah vüi uang pawla pe tawnguat khai.<verse eid="2KI 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 10:23" />Nami kung kowi Jehu hai Jonadab iüah mih Baal thurai kim lak kowi kowkup khai. Now Baal thurai kowi kowh chupiia miuüa kowi Jehu tek pe mih, “Makowi dow Baal thurai kowi kowh chupiia miuüa ngetchow taih nauowi kown. CHAKRAMANG kowi chupiia miuüa lowk iachow paw tawi uowi dowi iawng enni krawi müah büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 10:24" />Nami kung kowi amatchi dow Baal thurai vüi tawncher hown kowh phuchua hai tikah mih uanap chang iüah khai. Tawkche nami dowi rawn khe Jehu mih maru iun 80 ia kowi thurai kim uat kowi ta pe iowngah khai. Now aia tekla pe mih, “Naiawngün maru-uüa kowi dow enni nasaita bowk kown. Mia iawng mih chow pe powtah khai hanow nami maru takcha aia kowi napawta pe asak kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 10:25" />Tikah mih uanap ki chang hown krowksang kangchawng miuüa hai siphai aluchowuüa kowi Jehu peah ana mih, “Alak kowi uang kup hanow maiawngün maru-uüa kowi uang saita büah bowk bowt. Lowk iachow kowi paw amatni kowi enni nape plaiah kown nadowi,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi kangchawng miuüa hai siphai aluchowuüa dow saidawng hown naiawngün maru-uüa kowi uang saita bowk khai. Now naiawngün maru-uüa uak dow Baal thurai kim uat kowi uai kuakta büah pan khai. Nami kung kowi dow Baal thurai kim lak kowi kowh towklak kowi kowkup büah khai. <verse eid="2KI 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 10:26" />Nami kim hownia dow phuchuala Baal thurai mih chüng ün uang lawtla hanow tikta büah khai. <verse eid="2KI 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 10:27" />Naiawng ki tikta pe achüng kung kowi dow Baal thurai kim paw hing piakta pe khai. Nami hownia kawmat mowr pat nami kim dow maru changla uatra kim khai.<verse eid="2KI 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 10:28" />Naiawng hai Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi Baal thurai chup dow Jehu hing mitta pe khai. <verse eid="2KI 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 10:29" />Nachenganchepaw Nabawt kowh chapa Jeroboam changah mih angak dow Jehu nowng kuakta dowi tak chekhai. Jeroboam kowh angak dow Bethel marow hai Dan marow kowi uowi reng tak khe kuh hown thawp chia chah rup hanow Israeluüa kowi aia pe chup pe iiala khai.<verse eid="2KI 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 10:30" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Jehu mih, “Ahab chuprek chaprekuüa lawnguan kowi kowh ang tekta iawng aiungma en changah khai. Naiawng rakowi en kowh krungchakuüa dow tali chowng mowr Israel pren kowi naka chowm mang kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="2KI 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 10:31" />Nachenganchepaw Jehu dow aia kowh sak maiow hown CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai ari aiang mih chün dowi chekhai. Jeroboam rakowi kowh Israeluüa piakla mih angak dow aia kuakta dowi tak chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang Jehu kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 10:32" />Nami khin hownia bowt now CHAKRAMANG dow Israeluüa kowh pren sünghi mih sowmta pe rürü khai. Siria pren mang Hazael dow Jawrdan aw satlawt pra kowh Israeluüa kowi krawi senah hanow amatni kowh süng maten powngta pe khai. <verse eid="2KI 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 10:33" />Naiawngün süng dow Arnawn aw re-e kowh Aroer marow hownia Gilead süng maten hai Basan süng maten mowr chekhai. Naiawngün süng kowi dow Gad krungchakuüa, Reuben krungchakuüa hai Manase krungchakuüa kowh süng uowi chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 10:34" />Jehu kowh akeng mih lup maten hai tasen awng mih lawnguan dow “Israel Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 10:35" />Akung kowi Jehu dow kowng hanow Samari marow kowi maru dupah khai. Aia takcha dow achapa Jehoahaz mih ta chowm mang khai. <verse eid="2KI 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 10:36" />Jehu dow Samari marow kowi 28 ning mowr Israeluüa luk kowi chowmla mang khai.<verse eid="2KI 10:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2KI 11" />
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi kowh masiuüa mang Athalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 11:1" />Juda pren mang Ahazia kowh u Athalia dow achapa kowng mih satang tata hown krowksang mang Ahazia kimchakuüa maten kowi krawi saita bowk khai. <verse eid="2KI 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 11:2" />Nachenganchepaw mang chapauüa kowi Athalia krawi saita bowk dowi rawn khe mang Jehoram kowh chama Jehoseba dow arak sin Ahazia kowh chapa Joas ngiachow kowi kowku pawta khai. Now aia dow Athalia rut hownia atulung Joas naia plaila kownkow athum miia hailawm CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh mawk rah towklak lowk mih kowi petah khai. Naiawng rakowi Joas kowi dow ka sai dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 11:3" />Joas dow Jehoseba hown taruk ning mowr CHAKRAMANG kim kowi tapet khai. Nami khin khe Juda pren kowi kowh chowm mang mih dow masiuüa mang Athalia chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joas ngeuüa kowi nümnapah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 11:4" />Athalia chowm mang mih ranit ning khe uamow Jehoiada dow mang chawng mih aluchowuüa hai kangchawng mih siphai aluchowuüa kowi nakowhaw kownkow kowchin maru khai, now amatni dow naiawngün maru-uüa kowi CHAKRAMANG kim kowi aia tut-e uang pawla khai. Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh aia kowh sangkrangra lawnguan kowi pe khamah sawi hanow amatni hown aia tatow sangbowk laitawm khai. Now amatni kowi dow mang Ahazia kowh chapa kowi aia tüng pe khai. <verse eid="2KI 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 11:5" />Now amatni kowi aia peah ana mih, “Enni kangchawng miuüa uowi sum thum chekhai. Now enni pungmadawng hownia Tanai Ni kowi kowh nauang chang lup kown mih pathum mih dow thumchakuüa kowi naplan changah sum thum iawk kown: Pathum mih dow mang kim nachawng kown, <verse eid="2KI 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 11:6" />alowk mih thum dow Sur tapplawt kowi nachawng kown, now alowk mih thum dow akeng mih kangchawng miuüa kung prakowi kowh tapplawt kowi nachawng kown. Naiawng hai CHAKRAMANG kim mih enni nachawngah kown. <verse eid="2KI 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 11:7" />Now Tanai Ni kowi kowh lup chang uowi dowi mih pre thum dow akawm srui CHAKRAMANG kim kowi nakowchawng mang kown. <verse eid="2KI 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 11:8" />Enni kowh chowlowkkow tasen müa rutchün khawkleng dowkma hown mang tavir lut enni nakrawi uowi kown. Lowra kowi aia cham kowi chepaw aia re-e enni natawi takhep kown. Now enni tut-e uang mih maru kowi dow enni nakowngta kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 11:9" />Naiawng rakowi siphai aluchowuüa dow uamow Jehoiada tek pe iawng chang büah khai. Amatni dow Tanai Ni kowi uang chang lup miuüa hai ki changla lup kowh plan miuüa kowi pawla now Jehoiada tut-e uang büah khai. <verse eid="2KI 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 11:10" />Nakhowk khe Jehoiada dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh uowi mih mang David kowh reh hai kawngma ün siphai aluchowuüa kowi ap pe khai. <verse eid="2KI 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 11:11" />Now kangchawng miuüa dow saidawng dowkma hown mang kowi nahawt towkala kownkow CHAKRAMANG kim pur kowi mami tap bang hownia paimi tap bang mowr atanma iowng büah khai.<verse eid="2KI 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 11:12" />Nami kung kowi dow Jehoiada mih mang kowh chapa Joas kowi uang lawtla khai bowt. Now aia kowi dow kruk pe mang lukruk hanow pren kruitown müa rirow bowih ap pe khai. Now Jehoiada dow aia kowi nümnapah khai. Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa dow phek rut se atünma tek büah mih, “Mang dow chowngdawng sakklangma pacham sing reng lah,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="2KI 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masiuüa mang Athalia kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 11:13" />Kangchawng miuüa hai maru kawmuüa how sawmlawm mih klow tata hanow masiuüa mang Athalia dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi maru kawmuüa tut-e kowkowi khai. <verse eid="2KI 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 11:14" />Nahanow ari arow kowi uowi iawng CHAKRAMANG kim kowi ap pe mangra khe kowh iowng pe reng mih rah re-e Joas iowng mih aia kowkhi khai. Joas kowi dow siphai aluchowuüa hai baw tum miuüa umta lut khai. Now pren kowi kowh maru maten dow piaw se how sawmlawm hai tum baw büah khai. Nami khita hanow Athalia dow sak piak kowh aia kowh tawnguat thekah khai, now atünma tek mih, “Enni kuan ang khai! Enni kuan ang khai!” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 11:15" />Nakhowk khe siphai aluchowuüa kowi uamow Jehoiada peah ana mih, “Athalia kowi siphaiuüa takra iawng cham pawla diah. Aia kowi uang lawngah kownkow uang kawikrawi mih maru kowi enni nasaita kown,” pakhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi Athalia kowi nakowngta dowi kown mih Jehoiada rik lawtta ana khai bowt. <verse eid="2KI 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 11:16" />Naiawng rakowi Athalia kowi dow khümla büah khai. Now aia kowi dow mang kim kowi kowkowi khe kowh kawrnga kupra tapplawt kowi saiah büah khai.<verse eid="2KI 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jehoiada tow pe sangbowk laitawm mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 11:17" />CHAKRAMANG luk kowi kaah sakowm iawng nauowi kownkow mang hai maru kawmuüa kowi Jehoiada pe khamah sawi khai, now mang hai maru kawmuüa mih amatni lowkkowlowk luk kowi kaah sakowmma nauowi kown mih paw Jehoiada pe khamah sawi khai. <verse eid="2KI 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 11:18" />Nami kung kowi dow Juda pren kowi kowh maru-uüa maten mih Baal thurai chup kim kowi kowkowi hanow kowpiakta kim khai. Amatni dow nakowi kowh phuchuara hai arup ün bawpta pe naknak khai, now Baal thuraiuüa kowh uamow Mattan kowi paw phuchuara re-e saita büah khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 11:18">Nami kung kowi dow uamow Jehoiada mih CHAKRAMANG kim kowi tow pe kangchawng mih khai. <verse eid="2KI 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 11:19" />Nami kung kowi aia dow siphai aluchowuüa, mang kowi kowh chawng miuüa, mang kim chawng miuüa hai pren kowi kowh maru maten pawla hanow CHAKRAMANG kim hownia mang Joas kowi uang lawtla khai. Now amatni dow kangchawng miuüa chawngah mih tapplawt iawng mang kim kowi kowkowi büah khai, now mang kowi dow mang chowm rah kowi pe chowmah khai. <verse eid="2KI 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 11:20" />Naiawng rakowi prenchak maru maten dow piaw büah khai, now Jerusalem marow mih <char style="w">thaulang</char> khai bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Athailiah kowi dow mang kim kowi saita khai bowt.<verse eid="2KI 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 11:21" />Juda pren kowi Joas uown chowm mang khe aia dow ranit ningchow chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 11:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2KI 12" />
  <para style="s">Mang Joas krawi raw CHAKRAMANG kim mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 12:1" />Juda pren kowi Joas chowm mang mih dow Israel pren kowi Jehu chowm mang mih ranit ning khe chekhai. Now Joas dow 40 ning mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. A-u dow Ber-Seba marow hownia kowh Zibia chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 12:2" />Joas kowi dow aia kowh prengia pek mih uamow Jehoiada tüngsangah reng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Joas dow aia sing uowi mowr CHAKRAMANG mik kowi aiungma mih lup chang reng chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 12:3" />Nachenganchepaw arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara dow aia krawi piakta dowi chekhai. Naiawngün arah kowi dow maru kawmuüa mih tawncher hown chang phuchua reng chekhai, now nam iungma mih maikhük paw towk reng chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 12:4" />Akat khe mang Joas tek pe uamowuüa mih, “Chimsaima mih uanap iawng hai CHAKRAMANG kim kowi maru kawmuüa uang pawla mih tangka pawisa maten hawt krümah büa diah. Naiawngün tangka pawisa dow rüa maru iun khe kowh, kowmatia takhamta mih rakowi kowh hai kowmatia sak nau hown kowh uang pawla mih chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 12:5" />Naiawngün tangka pawisa maten dow enni uamowuüa mih enni kowh maru-uüa hownia enni nahawt paw kown. Now naiawngün tangka pawisa dow CHAKRAMANG kim rawk müa kowi enni natawngah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 12:6" />Tawkche Joas chowm mang mih 23 ning khowk chepaw uamowuüa dow CHAKRAMANG kim mih krawi raw dowi tak chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 12:7" />Naiawng rakowi mang Joas dow uamow Jehoiada hai akeng mih uamowuüa kowi nauang hawla kownkow kowkrawi chin maru khai. Now naiawngün uamowuüa kowi aia lüntaah mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow CHAKRAMANG kim enni raw dowi rereng? Enni chowlowkkow maru-uüa hownia kowh enni kaah mih tangka pawisa mih enni rut kowi hangkow tow büah tham bowt. Naiawngün dow CHAKRAMANG kim rawk müa kowi sunah büah bowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="2KI 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 12:8" />Now uamowuüa dow maru kawmuüa hownia kowh hawt pawah mih tangka pawisa amatni rut kowi natow dowi bowt kown mih nauta khai. Nami klen kowi CHAKRAMANG kim amatni matia naraw dowi kown mih paw nauta büah khai.<verse eid="2KI 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 12:9" />Now uamow Jehoiada dow uang pawla tawkpla lowk hanow aluk hownia iu pruaah parah khai. Now nami tawkpla dow CHAKRAMANG kimplawt hawmlawm prakowi phuchuara re-e towah khai. Kimplawt chawng mih uamowuüa dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi maru kawmuüa uang pawla mih tangka pawisa maten nami tawkpla kowi towah büah reng chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 12:10" />Now CHAKRAMANG kim kowi uang pawla mih tangka pawisa dow tawkpla kowi tek khowk hanow mang kowh maru iuk hai Uamow Lang kri Mih iüah rüaah reng, now im kowi phangah reng chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 12:11" />Nami kung kowi dow naiawngün tangka pawisa mih CHAKRAMANG kim chang miuüa luk kowi kowh towah mih aluchowuüa rut kowi ap pe reng chekhai. Now amatni dow naiawngün tangka pawisa mih CHAKRAMANG kim rawk mih — singh hown kowh uanh thawp sarauüa, kim chang sarauüa, <verse eid="2KI 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 12:12" />hua hown kowh uanh thawp sarauüa hai hua bawp sarauüa — kowi peah reng chekhai. Nami klen kowi paw CHAKRAMANG kim rawk müa singh, arisang bawpah mih hua hai kim chang müa lakke mih ran müa kowi sunah reng chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 12:13" />Tawkche CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh uang pawla mih tangka pawisa hown dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi tawngah kown mih tai bia ün, bawthi kep müa kaingkep ün, biatum ün, baw ün hai kuh tai hown kowh tawng iawng mih puh bia aikam paw thawpla dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 12:14" />Nami dow naia rawla CHAKRAMANG kim kownkow naiawngün tangka dow aluchowuüa mih kim chang sarauüa kowi peah reng chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 12:15" />CHAKRAMANG kim chang miuüa luk kowi towah mih aluchowuüa dow achinawmma chekhai. Naiawng rakowi naiawngün aluchowuüa tut-e dow tangka pawisa ingsap pawk takla dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 12:16" />Tawkche aprek sung uanap hai angak lawt lük müa uanap chang müa kowi kowh uang pawla mih tangka pawisa dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh tawkpla kowi atowk takla dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün tangka dow uamowuüa kowh kakbak chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang Joas kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 12:17" />Nami khin khe Siria pren mang Hazael dow Gat marow kowi kowkowiah now kowsenah khai, now marow dow powngta pe khai. Nami kung kowi amatni dow Jerusalem marow nauang sen kownkow uang tarü khai. <verse eid="2KI 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 12:18" />Naiawng rakowi Juda pren mang Joas dow CHAKRAMANG kowi kowh aia peah mih dawngthawnguan hai aia kowh pipu Jehosafat, Jehoram hai Ahazia büah CHAKRAMANG vüi lang kraah mih dawngthawnguan maten Siria pren mang Hazael kowi krawi sata pe khai. Nami klen kowi CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh kuh hai mang kim kowi kowh kuh maten paw Hazael kowi aia krawi sata pe bowk khai. Nahanow Hazael dow Jerusalem marow kowi senla dowi kowi powt khai bowt.<verse eid="2KI 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 12:19" />Mang Joas kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten dow “Juda Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 12:20" />Mang Joas kowh maru iuk pre ia dow aia kowi kingküaah hanow Silla pra kowh mangla mih tiama Bet-Milo pami arah kowi saita khai. <verse eid="2KI 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 12:21" />Nami maru iuk pre ia dow Simeat kowh chapa Jozakar hai Somer kowh chapa Jehozabad iüah chekhai. Joas kowi dow apipu-uüa tadupra David marow kowi maru dupah khai. Aia takcha kowi dow achapa Amazia mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="2KI 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2KI 13" />
  <para style="s">Israel pren kowi Jehoahaz chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 13:1" />Israel pren kowi Jehu kowh chapa Jehoahaz chowm mang mih dow Juda pren kowi mang Ahazia chapa Joas chowm mih 23 ning khe chekhai. Jehoahaz dow Israel pren kowi kowh Samari marow kowi lairanit ning mowr chowmla mang khai. <verse eid="2KI 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 13:2" />Aia dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang khai. Now Nebat chapa Jeroboam changah mih lup ngak dow aia paw chang khai, now aia dow Israeluüa kowi paw pe changah lup ngak khai. Nami hownia aia dow tarip dowi tak chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 13:3" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow Israeluüa kowi lainowmma kunmarauah khai. Aia dow amatni kowi mih Siria pren mang Hazael hai achapa Ben-Hadad iüah rut kowi aplan aplan pe sumah khai.<verse eid="2KI 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 13:4" />Nami kung kowi dow Jehoahaz mih CHAKRAMANG tut-e awr lü khowng khai, now CHAKRAMANG dow aia awr lüah mih hawt sünta pe khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Israeluüa kowi Siria pren mang lainowmma changah anowng apowng mih dow CHAKRAMANG mih khi khai bowt. <verse eid="2KI 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 13:5" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG dow Israeluüa kowi uang chin pe lawng mih lowk ia khai. Nahanow Israeluüa dow Siriauüa hownia ka lawngra khai bowt. Now amatni dow alai khe kowh iawng thaulangma plan uowi büah khai bowt.<verse eid="2KI 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 13:6" />Tawkche amatni dow Israeluüa kowi kowh Jeroboam pe changah mih lup ngak chang reng tak chekhai. Nami lup ngak hownia dow amatni tarip dowi tak chekhai. Nami klen kowi Samari marow kowi kowh Asera limpu paw kripta dowi tak chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 13:7" />Jehoahaz kowh dow kawrnga kowi kowh chowm mih siphai 50 ia, kawrnga kari 10 klüng hai khawk hown mang mih siphai 10,000 ia klen kowi miapaw uowi dowi bowt chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow akeng miuüa kowi dow Siria pren mang mih saita bowk khowk chekhai. Amatni kowi dow thua dinchow khe kowh iawng Siria pren mang thuata nak khai. <verse eid="2KI 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 13:8" />Jehoahaz kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten hai tasen awng mih lawnguan dow “Israel Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 13:9" />Akung kowi Jehoahaz dow kowng hanow Samari marow kowi maru dupah khai. Aia takcha kowi dow achapa Jehoas mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="2KI 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel pren kowi Jehoas chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 13:10" />Israel pren kowi Jehoahaz chapa Jehoas chowm mang mih dow Juda pren kowi Joas chowm mih 37 ning khe chekhai. Jehoas dow laitaruk ning mowr Samari marow kowi chowmla mang khai. <verse eid="2KI 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 13:11" />Aia dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang khai. Now Nebat chapa Jeroboam changah mih lup ngak dow aia paw chang khai, now aia dow Israeluüa kowi paw pe changah lup ngak khai. Nami hownia aia dow tarip dowi tak chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 13:12" />Jehoas kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten hai sakkraingma hown Juda pren mang Amazia kowi senah mih lawnguan dow “Israel Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 13:13" />Akung kowi Jehoas dow kowng hanow Samari marow kowi Israel manguüa tadupra kowi maru dupah khai. Aia takcha kowi dow achapa Jeroboam mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="2KI 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Risi Elisa kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 13:14" />Risi Elisa dow arau dikma hown uowi khai. Now aia kowngla mih dow nami arau hown chekhai. Aia kowng dowi rawn khe Israel mang Jehoas dow aia kowi uang müah khai. Now kar se Jehoas tek pe mih, “Aw apa, apa! Israel kowi kowh kawrnga kari hai kawrnga luk kowi kowh chowm mih siphaiuüa kowi ang khi khai!” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="2KI 13:15-16" />Nakhowk khe Elisa tek pe mih, “Salangba hai salangba sek uang pawla diah,” pakhai. Now uang pawla salangba kung kowi Elisa tek pe mih, “Dowk salangba diah,” pakhai. Nahanow mang dow dowk salangba khai. Nami kung kowi dow Elisa mih mang rut luk kowi aia kowh rut mih towah khai. <verse eid="2KI 13:15-16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 13:17" />Now Elisa tek pe mih, “Satlawt pra kowh tawngpawk ho diah,” pakhai. Now mang mih ho tawngpawk khai. Nami kung kowi Elisa tek pe mih, “Ap salangba diah,” pakhai. Nahanow mang Jehoas dow ap salangba khai. Nakhowk khe Elisa tek mih, “Mami dow CHAKRAMANG kowh salangba sek chekhai. Siriauüa kowi kowh nowngla mih dow mami salangba sek hown chekhai. Aphek marow kowi Siriauüa kowi dow asaima en napiakta kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 13:18" />Nami kung kowi Elisa tek pe mih, “Dowk salangba sek diah,” pakhai. Aia dowk salangba sek hanow Elisa tek pe mih, “Krawng kowi iu ap diah,” pakhai. Nahanow aia dow iu ap sum katchow now taingta khai. <verse eid="2KI 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 13:19" />Nakhowk khe Thurai maru Elisa dow kunmarau se tek pe mih, “Tanga taruk kat mowr chowdiah krawng kowi en ap takla. Naiawng che en ap e dow Siriauüa kowi asaima en naia piakta kown chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw amatni kowi dow sum katchow towbowt en naia awngta kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 13:20" />Akung kowi Elisa dow kowng khai bowt, now aia kowi dupah khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 13:20">Ning towng chungrau khin chur prakowi Moabuüa dow nauang krawi rup uanh kownkow Israel pren kowi uang kup reng chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 13:21" />Akat mih ning khe Israeluüa dow cham dup uak ne chowdiah. Nakhowk khe amatni dow uang krawi rup uanh mih maru-uüa kowi khi pathum khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow nami uak mih risi Elisa kowh tadupra kuam kowi iu kuakla dup khai. Now nami maru uak dow Elisa kowh hut hown kowtakak hown krowksang awr sing hanow awr iowng dang khai.<verse eid="2KI 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siriauüa hown Israeluüa tasen mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 13:22" />Israel pren kowi mang Jehoahaz chowm mang mowr dow Siria pren mang Hazael mih Israeluüa kowi changah anowng apowng khai. <verse eid="2KI 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 13:23" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG dow Israeluüa kowi saksing sanaah hai sakrauah khai. Amatni kowi dow asaima aia piakah dowi chekhai. Aia dow Abraham, Isak hai Jakawb büah hown tatow sangbowk laitawm khai rakowi Israeluüa kowi khowngah reng khai. Amatni kowi dow kawmat mowr pat asaima aia piakah dowi, now aia pur hownia alakma kowi aia towah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 13:24" />Siria pren mang Hazael kowng kung kowi dow aia takcha kowi achapa Ben-Hadad ta chowm mang khai. <verse eid="2KI 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 13:25" />Jehoahaz kowh chapa Jehoas dow Hazael kowh chapa Ben-Hadad kowi senah sum kat kowi sum kat nowngta khai. Nahanow a-pa Jehoahaz chowm mang khe kowh Ben-Hadad powngta mih marow maten dow aia plan kata khai iawk.<verse eid="2KI 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2KI 14" />
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Amazia chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 14:1" />Juda pren kowi Joas chapa Amazia chowm mang mih dow Israel pren kowi Jehoahaz chapa Jehoas chowm mang mih pre ning khe chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 14:2" />Amazia dow 25 ning khe chowm mang khai. Aia dow 29 ning mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. A-u dow Jerusalem marow hownia kowh Jehoadin chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 14:3" />Aia dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi aiungma mih lup chang reng chekhai. Nachenganchepaw a-pu David khowt dow lup iung aia chang dowi chekhai. Aia dow a-pa Joas chang iawng rowprowp lup maten changah khai. <verse eid="2KI 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 14:4" />Tawkche arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara dow aia krawi piakta dowi chekhai. Naiawngün arah kowi dow maru kawmuüa mih tawncher hown chang phuchua reng chekhai, now nam iungma mih maikhük paw towk reng chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 14:5" />Aia dow nachowm mang kown mih alow ka hown krowksang a-pa kowi saita mih maru iukuüa maten kowi aia krawi saita bowk khai. <verse eid="2KI 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 14:6" />Nachenganchepaw aia dow Mosi rirow bowih kowi kowh arui uowi iawng naiawngün sai maru miuüa kowh chauüa kowi saila dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Mosi rirow bowih kowi dow maiawng hai CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek uowi khai, “Chauüa changta angak rakowi u-pa kowi naia kowngta kown nadowi, now u-pa changta angak rakowi chauüa kowi paw naia kowngta kown nadowi. Chang ngak mih maru chowtaih nakowng kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 14:7" />Amazia dow Awisa lawngrawi kowi Edawmuüa kowi saita 10,000 ia khai. Now Sela marow paw aia powngta pe khai, now nami marow dow Jawkthel pahai aia klowita pe ming khai. Nami dow kawmat pat Jawkthel marow pahai maru rükah reng tak chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 14:8" />Akat khe Amazia dow Israel mang Jehoas tut-e kowchin pe satang phowng mih khai. Jehoas kowh pa dow Jehoahaz chekhai, now Jehoahaz kowh pa dow Jeho chekhai. Aia krawi tek pe mih, “Uang madiah, achi tadowk tasen madiah sik,” pakhai. <verse eid="2KI 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 14:9" />Nachenganchepaw Israel pren mang dow laiuat hown Juda pren mang kowi krawi plan tek pe mih, “Akat khe Lebanawn hungh kowi kowh chuh mung dow Lebanawn hungh kowi kowh sidar singh kowi krawi phowng pe satang khai. Aia krawi tek pe mih, ‘En kowh chama kowi ang kowh chapa hown pe tachawngah diah,’ pakhai. Tawkche nami hungh kowi kowh kaurawng uaramchak dow nami chuh mung kowi uang thuata nak khai. <verse eid="2KI 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 14:10" />Edawmuüa kowi en nowngta khai kowh lainowmma en chang bawri. Enni awng mih kowi sak-ihma hown kim kowi uowi phülü büah. Nadowi now phih nauang ting kown. Nami phih dow en matia hai Judauüa vüi piakra naown kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 14:11" />Nachenganchepaw mang Amazia dow mang Jehoas kowh nami laiklow sünta pe dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Israel pren mang Jehoas dow Amazia kowi uang senah khai. Amatchi dow siphai hawmh hown Juda pren kowi kowh Bet-Semes marow kowi tasen iüah khai. <verse eid="2KI 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 14:12" />Israeluüa dow Judauüa kowi nowngta khai. Now Judauüa dow chowlowkkow kim prakowi powt büah bowk khai. <verse eid="2KI 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 14:13" />Israel pren mang Jehoas dow Juda pren mang Amazia kowi Bet-Semes marow kowi khümah khai. Nami kung kowi dow Jehoas mih Jerusalem marow kowi kowkup khai, now nami marow tap dow Efraim tapplawt hownia Anui tapplawt mowr 400 muk aia krawi piakta pe khai. <verse eid="2KI 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 14:14" />Aia dow CHAKRAMANG kim hai mang kim kowi kowh kuh, tai hai akeng mih uanh maten pawla bowk khai. Nami klen kowi maru kowi paw khümla sangrum hanow Samari marow kowi aia plan khai.<verse eid="2KI 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 14:15" />Jehoas kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten, tasen awng mih lawnguan hai Juda pren mang Amazia hown tasen mih lawnguan dow “Israel Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 14:16" />Akung kowi Jehoas dow kowng hanow Samari marow kowi Israel manguüa tadupra kowi maru dupah khai. Aia takcha kowi dow achapa Jeroboam mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="2KI 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang Amazia kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 14:17" />Juda pren mang Amazia dow Israel pren mang Jehoas kowng kung kowi paw ta sing laitanga ning tak chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 14:18" />Amazia kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten dow, “Juda Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 14:19" />Jerusalem marowchakuüa dow mang Amazia kowi kingküaah ne khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow Lakhis marow kowi cham powt khai. Nachenganchepaw maru kawmuüa dow nakowi kowchin maru hanow aia kowi kowkrawi saita khai. <verse eid="2KI 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 14:20" />Now aia kowh uak dow kawrnga luk kowi tangla hanow Jerusalem marow kowi uang pawla khai, now aia kowi dow David marow kowi kowh aia pipu-uüa tadupra kowi maru dupah khai.<verse eid="2KI 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 14:21" />Nami kung kowi dow Juda prenchakuüa mih a-pa Amazia takcha achapa Uzia kowi ta pe chowmah mang khai. Nakhowk khe Uzia dow laitaruk ningchow chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 14:22" />A-pa kowng kung kowi Uzia dow Elat marow ta plan thawp khai iawk, now nami marow dow Judauüa plan ka khai iawk.<verse eid="2KI 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel pren kowi alowk mih Jeroboam chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 14:23" />Israel pren kowi kowh Samari marow kowi Jehoas chapa Jeroboam chowm mang mih dow Juda pren kowi Joas chapa Amazia chowm mang mih laitanga ning khe chekhai. Aia dow 41 ning mowr Samari marow kowi chowmla mang khai. <verse eid="2KI 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 14:24" />Aia dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang khai. Now Nebat chapa Jeroboam changah mih lup ngak dow aia paw chang khai. <verse eid="2KI 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 14:25" />Jehoas chapa Jeroboam dow Hamat marow hownia Sata Kowng mowr mih Israeluüa kowh rihi krawi plan powngta pe khai iawk. Naiawng phaw mih dow Gat-Hepher marow kowi kowh Amitai chapa risi Jona tut-e kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai laikham iawng chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 14:26" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow Israeluüa bowkbowk dow uowi nar mih lah, nar nadowi mih lah lainowmma kawm mih CHAKRAMANG khi khai. Amatni kowi dow nakhowngah kown mih miapaw uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 14:27" />CHAKRAMANG dow Israeluüa kowi asaima namata kown mih nau dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow Jehoas chapa mang Jeroboam kowi tawngah kengah khai, now Jeroboam dow Israeluüa kowi lawngah khai.<verse eid="2KI 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 14:28" />Jeroboam kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten, tasen awng mih lawnguan, alai kowh Judauüa krüa kowi uowi mih Damaska marow hai Hamat marow Israeluüa vüi tawng iawng chow aia plan kata pe iawk mih lawnguan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">alai kowh Judauüa krüa kowi uowi mih Damaska marow hai Hamat marow </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mami uan kowi kowh laiklow mih Hebrai lai hown chim dowi chekhai.</char></note> dow “Israel Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 14:29" />Akung kowi Jeroboam dow kowng hanow Israel manguüa kowh tadupra kowi maru dupah khai. Now aia takcha kowi dow achapa Zekaria mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="2KI 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2KI 15" />
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Uzia chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 15:1" />Juda pren kowi Amazia chapa Uzia chowm mang mih dow Israel pren kowi Jeroboam chowm mang mih 27 ning khe chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 15:2" />Uzia dow laitaruk ning khe chowm mang khai. Aia dow 52 ning mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. A-u dow Jerusalem marow hownia kowh Jekolia chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 15:3" />Uzia dow a-pa Amazia iawng CHAKRAMANG mik kowi aiungma mih lup chang reng chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 15:4" />Nachenganchepaw arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara dow aia krawi piakta dowi tak chekhai. Naiawngün arah kowi dow maru kawmuüa mih tawncher hown chang phuchua reng chekhai, now nam iungma mih maikhük paw towk reng chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 15:5" />CHAKRAMANG dow mang kowi peah ripra khai. Naiawng rakowi mang kowh dow kowng dowi mowr par rawka uang phaw khai. Aia dow akeng mih kim kowi cham lang uowi khai. Now mang kim dow achapa Jotham mih ta mingkhet khai, now aia dow ta kruitown pren khai.<verse eid="2KI 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 15:6" />Uzia kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten dow “Juda Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 15:7" />Akung kowi Uzia dow kowng hanow David marow kowi maru dupah khai. Aia takcha kowi dow achapa Jotham mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="2KI 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel pren kowi Zekaria chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 15:8" />Israel pren kowi kowh Samari marow kowi Jeroboam chapa Zekaria chowm mang mih dow Juda pren kowi Uzia chowm mang mih 38 ning khe chekhai. Aia dow taruk la mowr Samari marow kowi chowmla mang khai. <verse eid="2KI 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 15:9" />Zekaria dow apipu-uüa iawng CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang khai. Now Nebat chapa Jeroboam changah mih lup ngak dow aia paw chang khai.<verse eid="2KI 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 15:10" />Jabes chapa Salum dow Zekaria kowi nasaita kownkow sangkrang khai, now aia dow Ibleam marow kowi maru kawmuüa pur kowi Zekaria kowi saiah khai. Now Zekaria takcha kowi dow aia ta chowm mang khai. <verse eid="2KI 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 15:11" />Zekaria kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten dow “Israel Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 15:12" />Maiawng hai Jehu kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih laiklow dow uang tachih khai bowt. Nakhowk khe kowh CHAKRAMANG tek pe Jehu mih, “En kowh krungchakuüa dow tali chowng mowr Israel pren kowi naka chowm mang kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel pren kowi Salum chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 15:13" />Israel pren kowi kowh Samari marow kowi Jabes chapa Salum chowm mang mih dow Juda pren kowi Uzia chowm mang mih 39 ning khe chekhai. Aia dow pala mowr Samari marow kowi chowmla mang khai. <verse eid="2KI 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 15:14" />Nami kung kowi Gadi chapa Menahem dow Tirza marow hownia Samari marow kowi uang khai, now nakowi dow Salum kowi aia saiah khai. Now aia dow Salum takcha kowi ta chowm mang khai. <verse eid="2KI 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 15:15" />Salum kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten hai aia kowi kowh kingküaah mih lawnguan dow “Israel Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 15:16" />Nakhowk khe Menahem dow Tirza marow hownia uang lawt hanow Tapua marow, marowchakuüa maten hai aria aret kowi kowh maru-uüa maten kowi senah khai. Now kum nau mih masiuüa hawmh kowh mu paw aia khuekla pe bowk khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow marowchakuüa dow aia kowi hawt ho pe marow tapplawt dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel pren kowi Menahem chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 15:17" />Israel pren kowi kowh Samari marow kowi Gadi chapa Menahem chowm mang mih dow Juda pren kowi Uzia chowm mang mih 39 ning khe chekhai. Aia dow hamüt ning mowr Samari marow kowi chowmla mang khai. <verse eid="2KI 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 15:18" />Aia dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang khai. Now Nebat chapa Jeroboam changah mih lup ngak dow aia paw chang khai. <verse eid="2KI 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 15:19" />Akat khe Asuria pren mang Tiglat-Pileser mih Israel pren kowi uang senah khai. Nakhowk khe Menahem dow Tiglat-Pileser khowngra hownia pren kowi kowh aia kowh mang chowm rah naia uowila reng kownkow Tiglat-Pileser kowi peah tai 875 mawn ngia chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 15:20" />Naiawngün tai tangka dow Asuriauüa kowh mang kowi napeah kownkow Israel kowi kowh kurengma miuüa hownia kür hown Menahem krawi pawah mih chekhai. Aia dow lowk ia kowi tai taruk iun chi krawi pawah khai. Naiawng rakowi Asuria pren mang dow Israel pren hownia powt khai.<verse eid="2KI 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 15:21" />Menahem kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten dow “Israel Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 15:22" />Menahem kowng kung kowi dow achapa Pekahia mih aia takcha ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="2KI 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel pren kowi Pekahia chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 15:23" />Israel pren kowi kowh Samari marow kowi Menahem chapa Pekahia chowm mang mih dow Juda pren kowi Uzia chowm mang mih 50 ning khe chekhai. Aia dow pre ning mowr Samari marow kowi chowmla mang khai. <verse eid="2KI 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 15:24" />Aia dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang khai. Now Nebat chapa Jeroboam changah mih lup ngak dow aia paw chang khai. <verse eid="2KI 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 15:25" />Remalia chapa Peka pami aia kowh siphai aluchow lowk ia dow aia kowi nakingküaah kown mih sangkrang khai. Nami aluchow dow Gilead süng hownia pawla maru 50 ia hanow Samari marow kowi mang kim kowi kowh akhawtma mih kim kowi mang Pekahia, Argawb hai Arie büah kowi saiah khai. Now Pekahia takcha kowi dow Peka mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="2KI 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 15:26" />Pekahia kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten dow “Israel Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel pren kowi Peka chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 15:27" />Israel pren kowi kowh Samari marow kowi Remalia chapa Peka chowm mang mih dow Juda pren kowi Uzia chowm mang mih 52 ning khe chekhai. Aia dow pirmi ning mowr Samari marow kowi chowmla mang khai. <verse eid="2KI 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 15:28" />Peka dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang khai. Now Nebat chapa Jeroboam changah mih lup ngak dow aia paw chang khai.<verse eid="2KI 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 15:29" />Israel pren kowi Peka chowm mang mih khin khe Asuria pren mang Tiglat-Pileser mih Israeluüa kowi uang plan senah khai iawk. Aia dow Israeluüa kowh Ijawn marow, Abel-Bet-Maka marow, Janoah marow, Kedes marow hai Hazawr marow powngta pe khai. Nami klen kowi Gilead süng, Galili süng hai Naptali süng maten paw aia powngta pe khai. Naiawngün hownia maru kawmuüa kowi khümla hanow Asuria pren kowi aia pawla khai. <verse eid="2KI 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 15:30" />Juda pren kowi Uzia chapa Jotham chowm mang mih pirmi ning khe Ela chapa Hosea dow Peka kowi nasaita kown mih sangkrang hanow saita khai. Now Peka takcha kowi dow Hosea mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="2KI 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 15:31" />Peka kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten dow “Israel Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Jotham chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 15:32" />Juda pren kowi Uzia chapa Jotham chowm mang mih dow Israel pren kowi Remalia chapa Peka chowm mang mih pre ning khe chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 15:33" />Jotham dow 25 ning khe chowm mang khai. Aia dow laitaruk ning mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. A-u dow Zadawk kowh chama Jerusa chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 15:34" />Jotham dow a-pa Uzia iawng CHAKRAMANG mik kowi aiungma mih lup chang reng chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 15:35" />Nachenganchepaw arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara dow aia krawi piakta dowi tak chekhai. Naiawngün arah kowi dow maru kawmuüa mih tawncher hown chang phuchua reng chekhai, now nam iungma mih maikhük paw towk reng chekhai. Aia dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh alowngma mih tapplawt thawp mih chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 15:36" />Jotham kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten dow “Juda Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 15:37" />Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG dow Juda pren kowi nakowsenah kownkow Asuria pren mang Rezin hai Israel pren mang Peka iüah kowi kowuown chinah khai. <verse eid="2KI 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 15:38" />Akung kowi Jotham dow kowng hanow David marow kowi maru dupah khai. Aia takcha kowi dow achapa Ahaz mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="2KI 15:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2KI 16" />
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Ahaz chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 16:1" />Juda pren kowi Jotham chapa Ahaz chowm mang mih dow Israel pren kowi Remalia chapa Peka chowm mang mih lairanit ning khe chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 16:2" />Ahaz dow pirmi ning khe chowm mang khai. Aia dow laitaruk ning mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. Aia dow CHAKRAMANG aia kowh Thurai mik kowi aiungma mih lup a-pu David chang iawng tawi chang dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 16:3" />Aia dow Israel manguüa iawng tawi chang angak khai. Aia dow aia kowh chapa kowi khowm maih kowi nawmah hanow phuchuala arup khai. Naiawng hai Israeluüa pur hownia kowh CHAKRAMANG prütta mih chenchapuüa iawng suiiai kaniaima mih lup aia tawi chang khai. <verse eid="2KI 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 16:4" />Aia dow arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara ün, hungh luk kowi ün hai aram chakma mih singh klim towng kowi ün tawncher hown chang phuchua reng chekhai, now nam iungma mih maikhük paw towk reng chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 16:5" />Siria pren mang Rezin hai Israel pren mang Peka iüah dow Jerusalem marow kowi uang senah kownkow uang khai. Now amatchi dow Ahaz hailawm marow mih uang umta lut khai. Nachenganchepaw mang Ahaz kowi dow nowng sen iüah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 16:6" />Nami khin khe Siria pren mang Rezin dow Elat marow hownia Judauüa kowi prütta khai, now nami marow dow aia plan powngta khai iawk. Nahanow Siriauüa dow Elat marow kowi kowuowi khai bowt. Amatni dow kawmat paw nakowi uowi reng tak chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 16:7" />Naiawng rakowi mang Ahaz dow Asuria pren mang Tiglat-Pileser tut-e kowchin maru hanow krawi tek pe mih, “Ang dow en kowh nar hai en kowh chapa chekhai. Siria pren mang hai Israel pren mang uang sen ang mih hownia uang lawng ang diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="2KI 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 16:8" />Nakhowk khe Ahaz dow CHAKRAMANG kim hai mang kim kowi kowh kuh hai tai ün pawah hanow awmrawm sung iawng hai Asuria pren mang vüi krawi sa pe khai. <verse eid="2KI 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 16:9" />Naiawng rakowi Asuria pren mang dow Ahaz kowi lawngah kown mih nauta khai. Nahanow aia dow Siriauüa kowh Damaska marow kri mih uang senah hanow powngta pe khai. Nami marowchakuüa kowi dow khümla hanow Kir marow kowi aia uang pawla khai, now Siria pren mang Rezin kowi paw aia saila khai.<verse eid="2KI 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 16:10" />Nakhowk khe mang Ahaz dow Damaska marow kowi kowkowi hanow mang Tiglat-Pileser hown kowtakrum khai. Now nakowi dow aia kowkhi phuchuara lowk khai. Nami phuchuara dow akuh kowi uowi iawng rowprowp nape thawpah kownkow uamow Uria kowi aia uang krawi sa pe akuh khai. <verse eid="2KI 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 16:11" />Naiawng rakowi uamow Uria dow Damaska marow hownia kowh mang Ahaz uang krawi sa pe mih akuh rowprowp thawp phuchuara lowk khai. Aia dow Damaska marow hownia Ahaz uang plan dowi rawn nami phuchuara mih ki thawpta khai bowt. <verse eid="2KI 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 16:12" />Mang Ahaz dow Damaska marow hownia uang plan hanow nami phuchuara mih uang khi khai bowt, now aia dow nami phuchuara kowi kowkowi hanow phuchuara luk kowi kowchang phuchua khai. <verse eid="2KI 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 16:13" />Nakowi dow tikah mih uanap, kawmdi uanap hai khamah mih uanap aia kowchang khai. Now taking tasangra uanap kowi kowh vi paw phuchuara kowi aia krawi thetah khai. <verse eid="2KI 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 16:14" />Aia dow CHAKRAMANG kim hai phuchuara sar takra kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG pur kowi towah mih kri hown kowh thawpah mih phuchuara prim mih cham sütta khai. Now nami phuchuara prim dow phuchuara sar tawngphak prakowi aia towah khai.<verse eid="2KI 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 16:15" />Nami kung kowi dow uamow Uria kowi maiawng hai mang Ahaz peah ana khai, “Khaleng hownia now paimi phuchuara sar kowi rau-e khe atungma en nakowchang tikah mih uanap kown, now iak pra khe dow atungma en nakowchang kawmdi uanap kown. Now mang kowh tikah mih uanap hai kawmdi uanap paw en nakowchang kown. Nami klen kowi prenchak maru kawmuüa uang pawla mih tikah mih uanap, kawmdi uanap hai khamah mih uanap paw en nakowchang kown. Tikah mih uanap hai akeng mih tawncher uanap kowi kowh vi dow nami phuchuara luk kowi en nakrawi thetah kown. Tawkche Thurai naukrang natukla kownkow paimi kri hown kowh phuchuara ang natawngah kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="2KI 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 16:16" />Uamow Uria dow mang Ahaz ana pek iawng rowprowp lup maten chang khai.<verse eid="2KI 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 16:17" />Mang Ahaz dow kri hown kowh thawpah mih tawkpla pletta bowk khai, now biatum ün dow aia cham pawla khai. Now kri hown kowh thawpah mih chia kum luk kowi kowh chowmah mih biatum dow cham sütta hanow hua chüng kowi cham chowmta hüah khai. <verse eid="2KI 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 16:18" />Now aia dow Asuria pren mang kowi nape sak-ihah kownkow Tanai Ni vüi CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh khupah mih uaniang paw lutta khai, now CHAKRAMANG kim kowi mang kowkowi khe kowh vüi hawt thawp pe mih kupra dow piakta khai bowt.<verse eid="2KI 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 16:19" />Mang Ahaz kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten dow “Juda Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 16:20" />Akung kowi mang Ahaz dow kowng hanow David marow kowi kowh aia pipu-uüa tadupra kowi maru dupah khai. Now aia takcha kowi dow achapa Hezekia mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="2KI 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2KI 17" />
  <para style="s">Israel pren kowi Hosea chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 17:1" />Israel pren kowi kowh Samari marow kowi Ela chapa Hosea chowm mang mih dow Juda pren kowi Ahaz chowm mang mih laipre ning khe chekhai. Aia dow taku ning mowr Samari marow kowi chowmla mang khai. <verse eid="2KI 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 17:2" />Aia dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang khai. Nachenganchepaw Israel pren kowi kowh rik chowm mang miuüa khowt aia dow tawi chang angak dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 17:3" />Asuria pren mang Salmaneser dow mang Hosea kowi uang senah khai. Naiawng rakowi Hosea dow mang Salmaneser nimkrüa kowi uowi takla khai, now aia dow ning towng mangmu paw Salmaneser kowi pek takla khai. <verse eid="2KI 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 17:4" />Akat khe mang Hosea dow Asuria pren mang kowi kingküaah kownkow Aigupta pren mang So tut-e kowlü khowng kown mih kowchin maru khai. Now ning towng kowh mangmu kawk paw Asuria pren mang kowi aia peah dowi bowt chekhai. Naiawng Hosea kuanah mih dow Salmaneser tukta khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi mang Salmaneser dow mang Hosea kowi khümah hanow thawngrum kowi towah khai.<verse eid="2KI 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samari marow piak mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 17:5" />Akung kowi dow Asuria pren mang Salmaneser mih aia kowh siphai hawmh hown Israel pren paprenma kowi krawi senah khai. Now amatni dow nami pren kowi kowh Samari marow mih sum ning mowr rumta büah hüah khai. <verse eid="2KI 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 17:6" />Israel pren kowi Hosea chowm mang mih taku ning khe Asuria pren mang Salmaneser dow Samari marow kowpowngta khai. Now nakowi kowh Israeluüa kowi dow Asuria pren kowi pawla khai. Now amatni kowi dow Hala marow, Habawr aw pang kowi kowh Gawzan süng hai Media chenchapuüa kowh marow kowi ün kür hown krawi pe uowiah khai.<verse eid="2KI 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chang lup ngak kowh Israeluüa ka ripra mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 17:7" />Israeluüa luk kowi naiawng uang phaw mih auan dow Aigupta pren hownia hai Aigupta pren kowi kowh Faraw nar lup changra hownia kowh uang lawtla mih CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai kowi kingküala mih lup ngak chang büah rakowi chekhai. Amatni dow akeng mih thuraiuüa kowi cham chupiia büah khai, <verse eid="2KI 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 17:8" />now amatni dow amatni pur hownia kowh CHAKRAMANG prütta mih chenchapuüa iawng tawi chang khai. Nami klen kowi Israel manguüa thawpah mih rirow iawng amatni tawi chün khai. <verse eid="2KI 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 17:9" />Israeluüa dow CHAKRAMANG ana pek kowi kingküala mih lup maten kukpa chang reng chekhai. Amatni dow aiukma mih marow kowi chepaw, asowmchow mih kua kowi chepaw amatni cham uowi rah towng kowi arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara krawi thawp büah reng chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 17:10" />Amatni dow alowngma mih arah towng hai aram chakma mih singh klim towng amatni naphuchuaah kown mih hua hai Asera limpu krawi phük khai. <verse eid="2KI 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 17:11" />Amatni dow amatni pur hownia CHAKRAMANG prütta mih chenchapuüa iawng arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara kowi tawi chang phuchua büah reng chekhai. Nami klen kowi CHAKRAMANG kunmaraula mih lup ngak paw ahuma chang büah khai. <verse eid="2KI 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 17:12" />Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG hangah khowk chepaw chup arup reng tak chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 17:13" />Israeluüa hai Judauüa nauowi kaneu kownkow CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh risiuüa maten hai khi mukmang miuüa maten kowi maiawng uang pe tekah khai, “Angak hownia uang plan büa diah. Now enni pipu-uüa nachünah kownkow ang peah mih ari aiang maten hai ang kowh nar risiuüa naphuang enni kownkow ang peah mih ana pek maten chünah büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 17:14" />Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa dow nami laiklow sünta dowi chekhai. Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai kowi owm dowi mih pipu-uüa iawng lai üa kürma chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 17:15" />Amatni dow rirow maten, amatni pipu-uüa vüi CHAKRAMANG tow pe mih sangbowk laitawm hai amatni kowi kowh tek pe mih maten nau chün büah dowi chekhai. Amatni dow asung uowi dowi mih thuraiuüa kowi cham chupiiara kowi amatni kowi paw kaah tawng dowi bowt. Amatni kowi dow amatni riaret kowi kowh chenchapuüa chowm krang uowi krang iawng natawi uowi dowi kownkow CHAKRAMANG hangah khowk chowdiah. Tawkche naiawng tawi uowi büah khai.<verse eid="2KI 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 17:16" />Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai kowh ana pek maten nuata khai. Now amatni dow amatni vüi lawngha hown klai chia chah rup pre buk khai, now Asera limpu thawp büah lowk khai. Amatni dow krek kowi hai Baal thuraiuüa kowi ün chupiia büah khai. <verse eid="2KI 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 17:17" />Amatni dow amatni kowh chauüa kowi khowm maih kowi nawmah hanow phuchuala arup khai. Amatni dow cham mü hawra khai, now chang mantan büah khai. Nami klen kowi CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang hanow CHAKRAMANG kowi towkah kunmarau büah khai.<verse eid="2KI 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 17:18" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow Israeluüa kowi lainowmma kunmarau khai, now amatni kowi dow aia pur hownia aia prütta khai. Naiawng rakowi ta uowi mih dow Juda krungchakuüa krowngchow towbowt. <verse eid="2KI 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 17:19" />Tawkche Juda krungchakuüa paw CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai ana pek chün dowi kowi Israeluüa tüngla pe mih angak iawng tawi chang büah khai. <verse eid="2KI 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 17:20" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow Israel krungchakuüa maten kowi nuata khai. Amatni kowi dow ransu-uüa rut kowi ap-ah hanow aia towkah ngare khai. Now amatni kowi dow aia pur hownia aia prütta khai.<verse eid="2KI 17:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 17:21" />David kowh pren Juda hownia Israeluüa kowi CHAKRAMANG lang kraah mih khin khe Israeluüa dow Nebat kowh chapa Jeroboam kowi pe chowmah mang khai. Now CHAKRAMANG kowi Israeluüa chupiia mih dow Jeroboam taingta pe hanow akraingma mih lup ngak aia pe changah khai. <verse eid="2KI 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 17:22" />Israeluüa dow Jeroboam changah mih angak maten chang reng chekhai. Amatni dow nami angak hownia uang plan dowi chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 17:23" />Achur kowi CHAKRAMANG dow aia nar risiuüa kowi kowh tek pe iawng aia pur hownia amatni kowi prütta khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa kowi dow amatni pren hownia khümla hanow Asuria pren kowi kowpawla khai bowt. Amatni dow kawmat paw nakowi chowreng tak chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel pren kowi Asuriauüa kowuowi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 17:24" />Asuria pren mang dow Babel marow, Kut marow, Ava marow, Hamat marow hai Sefarvaim marow hownia uang pawla maru hanow Israeluüa kowh uowi rah Samari riaret kowi kowh marow kowi krawi pe uowiah khai. Amatni dow Samari marow hai ariaret kowi kowh kua ün krawi powngta bowk hanow krawi uowi büah khai. <verse eid="2KI 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 17:25" />Nakowi uang uown uowi khe amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowi chupiia dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow amatni pungmadawng kowi uang chin pe krangsi hawmh khai. Naiawngün krangsi hawmh dow amatni kowi uang makah hanow kowngta sangrum khai. <verse eid="2KI 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 17:26" />Nakhowk khe maru lowk ia dow Asuria pren mang kowi maiawng uang phowng pe satang khai, “En khümla hanow Samari marow kowi en pe uowiah mih maru-uüa maten dow nami pren kowi kowh Thurai kowi tawng iawng chow chupiiaah kown mih tuk büah dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Thurai dow amatni pungmadawng kowi uang chin pe krangsi hawmh hanow amatni kowi kowngta khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 17:27" />Nakhowk khe Asuria pren mang dow aia maru-uüa kowi maiawng peah ana khai, “Samari marow hownia kowh enni uang khümla mih uamowuüa pungmadawng hownia nami marow kowi kowchin lowk ia diah. Aia dow nakowi pacham tawi uowi lah, now nakowi kowh maru-uüa kowi Thurai kowi chupiia krang pacham tüngsangah lah,” pakhai. <verse eid="2KI 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 17:28" />Naiawng rakowi Samari marow hownia kowh khümla mih uamowuüa pungmadawng hownia Bethel marow kowi kowchin lowk ia khai bowt. Now aia dow maru-uüa kowi tawng iawng chow Thurai kowi chupiiaah kown mih krang krawi tüngsangah khai.<verse eid="2KI 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 17:29" />Nachenganchepaw kua hai marow kowi kowh krawi uowi mih maru-uüa dow amatni uowi rah towng kowi chowlowkkow thurai rup thawp büah khai. Now naiawngün arup dow Israeluüa thawpah mih arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara kowi krawi towah büah khai. <verse eid="2KI 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 17:30" />Naiawng hai Babel marowchakuüa thawpah mih dow Sukawt-Benawt thurai, Kut marowchakuüa thawpah mih dow Nergal thurai, Hamat marowchakuüa thawpah mih dow Asima thurai, <verse eid="2KI 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 17:31" />now Ava marowchakuüa thawpah mih dow Nibhaz hai Tartak thurai chekhai. Now Sefarvaim marowchakuüa dow amatni kowh Adramelek thurai hai Anamelek thurai vüi amatni kowh chauüa kowi maih kowi nawmah hanow changla phuchua khai. <verse eid="2KI 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 17:32" />Amatni dow bowkbowk CHAKRAMANG kowi paw chupiiala reng chekhai, now arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara kowi ün nachang uamow lup kownkow amatni pungmadawng hownia achaing achaing mih maru tow büah khai. <verse eid="2KI 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 17:33" />Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowi chupiiala khai, now Samari marow kowi amatni uang uowi dowi tak khe kowh amatni pren kowi kowh rirow iawng amatni chowlowkkow thuraiuüa kowi paw chupiiala reng chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 17:34" />Amatni dow kawmat paw naiawngün rirow prim mih chün büah reng tak chekhai. Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowi achingma chupiia mih nadowi chekhai, now Jakawb chapauüa tut-e kowh CHAKRAMANG peah mih ari iang hai ana pek chün büah dowi chekhai. Jakawb kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG rük pe ming sar mih dow Israel chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 17:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 17:35" />Israeluüa hown tatow sangbowk laitawm mih khin khe CHAKRAMANG dow maiawng amatni kowi peah ana khai, “Akeng thuraiuüa kowi dow ringkawma hown enni nakram kown nadowi, amatni pur kowi dow enni natabawk kown nadowi, amatni kowi dow enni natawi chupiia kown nadowi, now amatni vüi enni nachang phuchua kown nadowi. <verse eid="2KI 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 17:36" />Tawkche Aigupta pren hownia akürma mih rut hown uang lawtla enni mih CHAKRAMANG kowi chowtaih enni nachupiia kown. Aia pur kowi chowtaih enni natabawk kown, now aia vüi kowi chowtaih enni nachang phuchua kown. <verse eid="2KI 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 17:37" />Enni vüi kowi kowh aia rui enni mih ari arow, alow pek, ari aiang hai ana pek dow kaneuma enni nachünah kown. Akeng thuraiuüa kowi enni nachup naiia kown nadowi. <verse eid="2KI 17:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 17:38" />Enni hown kowh ang tatowah mih sangbowk laitawm dow sak kowi towah büah reng diah. Akeng thuraiuüa kowi enni nachupiia kown nadowi. <verse eid="2KI 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2KI 17:39" />CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi chowtaih enni nachupiia kown. Nahanow enni ransu-uüa maten hownia aia chowtaih nalawng enni kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 17:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2KI 17:40" />Tawkche Israel pren kowi kowh uang uowi mih akeng mih chenchapuüa dow naiawngün laiklow sünta dowi chekhai. Amatni dow alai khe kowh chowm krang uowi krang prim iawng uowi büah khai. <verse eid="2KI 17:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="2KI 17:41" />Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowi paw chupiiala khai, now amatni kowh akeng mih thuraiuüa kowi paw chupiiala khai. Kawmat paw amatni kowh chauüa hai chu-uüa dow amatni pipu-uüa chang iawng rowprowp chang büah khai.<verse eid="2KI 17:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2KI 18" />
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Hezekia chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 18:1" />Juda pren kowi Ahaz chapa Hezekia chowm mang mih dow Israel pren kowi Ela chapa Hosea chowm mang mih sum ning khe chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 18:2" />Juda pren kowi Hezekia dow 25 ning khe chowm mang khai. Aia dow 29 ning mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. A-u dow Zekaria chama Abija chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 18:3" />Hezekia dow a-pu David iawng CHAKRAMANG mik kowi aiungma mih lup chang reng chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 18:4" />Aia dow arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara ün krawi piakta khai, chupiiaah mih hua ün dita pe nak khai, now Asera limpu paw krawi kripta khai. Now kri hown kowh Mosi thawpah mih rua rup paw aia dita naknak khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami khin khe paw Israeluüa dow nami rua rup tut-e chang phuchua reng tak chekhai. Nami rua rup ming dow Nehustan chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 18:5" />Hezekia dow CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai luk kowi neplawng nesak khai. Aia iawng mih dow Juda pren manguüa pungmadawng kowi miapaw uowi dowi bowt chekhai; aia dowi rawn paw uowi dowi tak, now aia kung kowi paw uowi dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 18:6" />Aia dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e asima tatown reng chekhai, now Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah mih ana pek maten aia chün reng chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 18:7" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow aia tut-e tawi uowi reng chekhai. Aia changah mih lup maten dow aiungma uang phaw reng chekhai. Aia dow Asuria pren mang kowi kingküaah hanow pe pe mangmu dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 18:8" />Aia dow Gaza marow hai aria aret kowi kowh süng maten, aiukma mih marow hownia asowmchow mih kua mowr mih Filistinuüa uowi rah kowi krawi senah hanow krawi powngta khai.<verse eid="2KI 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 18:9" />Asuria pren mang Salmaneser dow Samari marow kowi uang senah kownkow uang rumta hüah khai. Naiawng phaw mih dow Juda pren kowi Hezekia chowm mang mih tali ning khe chekhai, now Israel pren kowi Ela chapa Hosea chowm mang mih ranit ning khe chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 18:10" />Sum ning mowr Samari marow rumta kung kowi dow Asuria pren mang mih nami marow powngta khai bowt. Naiawng phaw mih dow Juda pren kowi Hezekia chowm mang mih taruk ning khe chekhai, now Israel pren kowi Ela chapa Hosea chowm mang mih taku ning khe chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 18:11" />Nami khin khe Asuria pren mang Salmaneser dow Israeluüa kowi khümla hanow Asuria pren kowi pawla khai. Now amatni kowi dow Hala marow, Habawr aw pang kowi kowh Gawzan süng hai Media chenchapuüa kowh marow kowi ün kür hown krawi pe uowiah khai. <verse eid="2KI 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 18:12" />Israeluüa luk kowi naiawng uang phaw mih auan dow CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai laiklow chün büah dowi rakowi chekhai. Amatni dow Mosi hown kowh CHAKRAMANG tatowah mih sangbowk laitawm piakta büah khai. CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek maten dow sünta büah dowi, now chün paw chün büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judauüa kowi senah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 18:13" />Hezekia chowm mang mih laitali ning khe Asuria pren mang Senakerib dow Juda pren kowi kowh tap uowi mih marow maten kowi krawi senah khai, now naiawngün marow dow powngta pe bowk khai. <verse eid="2KI 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 18:14" />Nakhowk khe Juda pren mang Hezekia dow Lakhis marow kowi Asuria pren mang tut-e kowchin pe maru hanow krawi tek pe mih, “Ang changta en angak khai. Sakrauma hown taingta tasen bowt diah. En kük ang mih sia ang nape en kown towbowt,” pakhai. Nahanow Asuria pren mang dow Juda pren mang Hezekia kowi tai 260 mawn ngia hai kuh 25 mawn ngia kük pe khai. <verse eid="2KI 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 18:15" />Naiawng rakowi Hezekia dow CHAKRAMANG kim hai mang kim kowi kowh tai uowi mih maten Asuria pren mang kowi peta bowk khai. <verse eid="2KI 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 18:16" />Nami klen kowi CHAKRAMANG kimbüng hai kimplawt mawm kowi kowh sowah mih kuh krawi krüaah hanow Asuria pren mang kowi krawi peah khai.<verse eid="2KI 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem marow napiakta kown mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 18:17" />Asuria pren mang dow Lakhis marow hownia siphai aluchowuüa kowi kowh lang kri mih sum ia kowi siphai thumchak aiukma hown Jerusalem marow kowi nakowsen mang Hezekia kownkow kowchinah khai. Amatni dow Jerusalem marow kowi uang ting hanow aluk kanh hownia kowh tui iu hawrra re-e maru-uüa chuh pe dawnguan mih rah kowi uang tanai büah khai. Nami tui hawrra dow dowm kowi kowh tiama ria kowi chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 18:18" />Nami kung kowi amatni dow mang Hezekia kowi nakowhaw kownkow kowchin maru khai. Nakhowk khe Hezekia kowh maru iuk sum ia dow uang lawt hanow kowbüah hown uang takrum khai. Naiawngün maru iuk sum ia pungmadawng kowi kowh lowk ia dow mang kim kowi kowh kruitown mih Hilkia chapa Eliakim, alowk mih dow mang kowh cha rui mih Sebna, now alowk mih dow mang kowh ana pek phuang mih Asaf chapa Joa chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 18:19" />Nakhowk khe nami sum ia kowi lowk ia mih tek pe kowbüah mih, “Lang kri mih Asuria pren mang kowh laiklow mang Hezekia kowi maiawng kowtek pe büa diah, ‘Tawng luk kowi chow en neplawng nesak? <verse eid="2KI 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 18:20" />En kowh dow laiklow krowngchow taih; en kowh dow tawngpaw kür uowi dowi chekhai. Sam tek madiah, mia luk kowi chow en sakowmla kowh en uang kingküa ang? <verse eid="2KI 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 18:21" />En neplawng nesak mih dow Aigupta pren luk kowi chekhai. Tawkche Aigupta dow aphukma mih uaklung kawng iawng chekhai. Nami uaklung kawng kowi changla raitua mih maru dow chukta rut reng chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Aigupta pren mang Faraw kowi dow mapaw kaah sakowm dowi chekhai,’ pape diah. <verse eid="2KI 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 18:22" />Nakhowk khe, ‘Anging neplawng nesak mih dow CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai luk kowi chekhai,’ padow enni natek ang chepaw naia kown. Tawkche Thurai kowi chowbowt nadowi bow mang Hezekia peah rukrai mih? Arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara hai phuchuara ün Hezekia piakta mih dow nami Thurai kowh chowbowt nadowi bow? Judauüa hai Jerusalem marowchakuüa kowi dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh phuchuara kowi chowtaih nachupiia kown mih Hezekia tek pe khowk nadowi bow?<verse eid="2KI 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 18:23" />“Enni kowh mang kowi kowtek pe diah. Ang kowh chakramang Asuria pren mang mih enni vüi maiawng nachang enni kown nauta. Tuk chowm kawrnga mih maru iun che enni nowng tüng ang 2,000 ia hanow ang nape enni kawrnga 2,000 kown. <verse eid="2KI 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 18:24" />Nakhowt chow khowm uowi dowi tak hanow Aigupta pren kowi kowh kawrnga kari hai kawrnga kowi kowh chowm miuüa kowi enni neplawng nesak chepaw Asuria pren mang kowh lang sowm mih maru kowi khowm enni nanowng kown nadowi tak. <verse eid="2KI 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 18:25" />CHAKRAMANG tek ang dowi kowi mami pren nauang piak kownkow ang uang sen mih chekhai bow? Mami pren uang senah hanow napiakta kown mih CHAKRAMANG ngengche tek ang khowk chekhai,” pape diah.<verse eid="2KI 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 18:26" />Nakhowk khe tasen kowi kowh aluchow kowi amatni tek pe mih, “Chakramang, sakrauma hai Aramaik lai hown klang anging diah. Nami lai anging tukta chow. Hebrai lai hown hauang klang anging diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow tap luk kowi kowh maru-uüa natawi tukta bowk kown chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 18:27" />Nachenganchepaw nami aluchow tek pe kowbüah mih, “Naiawngün laiklow nauang tek kownkow ang kowh chakramang uang chin ang mih enni kowh mang hai enni tut-e krowngchow nadowi chekhai. Naiawngün laiklow dow tap luk kowi kowh maru-uüa vüi paw na chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow mami marow dow anging nauang rumta kown. Nakhowk khe enni kawm iawng amatni paw natawi kawm kown. Amatni paw chakkham sakkrai lai rakowi kowmatia kowh kih nacha kown, now kowmatia kowh iantui nakham kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 18:28" />Nami kung kowi dow tasen kowi kowh aluchow mih iowng hanow tap luk kowi kowh maru-uüa ta bowk iawng Hebrai lai hown atün atünma tek mih, “Enni mih Asuria pren kowi kowh mangkri laiklow sünta büa diah, <verse eid="2KI 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 18:29" />‘Mang Hezekia nowng kuan enni dowi iawng uowiah büa diah. Aia dow ang kowh kür hownia nowng lawng enni kown nadowi. <verse eid="2KI 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 18:30" />CHAKRAMANG kowi enni naowmla kownkow aia dow maiawng natek enni chepaw naia kown, “CHAKRAMANG nalawng a-i ngengche kown. Mami marow dow Asuria pren mang rut kowi naap-ah kown nadowi,” napah kown. Tawkche nami laiklow enni naowm kown nadowi,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 18:31" />Tasen kowi kowh aluchow plan tek mih, “Asuria pren mang tek mih, ‘Ang hown tatow sangbowk laitawm büa diah, now marow hownia uang lawt hanow ang tut-e uang tawi uowi büa diah. Nahanow enni chowlowkkow kowh grep ruih hownia hai uidut singh hownia enni naka cha uih kown, now kowmatia tuikuam hownia kowh tui enni naka kham kown. <verse eid="2KI 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 18:32" />Nami kung kowi dow ang nauang hanow enni kowh pren iawng mih pren kowi ang nacham pawla enni kown. Nakowi dow luprak hownia enni naka kawmdi kown, now grep krum hownia enni naka grep tui sar kown, now kanrawn sau hai kuai tui enni naka kown. Ang laiklow iawng enni chang hanow akhawr hown enni nakowng kown nadowi. CHAKRAMANG nalawng enni kown taih pahai Hezekia tek enni khe hangkow sünta büah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow nami laiklow hown kuan enni mih chowbowt. <verse eid="2KI 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 18:33" />Asuria pren mang kür hownia akeng chenchapuüa kowh thuraiuüa mih amatni kowh pren nowng lawng mih uowi ne khowk bow? <verse eid="2KI 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 18:34" />Tawng kowi chow Hamat marow hai Arpad marowchakuüa kowh thuraiuüa? Tawng kowi chow Sefarvaim marow, Hena marow hai Ava marowchakuüa kowh thuraiuüa? Naiawngün thuraiuüa mih ang kowh kür hownia Samari marow kowi nowng lawng tak bow? <verse eid="2KI 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 18:35" />Naiawngün pren kowi kowh thuraiuüa maten dow ang kowh kür hownia amatni kowh pren kowi miapaw nowng lawng dowi chekhai. Nami kowi tawng iawng chow CHAKRAMANG mih Jerusalem marow kowi ang kowh kür hownia nowng lawng kown?’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 18:36" />Nachenganchepaw maru kawmuüa dow tawng iawng paw klangah dowi kowi rarimma uowi büah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naklangah dowi kownkow amatni kowi dow mang Hezekia rik tek pe khowk chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 18:37" />Nami kung kowi dow mang kim kowi kowh kruitown mih Hilkia chapa Eliakim, mang kowh cha rui mih Sebna hai satang phowng mih Asaf chapa Joa büah mih sak piak rakowi amatni kowh tawnguat thekah büah khai. Nami kung kowi dow amatni mih mang kim kowi uang büah khai, now Asuria pren hownia kowh tasen kowi kowh aluchow krawi tek pe mih maten Hezekia kowi uang tek pe büah khai.<verse eid="2KI 18:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2KI 19" />
  <para style="s">Risi Isai tut-e mang Hezekia kowpaw prengia mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 19:1" />Mang Hezekia dow nami laiklow tata hanow aia kowh tawnguat thekta khai, now khup sala uan khai. Now CHAKRAMANG kim kowi aia kowkowi khai. <verse eid="2KI 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 19:2" />Now mang kim kowi kowh kruitown mih Eliakim, mang kowh cha rui mih Sebna hai uamow aluchowuüa kowi dow sala uan khupma hown risi Isai tut-e aia kowchinah khai. Risi Isai dow Amawz kowh chapa chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 19:3" />Now amatni dow Hezekia krawi pe tekah mih laiklow maiawng risi Isai kowi kowtek pe khai, “Ani dow tuak kawm tuak krat ni, rukraira ni hai ming piakra ni chekhai. A-i dow chah uang tarung tawlaw khowk chepaw kür uowi dowi kowh nowng pen dowi mih masiuüa iawng chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 19:4" />Tasen kowi kowh aluchow kowi Asuria pren mang uang chinah mih dow masing Thurai kowi nauang khareah kownkow chekhai. CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai dow naiawngün laiklow nata bowt, now nami maru kowi naripah chepaw naia. A-i pungmadawng kowi kowh ta sing uowi miuüa vüi kowi chupla a-i Thurai reng diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="2KI 19:5-6" />Nami satang tata hanow risi Isai tek pe amatni mih, “Enni kowh mang kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow maiawng kowtek pe diah, ‘Asuria pren mang uang chinah mih maru iukuüa uang khare ang mih lawnguan kowi hangkow kram diah. <verse eid="2KI 19:5-6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 19:7" />Sünta, aia kowi dow kramra saktuak ang napeah kown. Naiawng rakowi aia dow tata satang hanow aia pren kowi naplan kown, now nakowi dow aia kowi mih saidawng hown ang nasaiah kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asuriauüa uang plan tüng kram mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 19:8" />Akung kowi nami tasen kowi kowh aluchow dow Asuria pren mang Senakerib mih Lakhis marow hownia lawt hanow Libna marowchakuüa hown tasen mih satang ta khai. Naiawng rakowi tasen kowi kowh aluchow dow nakowi kowtawi kowi khai.<verse eid="2KI 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 19:9" />Nami khin khe Asuria pren mang dow aia kowi nauang senah kownkow Ethiawpia pren mang Tirhaka uang lawt mih satang ta khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow aia kowh satang phowng miuüa kowi mang Hezekia tut-e uang chinah khai iawk. Now amatni kowi aia krawi tek pe mih, <verse eid="2KI 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 19:10" />“Juda pren mang Hezekia kowi enni nakowtek pe kown mih, ‘En owmah mih Thurai dow Jerusalem marow mih Asuria pren mang rut kowi naap-ah kown nadowi pahai tek en khai. Nami laiklow hown Thurai kuan en kown mih hownia kaneu ba. <verse eid="2KI 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 19:11" />Akeng mih pren maten kowi asaima Asuria pren mang piakta mih lawnguan en ta khowk chekhai. Naiawng e tawng iawng chow en naplai kown mih en tuk ka tuak khai? <verse eid="2KI 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 19:12" />Ang kowh pipu-uüa dow Gawzan marowchakuüa, Haran marowchakuüa, Rezef marowchakuüa hai Tel-Asar marow kowi kowh Eden chenchapuüa kowi piakta bowk khai. Nakhowk khe amatni kowh thuraiuüa amatni kowi nowng lawngah tak bow? <verse eid="2KI 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 19:13" />Hamat marow mang, Arpad marow mang, Sefarvaim marow mang, Hena marow mang hai Iva marow mang büah kowng bowk nadowi bow?’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hezekia chup Thurai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 19:14" />Mang Hezekia dow satang phowng miuüa rut hownia chasak paw hanow phatah khai. Nami kung kowi aia dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowkowi hanow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nami chasak kowtowah khai. <verse eid="2KI 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 19:15" />Now aia chup Thurai mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai, en dow Cherup rup pre buk mih takra kowi kowh uowi mih chekhai. Palusama kowh Thurai dow en chowtaih. Mukuang hai lusa thawp mih dow en chowtaih. <verse eid="2KI 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 19:16" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh laiklow hawt sünta diah, now anging luk kowi tawng chow own mih iu mü diah. En masing Thurai kowi mang Senakerib uang khare mih iu sünta diah.<verse eid="2KI 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 19:17" />“Aw CHAKRAMANG, chenchap ahuma hai amatni kowh pren dow Asuria pren manguüa piakta khai nowm. <verse eid="2KI 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 19:18" />Now amatni dow naiawngün chenchapuüa kowh thuraiuüa kowi maih kowi nawmta pe khai. Naiawng amatni nowng piak mih dow Thurai ching nadowi rakowi chekhai. Naiawngün dow singh hai hua hown kowh maru thawpah mih thuraiuüa chowtaih. <verse eid="2KI 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 19:19" />Aw CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai, kawmat mih Asuria pren mang hownia uang lawng anging diah. Nahanow lusa kowi kowh pren maten dow en chowtaih Thurai pami natuk kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang Senakerib napiak kown mih lawnguan kowi risi Isai kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 19:20" />Nakhowk khe Amawz chapa Isai dow Hezekia kowi uang krawi phowng pe satang khai. Aia krawi tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih, ‘Asuria pren mang Senakerib lawnguan kowi kowh en awr tek mih ang ta khowk,’ pakhai. <verse eid="2KI 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 19:21" />Senakerib lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2KI 19:21" />
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:21">“‘Jerusalem marowchakuüa dow sui en khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:21">amatni dow changla en rensi kau khai.<verse eid="2KI 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 19:22" />“‘Amia kowi chow en khareah mih?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:22">Amia kowi chow en peah rukrai mih?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:22">Amia kowi chow kingküaah kownkow atünma en klangah mih?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:22">Amia kowi chow changla bawri se en müah mih?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:22">Naiawng en chang mih dow Thurai kowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:22">Israeluüa kowh chimsaima mih Thurai kowi chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 19:23" />CHAKRAMANG kowi nakhare kownkow en kowh satang phowng miuüa kowi en uang chinah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">En tek pe mih, “Ang kowh kawrnga kari maten hown hungh chut kowi ang kowpün khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">Lebanawn kowi kowh lang lowng mih hungh chut kowi ang kowpün khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">nakowi kowh lang kro mih sidar singh dow ang kripta khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">lang iung mih sasua singh dow ang ngawnta khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">Nakowi kowh singh rüm krawngta kowi ang kowkowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">nakowi kowh aiuma mih kaurawng kowi ang kowkup khai.<verse eid="2KI 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 19:24" />Prenlang kowi dow ang krawi thai tuikuam khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:24">nakowi kowh tui dow ang kham khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:24">Aigupta pren kowi kowh aw ün ang thuata bowk khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:24">Naiawng rakowi nakowi kowh aw tui dow kang khai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 19:25" />“‘En tawi ta dowi tak bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:25">Mami dow auown khe ia ang rik khowmta khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:25">Mami dow ang rik sangkrangta mih akrama khowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:25">mami dow kawmat ang uang pe phawah khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:25">Naiawng rakowi tap uowi mih marow ün en ia piak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:25">naiawngün marow kowi hua chun iawng en krawi ia chang khai.<verse eid="2KI 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 19:26" />Kawmat dow nakowi kowh maru-uüa kür uowi dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:26">amatni dow lainowmma kram hai rukrai khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:26">Amatni dow bawrchak iawng nowng changra uowi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:26">awr tak mih singh ram iawng kür uowi dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:26">Amatni dow kimluk kowi kowh bawrchak iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:26">awr sa dowi rawn keu mih bawrchak iawng chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 19:27" />“‘Tawkche en kowi aiungma ang tuk en,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:27">tawng kowi chow en cham uowi mih ang tuk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:27">En cham kowi mih hai en uang mang mih khin ang tuk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:27">tawng iawng chow ang luk kowi en kunmarau mih paw ang tuk bowk chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 19:28" />Ang luk kowi en kunmarau khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:28">now en bawri mih lawnguan ang ta khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:28">Naiawng rakowi ang nau iawng ang natela en kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:28">en nakawng kowi ang naphawk en napha kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:28">now en nawr kowi ang namak en lawngha klowk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:28">Nahanow en uang mih tiama iawng ang nape plan en iawk kown,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 19:29" />Nami kung kowi mang Hezekia kowi Isai tek pe mih, “Hezekia, ang tekah mih aching chekhai pami amatra dow maiawng naown kown:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2KI 19:29" />
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:29">“Mami ning dow iawngpa awr phaw mih chowtaih enni nacha kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:29">ning thowi paw iawngpa awr phaw mih chowtaih enni nacha kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:29">Tawkche thowi ning khe dow enni nasawt liu kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:29">now enni nakua luprak kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:29">Nakhowk khe dow enni nachang grep krum kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:29">now grep krum hownia enni naka cha uih kown.<verse eid="2KI 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 19:30" />Juda krungchakuüa dow nata plai ne tak kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:30">amatni dow aprün sawt mih singh iawng nakür iawlaw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:30">now singh kowi auih apau thawn iawng naprung nase büah kown.<verse eid="2KI 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 19:31" />Ta plai mih maru-uüa dow Jerusalem marow hownia nakrawi tauet kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:31">amatni dow Zaiawn marow hownia nakrawi tauet kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:31">Nami lup nachang kown mih CHAKRAMANG lainowmma süngür chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 19:32" />“Naiawng rakowi Asuria pren mang lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:32">‘Aia dow mami marow kowi nauang kup kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:32">makowi dow salangba asekchow khowm aia nauang ap kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:32">Kawngma hown marow tapplawt re-e aia nauang kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:32">nasen marow kownkow marow tap uat kowi aia nachun bawn kown nadowi.<verse eid="2KI 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 19:33" />Aia dow aia pren kowi naplan kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:33">aia uangla mih tiama iawng aia naplan iawk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:33">Mami marow kowi aia nauang kup kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:33">ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="2KI 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 19:34" />Mami marow kowi dow kawngma iawng ang nataka kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:34">mami marow kowi dow ang takhula kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:34">Ang nakala ringkawra kownkow naiawng ang nachang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:34">now ang nar David tut-e kowh laikham iawng ang nachang kown,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 19:35" />Nami iak khe CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu dow uang lawt hanow Asuriauüa kowh tangbung khupra kowi kowkowi khai, now Asuria siphai hawmh 185,000 ia kowi saita khai. Now auai rau khe ta sing uowi mih siphaiuüa dow arah maten kowi uak takuakla pan mih khi büah khai. <verse eid="2KI 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 19:36" />Naiawng rakowi Asuria pren mang Senakerib dow aia kowh siphaiuüa kowi pawla hanow aia pren kowi kowplan khai bowt. Now amatni dow Asuria pren kowi kowh Ninevi marow kri kowi kowuowi khai bowt.<verse eid="2KI 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 19:37" />Akat khe Senakerib dow aia kowh Nisrawk thurai kim kowi kowkowi hanow kowchupiia Nisrawk khai. Nakhowk khe achapa Adramelek hai Sarezer iüah dow saidawng hown a-pa kowi saiah khai, now amatchi dow Ararat pren kowi cham powt iüah khai. A-pa takcha dow amatchi kowh tainau Esarhadawn mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="2KI 19:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2KI 20" />
  <para style="s">Mang Hezekia kowh arau iung mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 20:1" />Nami khin khe Hezekia dow arau uowi hanow dih lai kowh kowng ngialia phaw khai. Nakhowk khe Hezekia tut-e Amawz chapa risi Isai kowkowi hanow tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Tawng chow achang takla mih kimchakuüa kowi khowmla bowkla pe diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowh arau naiung kown nadowi bowt. En nakowng kown towbowt,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 20:2" />Nami tata hanow Hezekia dow kimbang prakowi haidang hanow CHAKRAMANG tut-e awr tek mih, <verse eid="2KI 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 20:3" />“Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kaah sakowm iawng ang uowi khai, now en tut-e iung iawng ang chang khai. Nami dow ka tuakah diah,” pakhai. Now Hezekia dow lainowmma kar khai.<verse eid="2KI 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 20:4" />Risi Isai mih lawt hanow mang kim takra kowi kowh viadawng hainowng pown dowi khowk chow tak khe aia tut-e CHAKRAMANG laiklow uang ting khai. CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, <verse eid="2KI 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 20:5" />“Ang kowh maru-uüa kowh aluchow Hezekia tut-e kowplan diah. Now CHAKRAMANG a-pu David kowh Thurai laiklow maiawng kowtek pe diah, ‘En awr tekah mih ang ta khowk, now en kowh mik tui vüng mih paw ang khi khowk. En kowh arau ang naiungta en kown. Sum ni kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi en nakowkowi kown. <verse eid="2KI 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 20:6" />En kowi dow ang nape sing en laitanga ning tak kown. En hai mami marow kowi mih Asuria pren mang rut hownia ang nalawngah kown. Nami marow ang nalawngah kown mih dow ang nakala ringkawra kownkow hai ang nar David tut-e kowh laikham uowi iawng nachang kownkow chekhai,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 20:7" />Akung kowi Hezekia kowh naruüa kowi Isai tek pe mih, “Uang pawla uidut uih nek ia diah,” pakhai. Nahanow anaruüa dow nami nek ia uang pawla hanow Hezekia kowh bau luk kowi uang phawk pe khai, now aia kowh bau dow iung khai bowt.<verse eid="2KI 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 20:8" />Nami dowi rawn khe Isai kowi Hezekia lüntaah mih, “CHAKRAMANG naiungta ang arau kown mih hai sum ni kung kowi CHAKRAMANG kim kowi ang naia kowi kown mih amatra tawng chow?” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 20:9" />Nakhowk khe Isai klangah mih, “CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh laikham iawng nachang en kown mih amatra natüng en lowk kown. Pur prakowi nim natakuak hamüt bowk kown mih bow en nau, dowdow kung prakowi nim natakuak hamüt bowk kown mih bow en nau?” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 20:10" />Hezekia klangah mih, “Pur prakowi nim natakuak hamüt bowk kown mih dow aiachow taih. Naiawng rakowi kung prakowi nim pacham takuak hamüt bowk lah,” pape khai. <verse eid="2KI 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 20:11" />Naiawng rakowi Isai dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e awr tek pe khai. Nahanow CHAKRAMANG dow Ahaz kowh dawngbowk kowi kowh iu takuak mih nim hownia kung prakowi hamüt bowk mowr nim mih pe takuakah khai.<verse eid="2KI 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hezekia tut-e Babulawn pren hownia satang phowng mih uang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 20:12" />Nami khin khe Babulawn pren mang Baladan chapa Merawdak-Baladan dow Hezekia arau uowi mih satang ta khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow kowchin maru ne hanow Hezekia kowi chasak hai awmrawm sung krawi sa pe khai. <verse eid="2KI 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 20:13" />Hezekia dow naiawngün maru-uüa kowi hawt chumah khai. Now amatni kowi dow aia mang kim kowi kowh uowi mih srui — kuh, tai, nam iungma mih chap, asung khakma mih sau, aia kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng ün — aia tüngta pe bowk khai. Aia dow aia mang kim kowi kowh hai paprenma kowi kowh uowi mih maten mih amatni kowi tüngta pe bowk khai.<verse eid="2KI 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 20:14" />Nakhowk khe risi Isai dow mang Hezekia tut-e kowkowi hanow kowlüntaah mih, “Pai iawngün maru-uüa tawng chow tek en? Tawng hownia kowh amatni uang mih chow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 20:14">Hezekia klangah mih, “Amatni dow alakma mih Babulawn pren hownia kowh uang mih chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 20:15" />Risi lüntaah mih, “En kowh mang kim kowi tawng ngai khowk chow kowbüah krawi khita?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 20:15">Hezekia klangah mih, “Ang kim kowi kowh uowi mih maten dow amatni krawi khita bowk khowk. Mang kowh uanh towk rah kowi kowh uowi mih maten dow amatni kowi ang tüngta pe bowk khowk,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 20:16" />Nakhowk khe Hezekia kowi Isai tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek mih sünta diah. <verse eid="2KI 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 20:17" />Aia tek mih, ‘Pakat khe dow en kowh mang kim kowi kowh uowi mih maten hai ani mowr kowh en pipu-uüa ta krümla mih uanh maten Babulawn pren kowi napawla bowk kown; tawngpaw nata lawt kown nadowi. <verse eid="2KI 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 20:18" />En matia krungchakuüa kowi dow nakhümla hanow Babulawn pren kowi napawla sangrum kown, now amatni kowi dow nakletah hanow Babulawn pren mang kim kowi nape changah lup kown,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 20:19" />Nakhowk khe Hezekia klangah mih, “CHAKRAMANG hownia kowh en tekah mih laiklow iung chow,” pakhai. Naiawng Hezekia tek mih dow aia sing uowi mowr thaulangma hai aiungma aia naka uowi kown taih padow aia ka tuak rakowi chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hezekia kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 20:20" />Hezekia kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten, tasen awng lawnguan, thai kanh mih lawnguan hai thai hungh hanow marow kowi uang pawla tui mih lawnguan dow “Juda Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 20:21" />Hezekia kowng kung kowi dow achapa Manase mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="2KI 20:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2KI 21" />
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Manase chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 21:1" />Manase dow laipre ning khe chowm mang khai, now aia dow 55 ning mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. A-u ming dow Hefziba chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 21:2" />Mang Manase dow Israeluüa pur hownia kowh CHAKRAMANG prütta mih chenchapuüa iawng CHAKRAMANG mik kowi suiiai kaniaima mih lup tawi chang khai. <verse eid="2KI 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 21:3" />Apa Hezekia krawi piakta khowk mih arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara ün aia krawi plan chang khai iawk. Now Israel mang Ahab chang iawng aia paw Baal thuraiuüa vüi thawp phuchuara ün khai, now Asera limpu ün tawi thawp khai. Aia dow kuang dawng kowi kowh krek ün kowi chupiia khai. <verse eid="2KI 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 21:4" />“Jerusalem marow kowi ang nauowi kown” pahai CHAKRAMANG tekah mih aia kowh CHAKRAMANG kim kowi Manase dow akeng thuraiuüa vüi thawp phuchuara ün khai. <verse eid="2KI 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 21:5" />Aia dow kuang dawng kowi kowh krek maten kowi nachupiiala kownkow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh viadawng pre buk mih kowi thawp phuchuara ün khai. <verse eid="2KI 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 21:6" />Aia dow aia kowh chapa kowi khowm maih kowi nawmah hanow phuchuala arup khai. Aia dow chang mantan khai, cham mü hawra khai, now süngnam hai lümla ngak hown taklawp taiua mih maru tut-e cham paw prengia khai. CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang hai aia dow CHAKRAMANG kowi towkah kunmarau khai.<verse eid="2KI 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 21:7" />Aia thawpah mih Asera limpu dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi aia towah khai. Nami kim lawnguan kowi David hai achapa Sawlawmawn kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Jerusalem marow kowi kowh ang kowh kim kowi dow maru kawmuüa mih chowngchowng saksakma nauang chupiia ang kown. Nami marow dow Israel laipre chen hownia kowh ang lang kloah mih chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 21:8" />Israeluüa che ang kowh ana pek hai amatni kowi kowh ang nar Mosi peah mih ari aiang iawng chün khai hanow amatni pipu-uüa kowi kowh ang peah mih pren hownia amatni mih apowt natakla kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="2KI 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 21:9" />Nachenganchepaw maru kawmuüa dow nami laiklow sünta dowi chekhai. Amatni kowi dow Manase pe changla angak khai. Amatni dow amatni pur hownia CHAKRAMANG prütta mih chenchapuüa lak-e lang chang angak khai.<verse eid="2KI 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 21:10" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh nar risiuüa hownia maiawng tek pe khai, <verse eid="2KI 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 21:11" />“Juda pren mang Manase dow maiawngün suiiai kaniaima mih lup maten chang khai. Aia dow mami arah kowi kowh rik uowi mih Amawruüa lak-e lang chang lup ngak khai. Aia dow Israeluüa kowi aia kowh arup ün kowi pe chup pe iiala mih hown pe changah lup ngak khai. <verse eid="2KI 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 21:12" />Naiawng rakowi ang CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek khowk: Jerusalem marowchakuüa hai Juda prenchakuüa luk kowi dow phih kraingma ang nauang pawla pe kown. Nami ta miuüa dow kram kowh pikchu narü kown. <verse eid="2KI 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 21:13" />Jerusalem marow kowi dow Samari marow hai Ahab krungchakuüa kowi ang ripah iawng ang naripah kown. Nami marowchakuüa kowi dow ki sawkta lawngpan kowh kümta hüah mih iawng asaima ang namata kown. <verse eid="2KI 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 21:14" />Nachenganchepaw ta sing uowi ne tak hanow amatni kowi dow ang nanuata kown, now amatni kowi dow ransu-uüa rut kowi ang naap-ah kown. Nahanow naiawngün ransu-uüa dow amatni kowh uowi mih uanh maten kür hown narupta pe kown. <verse eid="2KI 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 21:15" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow ang mik kowi angakma mih lup chang büah khai, now Aigupta pren hownia amatni kowh pipu-uüa uang lawt mih ni hownia kawmat mowr pat amatni dow towk ang kunmarau khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 21:16" />Nami klen kowi Manase dow aprek uowi dowi mih maru-uüa kowi lainowmma krawi sai khai. Naiawngün maru-uüa kowh vi dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh tiama kowi hing takan nukluk khai. Aia dow Juda maru-uüa kowi pe changah ngak khai. Naiawng rakowi Juda maru-uüa dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang khai.<verse eid="2KI 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 21:17" />Manase kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten hai aia kowh angak lawnguan dow “Juda Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 21:18" />Akung kowi Manase dow kowng hanow mang kim ria kowi kowh bakan kowi maru dupah khai. Nami bakan dow Uza kowh chekhai. Aia takcha kowi dow achapa Amawn mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="2KI 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Amawn chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 21:19" />Juda pren kowi Amawn chowm mang mih dow 22 ning khe chekhai. Aia dow pre ning mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. A-u dow Jawtba marowchak Haruz kowh chama Mesulemet chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 21:20" />Amawn dow a-pa Manase iawng CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang khai. <verse eid="2KI 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 21:21" />Aia dow a-pa chang iawng tawi chang khai: A-pa chupah mih arup ün kowi aia paw tawi chupiia khai, <verse eid="2KI 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 21:22" />aia dow CHAKRAMANG apipu-uüa kowh Thurai kowi nuata khai, now CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek aia chün kown nau dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 21:23" />Aia kowh maru iukuüa dow aia kowi nasaita kownkow sangkrang khai, now aia kim kowi aia kowi saita büah khai. <verse eid="2KI 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 21:24" />Tawkche mang Amawn kowi sai miuüa maten kowi dow prenchakuüa mih saita bowk khai. Now aia takcha kowi dow achapa Josia kowi amatni ta pe chowmah mang khai.<verse eid="2KI 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 21:25" />Amawn kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten dow “Juda Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 21:26" />Aia kowi dow aia vüi khowmta bowkta mih tadupra Uza kowh bakan kowi dupah khai. Aia takcha kowi dow achapa Josia mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="2KI 21:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2KI 22" />
  <para style="s">Uamow Hilkia ka rirow bowih mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 22:1" />Juda pren kowi Josia chowm mang mih dow raiat ning khe chekhai. Aia dow 31 ning mowr Jerusalem marow mih kruitownla khai. A-u dow Bawzkat marowchak Adaia kowh chama Jedida chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 22:2" />Josia dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi aiungma mih lup chang reng chekhai. Aia dow akeng mih tiama pra cham powt dowi kowi a-pu David chang iawng chang reng chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 22:3" />Aia chowm mang mih lairaiat ning khe Josia dow Azalia kowh chapa (Masulam kowh chu) Safan kowi mih Thurai chupra kim kowi kowchinah khai. Safan dow mang kowh cha rui mih chekhai. Safan kowi mang Josia tek pe mih, <verse eid="2KI 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 22:4" />“Uamow lang kri mih Hilkia tut-e en kowkowi diah, now CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh maru kawmuüa uang pawla mih tangka pawisa kimplawt chawng miuüa hawt pawah mih dow aia narüaah kaneu kown mih kowtek pe diah. <verse eid="2KI 22:4" /><verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="2KI 22:5-6" />Nami tangka pawisa dow Thurai chup kim rawk miuüa luk kowi kowh towah mih mingkhet miuüa kowi aia pacham peah lah. Now singh hai hua hown kowh kim chang sarauüa kowi pacham peah sukkri kha lah. Nami klen kowi Thurai chup kim rawk müa phen hai hua bawp ia mih pacham ranla büah lah. <verse eid="2KI 22:5-6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 22:7" />Nami mingkhet miuüa luk kowi kowh napeah kown mih tangka pawisa dow amatni ingsap pe takla dowi tham. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow kaah sakowm iawng chang lup reng chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 22:8" />Nakhowk khe mang kowh cha rui mih Safan kowi uamow Hilkia tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh rirow bowih ang ka khowk,” pakhai. Now nami bowih dow Hilkia mih Safan kowi peah khai, now Safan dow nami bowih mih phatah khai. <verse eid="2KI 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 22:9" />Nami kung kowi Safan tek pe mang mih, “Thurai chup kim kowi kowh tangka pawisa dow en kowh naruüa mih uang pawla khowk. Now nami tangka pawisa dow Thurai chup kim chang miuüa luk kowi kowh mingkhet miuüa rut kowi apta khowk,” pakhai. <verse eid="2KI 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 22:10" />Nami klen kowi Safan plan tek pe mang mih, “Uamow Hilkia krawi pe ang chabowih lowk,” pakhai. Nahanow aia dow nami chabowih mih mang kowi phat pe khai.<verse eid="2KI 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 22:11" />Now mang dow nami ari arow bowih kowi kowh arui uowi mih laiklow tata hanow aia khupah mih tawnguat thekta khai. <verse eid="2KI 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 22:12" />Now mang Josia dow uamow Hilkia, Safan kowh chapa Ahikam, Mikaia kowh chapa Akbawr, Safan hai mang kowh maru iuk Asai büah kowi peah ana mih, <verse eid="2KI 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 22:13" />“Mami kata khowk mih ari arow bowih kowi kowh arui uowi mih lawnguan dow ang vüi hai makowi kowh Judauüa vüi CHAKRAMANG tut-e kowkowiah now kowlünta büa diah. CHAKRAMANG dow a-i luk kowi kunmarau mih lün pluplup towbowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow a-i kowh pipu-uüa dow mami bowih kowi kowh arui uowi iawng chün dowi chekhai, now nachünah kownkow mami bowih kowi kowh arui uowi iawng amatni dow chang büah dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 22:14" />Now nami laiklow tata hanow uamow Hilkia, Ahikam, Akbawr, Safan hai Asai büah dow masiuüa risi Hulda kowi kowphowk pe khai. Hulda dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowh tawnguat mingkhet mih Salum kowh masi chekhai. Now Salum dow Tikva kowh chapa (Harhas kowh chu) chekhai. Hulda uowi mih dow Jerusalem marow lak kowi kowh arah sar kowi chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 22:14" /><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="2KI 22:15-16" />Amatni kowi Hulda tek pe mih, “Israeluüa kowh Thurai pe tek ang mih maiawng: Uang chin enni mih maru tut-e kowkowi hanow CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow kowtek pe diah. CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Mami bowih kowi kowh Juda pren mang phatah mih kowi arui uowi mih maten iawng mami arah kowi hai aia maru-uüa luk kowi phih kraingma ang nauang pawla pe kown. <verse eid="2KI 22:15-16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 22:17" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow ang kowi nuata ang hanow akeng mih thuraiuüa vüi kowi cham towk maikhük büah khai, now amatni thawpah mih arup aren hown amatni dow towk ang kunmarau khai. Naiawng rakowi mami arah kowi dow ang kowh kunmarau nalün pluplup kown, now nami dow naia mitah kown nadowi,’ pakhai. <verse eid="2KI 22:17" /><verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="2KI 22:18-19" />CHAKRAMANG kowh naukrang natukla kownkow uang chin enni mih Juda pren mang kowi kowtek pe büa diah. CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih, ‘Mami arah hai aia maru luk kowi kowh piati hai piakra nauang ting kown mih laiklow en ta hanow en kowh sak mih rau khai, now ang CHAKRAMANG pur kowi dow en uang khamsum khai. En matia khupah mih tawnguat dow en thekah khai, now ang pur kowi en uang kar khai. Naiawng rakowi en kowh prasi lük klow dow ang hawt sünta en khowk. <verse eid="2KI 22:18-19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 22:20" />Naiawng rakowi kowng hanow en kowi dow en pipu-uüa tut-e alenma ang napawla en kown, now thaulangma en naka tadupra kown. Mami marow luk kowi phih akraingma ang nauang pawla kown mih dow en natawi khi kown nadowi bowt,’ pakhai,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 22:20">Nahanow amatni dow kowmang hanow masiuüa risi Hulda krawi tek pe mih naiawngün laiklow mang kowi kowtek pe büah khai.<verse eid="2KI 22:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2KI 23" />
  <para style="s">Josia plan krawi thik Judauüa kowh chowm krang uowi krang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 23:1" />Akung kowi mang Josia dow kowchin maru hanow Juda pren hai Jerusalem marow kowi kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa maten kowi uang hawla khai, now amatni kowi dow arasang aia kuaah lawmah khai. <verse eid="2KI 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 23:2" />Now aia dow Juda pren hai Jerusalem marow kowi kowh aiuk asowm uowi mih maten kowi pawla now CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowkup khai. Amatni pungmadawng kowi dow uamowuüa hai risiuüa paw tawi uowi chekhai. Now CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh kata mih chabowih laiklow maten dow amatni kowi aia phat pe khai. <verse eid="2KI 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 23:3" />Nami kung kowi mang Josia dow kimchüng ria kowi iowng se nami <char style="w">charam tua</char> kowi kowh arui uowi mih sangbowk laitawm maten nachün kownkow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi maiawng takham khai, “CHAKRAMANG tiama kowi ang namang kown, ang kowh sak maiow hown aia kowh ana pek hai ari aiang ang nachün kown,” pakhai. Nakhowk khe maru maten mih naiawng mang hown tawi takham khai.<verse eid="2KI 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 23:4" />Now mang Josia dow phuchua müa vüi kowi kowh thawpah mih Baal thurai, Asera limpu hai krek rup maten CHAKRAMANG kim hownia nauang lawtla kownkow uamow lang kri mih Hilkia, akhowng mih uamowuüa hai kimplawt chawng miuüa kowi peah ana khai. Now aia dow naiawngün arup mih Jerusalem marow uat kowi kowh Kidrawn lawngrawi kowi kowh dowm kowi cham tikah khai, now plawi dow Bethel marow kowi aia pawla khai. <verse eid="2KI 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 23:5" />Now Judauüa kowh marow maten hai Jerusalem marow riaret kowi kowh arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara kowi nam iungma mih maikhük natowk kownkow Juda manguüa towah mih uamowuüa kowi dow aia prütta bowk khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün uamowuüa dow Baal thurai, lama, sat, krek tapu lawm mih hai akeng mih krek maten vüi kowi nam iungma mih maikhük towk reng chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 23:6" />Aia dow CHAKRAMANG kim hownia Asera limpu mih pawla hanow Jerusalem marow uat kowi kowh Kidrawn lawngrawi kowi cham tikah khai. Nami kung kowi dow nami chüng mih aia dita neknek khai, now nami di ia dow iawngpa mih maru-uüa kowh tadupra luk kowi aia krawi uetah khai. <verse eid="2KI 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 23:7" />Now CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh chawkkrawma lup chang mih kachakuüa hawmh kowh towklak ün dow aia piakta pe khai. Nami towklak kowi dow Asera thuraima vüi masiuüa hawmh mih kawng uan reng chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 23:8" />Josia dow Juda pren kowi kowh marow hai kua maten hownia uamowuüa maten kowi prang kowi uang pawla khai. Now Geba marow hai Ber-Seba marow mowr arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara kowi uamowuüa towk pe nam iungma mih maikhük reng mih phuchuara ün dow aia sürlawkta pe khai. Now Jerusalem marow kowi kowh lang kri mih Josua kowh tapplawt re-e kowh uowi mih arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara maten paw aia piakta pe khai. Nami tapplawt uowi mih dow marow tapplawt lakuai prakowi chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 23:9" />Nami arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara kowi chang lup mih uamowuüa dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG kowh phuchuara kowi tawi ia chang lup dowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw amatni dow akeng mih uamowuüa hown the pe tuah dowi mih kawm tawi ia cha reng chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 23:10" />Molek thurai vüi kowi amia iawng mih paw amatni kowh chauüa naia phuchuala dowi kownkow Josia mih Ben-Hinawm lawngrawi kowi kowh Tofet pami phuchuara dow sürlawkta pe khai. <verse eid="2KI 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 23:11" />Naphuchuala sat kownkow alai kowh Juda manguüa peah mih kawrnga kari hai kawrnga ün dow Josia mih kawrnga kowi prütta bowk hanow kawrnga kari mih tikta pe bowk khai. Naiawngün kawrnga uowi mih dow mang kowh lup chang mih Nathan-Melek pami maru kowh towklak ria kowi chekhai. Nami towklak dow CHAKRAMANG kim kupra tiama ria kowi kowh viadawng kowi chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 23:12" />Now mang Ahaz uowiah mih towklak kimluk kowi kowh Juda manguüa thawpah mih phuchuara maten dow mang Josia piakta pe khai, now CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh viadawng kowi Manase thawpah mih phuchuara maten paw aia piakta pe khai. Now naiawngün phuchuara maten dow Kidrawn lawngrawi kowi aia cham kuakah khai. <verse eid="2KI 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 23:13" />Tasür Talawk mih hungh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tasür Talawk mih hungh </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sangbowk Laitawm Sar kowi dow mami hungh ming Kanrawn hungh chekhai. Sangbowk Laitawm Prim kowi dow nami hungh kowi maru-uüa phuchuala arup aren mih rakowi Tasür Talawk mih hungh pahai maru chap pe ming mih chekhai.</char></note> mrawkphak prakowi kowh arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara maten aia sürlawkta pe khai. Nami hungh dow Jerusalem satlawt prakowi chekhai. Naiawngün arah kroma mih kowi kowh phuchuara dow Sidawnuüa kowh suiiai kaniaima mih Astarte thuraima vüi, Moabuüa kowh suiiai kaniaima mih Kemaws thurai vüi hai Amawn maru-uüa kowh suiiai kaniaima mih Melek thurai vüi Israel mang Sawlawmawn thawpah mih chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 23:14" />Josia dow chupiiaah mih hua ün bawpta pe khai, now Asera limpu ün kripta pe khai. Now naiawngün arah dow maru-uüa kowh hut hown aia phumah khai.<verse eid="2KI 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 23:15" />Israeluüa kowi pe changla angak mih Nebat chapa Jeroboam thawpah mih Bethel marow kowi kowh phuchuara hai arah kroma mih kowi kowh phuchuara dow Josia bawpta pe hanow towkta pe khai. Nami klen kowi Asera limpu paw aia tikta pe khai. <verse eid="2KI 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 23:16" />Nami kung kowi aia dow tapat lut krawi tang mü hanow hungh re-e kowh uowi mih tadupra ün khi khai. Now nami tadupra kowi kowh hut maten nauang pawla kownkow aia dow aia maru-uüa kowi kowchinah khai, now naiawngün hut dow phuchuara luk kowi aia tikah khai. Naiawng hai phuchuara dow aia sürlawkah khai. Naiawng nauang phaw kown mih lawnguan dow Thurai maru rik tekta khowk chekhai. Naiawngün dow CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow iawng uang phaw mih chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 23:17" />Now mang Josia tek mih, “Paimi mia kowh tadupra chow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 23:17">Nakhowk khe marowchakuüa tek pe Josia mih, “Paimi dow Thurai maru kowh tadupra chowbowt. Aia dow Juda pren hownia uang hanow Bethel marow kowi kowh phuchuara napiak kown mih lawnguan uang phuang anging khai. En dow nami maru uang phuang anging mih iawng rowprowp en chang mih chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="2KI 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 23:18" />Nakhowk khe amatni kowi aia tek pe mih, “Paimi pacham uowila taih; aia kowh hut ün amiapaw hangkow pacham kak lah,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi maru kawmuüa dow aia kowh hut hai Samari pren hownia kowh uang mih risi kowh hut mih aiawng uowi khe kowh iawng towah büah khai.<verse eid="2KI 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 23:19" />Samari pren kowi kowh marow ün kowi arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara kowi Israel manguüa thawpah mih thurai chup kim dow Josia piakta pe khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow nami thurai chup kim hown CHAKRAMANG kowi towkah kunmarau khai. Naiawng rakowi naiawngün phuchuara dow Bethel marow kowi kowh phuchuara aia piakah iawng piakah khai. <verse eid="2KI 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 23:20" />Josia dow nakowi kowh uamowuüa kowi naiawngün phuchuara luk kowi saiah khai. Now maru-uüa kowh hut dow naiawngün phuchuara luk kowi aia tikah khai. Nami kung kowi dow Jerusalem marow kowi aia plan khai bowt.<verse eid="2KI 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josia plan tarowng Takat Pawi sun mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 23:21" />Nami kung kowi aia dow maru maten kowi peah ana mih, “Sangbowk laitawm kowi kowh arui uowi iawng CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai vüi kowi Takat Pawi chang büa diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="2KI 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 23:22" />Naiawng mih Takat Pawi dow Israel kruitown miuüa chowng hownia Israel manguüa hai Juda manguüa mih katpaw sunla dowi tak chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 23:23" />Tawkche Josia chowm mih 18 ning khe dow Jerusalem marow kowi CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi nami Takat Pawi mih chang khai bowt.<verse eid="2KI 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 23:24" />Now süngnam hai lümla ngak hown taklawp taiua mih maru maten kowi dow Josia prütta bowk khai. Nami klen kowi chowlowkkow kimchakuüa kowh thurai rup, arup aren, now Juda hai Jerusalem marow kowi kowh suiiai kaniaima mih uanh maten paw aia kuakta pe bowk khai. Naiawng mang Josia chang mih dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh uamow Hilkia kaah mih chabowih kowi kowh arui uowi iawng naia chünla kownkow chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 23:25" />Aia dow Mosi rirow kowi kowh arui uowi mih maten iawng aia kowh saktuak, sak hai kür maiow hown CHAKRAMANG tiama kowi mang khai. Aia iawng mih mang dow aia dowi rawn hai aia kung kowi amiapaw uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 23:26" />Nachenganchepaw aia dow Judauüa luk kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura lün pluplup mih nowng rimta pe bowk dowi tak chekhai. Naiawng Judauüa luk kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura lün pluplup mih dow CHAKRAMANG sak-hiah kawmla mih lup Manase changta khai rakowi chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 23:27" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Ang pur hownia Israeluüa kowi kowh ang prütah iawng Judauüa kowi paw ang naprütah kown. Now ang kloah mih Jerusalem marow hai mami dow ang kowh uowi rah pahai ang tekah mih Thurai chup kim dow ang nanuata kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 23:28" />Josia kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten dow “Juda Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 23:29" />Josia chowm mang mih khin khe Aigupta pren mang Faraw-Nekaw dow Asuria pren mang kowi natawi khowngah tasen kownkow Iufratis aw prakowi kowtarü khai. Nakhowk khe mang Josia dow Faraw-Nekaw hown nauang tadowk tasen kownkow uang lawt khai. Tawkche Faraw-Nekaw mih mang Josia hown tasen hanow aia kowi dow Megido marow kowi saiah khai. <verse eid="2KI 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 23:30" />Now Josia kowh siphai hawmh dow aia kowh uak mih kawrnga kari hown Megido marow hownia Jerusalem marow kowi uang pawla khai. Now aia kowi dow aia vüi kowi kowh khowmta bowkta mih tadupra kowi dupah khai. Akung kowi prenchakuüa dow achapa Jehoahaz kowi nümnapah khai, now a-pa takcha kowi aia kowi dow ta pe chowmah mang khai.<verse eid="2KI 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Jehoahaz chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 23:31" />Juda pren kowi Josia chowm mang mih dow 23 ning khe chekhai. Aia dow sum la mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. A-u dow Libna marowchak Jeremia kowh chama Hamutal chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 23:32" />Jehoahaz dow apipu-uüa iawng CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang reng chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 23:33" />Jerusalem marow naia kruitownla dowi kownkow aia kowi dow mang Faraw-Nekaw mih Hamat pren kowi kowh Ribla marow kowi khümah now towah khai. Now mang Faraw-Nekaw dow mangmu iawng hai tai 90 mawn ngia hai kuh 35 set ngia nauang pe kownkow Juda prenchakuüa luk kowi peah kurdik khai. <verse eid="2KI 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 23:34" />Aia dow Josia kowh alowk mih chapa Eliakim pami kowi a-pa Josia takcha ta pe chowmah mang khai. Now aia dow Eliakim pami ming takcha kowi Jehoiakim pahai chap pe ming khai. Mang Faraw-Nekaw dow Jehoahaz kowi Aigupta pren kowi pawla khai, now Jehoahaz dow nakowi hing kowng khai. <verse eid="2KI 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 23:35" />Now Jehoiakim dow naiawngün kuh tai mih Faraw-Nekaw kowi napela kownkow aia prenchakuüa kowi mangmu iawng kük pe khai. Now aia dow prenchakuüa kowi khowm bowk pe mangmu khowt kuh hai tai mih aia pawah khai. Now aia dow mang Faraw-Nekaw kük pe iawng kuh hai tai mih aia kowi peah khai.<verse eid="2KI 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Jehoiakim chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 23:36" />Juda pren kowi Jehoiakim chowm mang mih dow 25 ning khe chekhai. Aia dow lailowk ning mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. A-u dow Ruma marowchak Pedaia kowh chama Zebida chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 23:37" />Jehoiakim dow apipu-uüa iawng CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang reng chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 23:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2KI 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 24:1" />Now Jehoiakim chowm mang mih khin khe Babulawn mang Nebuknezar dow Juda pren kowi uang senah khai. Now Juda pren mang Jehoiakim dow sum ning mowr mang Nebuknezar nimkrüa kowi tawi uowi khai. Tawkche akung kowi aia dow Nebuknezar kowi kingküaah khai. <verse eid="2KI 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 24:2" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG dow Jehoiakim kowi nakingküaah kownkow Babulawnuüa, Siriauüa, Moabuüa hai Amawn siphaiuüa kowi uang chinah khai. Amatni kowi naiawng CHAKRAMANG uang chinah mih dow aia nar risiuüa kowi aia rik tekta khowk iawng Juda pren napiakta kownkow chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 24:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="2KI 24:3-4" />Judauüa luk kowi naiawng phih uang ting mih dow CHAKRAMANG mih aia ana pek iawng aia pur hownia amatni kowi naprütta kownkow chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Manase dow lainowmma chang angak khai. Aia dow angak uowi dowi miuüa kowi krawi saiah khai. Naiawngün maru-uüa kowh vi dow Jerusalem marow kowi atekma aia changah khai. Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh angak lawtta pe dowi chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 24:3-4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 24:5" />Jehoiakim kowh akeng mih lup lawnguan maten dow “Juda Manguüa Lawnguan” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 24:6" />Jehoiakim kowng kung kowi dow achapa Jehoiakin mih ta chowm mang khai.<verse eid="2KI 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 24:7" />Aigupta pren mang dow nacham tasen kownkow aia pren hownia lawt dowi bowt chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Aigupta aw hownia Iufratis aw mowr Aigupta pren mang powngah mih süng dow Babulawn pren mang powngta pe bowk khai.<verse eid="2KI 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Jehoiakin chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 24:8" />Juda pren kowi Jehoiakin chowm mang mih dow lairaiat ning khe chekhai. Aia dow sum la mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. A-u dow Jerusalem marowchak Elnathan kowh chama Nehusta chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 24:9" />Jehoiakin dow a-pa iawng CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang reng chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Babulawnuüa powngta Jerusalem mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 24:10" />Nami khin khe Babulawn pren mang Nebuknezar kowh siphai hawmh dow Jerusalem marow kowi uang hanow uang umta lut khai. <verse eid="2KI 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 24:11" />Now aia kowh siphaiuüa kowrum Jerusalem marow mih khin khe Nebuknezar paw nami marow re-e kowkowi khai. <verse eid="2KI 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 24:12" />Nakhowk khe mang Jehoiakhin, a-u, aia kowh prengia pek miuüa, aia kowh siphaiuüa hai aia kowh maru iukuüa maten Nebuknezar tut-e uang taap khai. Now mang Nebuknezar chowm mang mih raiat ning khe aia dow mang Jehoiakhin kowi khümla now pawla khai. <verse eid="2KI 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 24:13" />Nebuknezar dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh dawngthawnguan hai mang kim kowi kowh dawngthawnguan maten pawla bowk khai. Now CHAKRAMANG kim vüi kuh hown kowh Israel mang Sawlawmawn thawpah mih uanh maten dow aia tawpta pe nak khai. Naiawngün dow CHAKRAMANG rik tekta khowk iawng phaw mih chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 24:14" />Nami klen kowi Jerusalem marow kowi kowh maru iukuüa maten, tasen kiakma miuüa maten, uanh thawp sarauüa maten, plamphaiuüa maten hai marowchakuüa hailawm bowkbowk kowi maru iun 10,000 ia aia khümla now pawla khai. Pren kowi dow ngaraima miuüa klen kowi amiapaw ta uowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 24:15" />Mang Nebuknezar dow Jehoiakin kowi khümla hanow Babulawn pren kowi pawla khai. Aia dow Jerusalem marow hownia Jehoiakin u, amasi hawmh, aia kowh maru iukuüa hai pren kowi kowh maru iukuüa kowi paw khümla khai. <verse eid="2KI 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 24:16" />Mang Nebuknezar dow nacham tasenla kownkow tasen kiakma mih siphai hai akürma mih siphaiuüa kowi khümla 7,000 ia khai, now uanh thawp sarauüa hai lup chang miuüa kowi paw khümla 1,000 ia khai. Naiawngün maru-uüa kowi dow Babulawn pren kowi aia pawla khai. <verse eid="2KI 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 24:17" />Aia dow Jehoiakin takcha apahi Matania kowi ta pe chowmah mang khai, now Matania kowi dow Zedekia pahai aia rük pe ming sar khai.<verse eid="2KI 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Zedekia chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 24:18" />Juda pren kowi Zedekia chowm mang mih dow 21 ning khe chekhai. Aia dow lailowk ning mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. A-u dow Libna marowchak Jeremia kowh chama Hamutal chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 24:19" />Zedekia dow Jehoiakin iawng CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang khai. <verse eid="2KI 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 24:20" />Jerusalem hai Juda maru-uüa rakowi CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura dow lün pluplup khai. Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow aia pur hownia amatni kowi prütah khai. Akung kowi mang Zedekia dow Babulawn pren mang Nebuknezar kowi kingküaah khai.<verse eid="2KI 24:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="2KI 25" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem marow piak mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 25:1" />Zedekia chowm mang mih taku ning khe kowh hamüt la kowi hamüt ni khe Babulawn pren mang Nebuknezar dow aia kowh siphai hawmh maten kowi pawla now Jerusalem marow nakowrumta hüah kownkow tarü khai. Now aia dow Jerusalem marow uat kowi krawi khup tangbung khai, now marow riaret kowi dow akroma aia krawi chun pe bawn khai. <verse eid="2KI 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 25:2" />Zedekia chowm mang mih lailowk ning mowr Jerusalem marow dow rumta hüah khai. <verse eid="2KI 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 25:3" />Nami ning tali la kowi kowh taku ni mih ni khe Jerusalem marow kowi kowh khown dow uang hu ngamlam khai. Naiawng rakowi marowchakuüa kowh dow chakkham hing uowi dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 25:4" />Akung kowi Babulawnuüa mih Jerusalem marow tap nowng khue parah khai. Nakhowk khe paw Babulawn siphaiuüa dow Jerusalem marow mih rumta hüah reng tak chekhai. Nachenganchepaw Juda siphaiuüa maten dow iak-e khe mang bakan re-e kowh alak kowi kowh tap hai uat kowi kowh tap takra kowi kowh tapplawt iawng ku powt khai. Now amatni dow Jawrdan lawngrawi kowi kowpowt khai. <verse eid="2KI 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 25:5" />Nami khin khe Babulawn siphaiuüa dow mang Zedekia kung kowi kawikrawi khai, now aia kowi dow Jeriko dowm kowi krawi ka khümta khai. Nami khin khe mang Zedekia kowh siphai hawmh maten dow powt hanow cham taset plawt khai. <verse eid="2KI 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 25:6" />Now amatni dow aia kowi khümla hanow Ribla marow kowi Babulawn mang tut-e kowpawla khai. Now nakowi dow Babulawn mang mih aia kowh aprek phuang pe khai. <verse eid="2KI 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 25:7" />Nami kung kowi dow siphaiuüa mih mang Zedekia pur kowi achapauüa kowi saiah khai. Nami kung kowi aia kowh mik pre buk trui paw laita pe khai, now aia kowi dow kri leng hown tawmla hanow Babulawn pren kowi pawla khai.<verse eid="2KI 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 25:8" />Babulawn pren kowi Nebuknezar chowm mang mih laitaku ning khe tanga la kowi kowh ranit ni khe mang chawng mih aluchow Nebuzardan dow Jerusalem marow kowi uang khai. <verse eid="2KI 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 25:9" />Now Nebuzardan dow CHAKRAMANG kim, mang kim hai Jerusalem marow kowi kowh kim maten krawi towkta khai. Nami klen kowi marow kowi kowh akri akrima mih kim maten paw aia krawi towkta bowk khai. <verse eid="2KI 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 25:10" />Nebuzardan nimkrüa kowi kowh uowi mih Babulawn siphai hawmh maten dow Jerusalem marow tap mih khueta khai. <verse eid="2KI 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 25:11" />Marow kowi kowh ta uowi miuüa hai Babulawn pren mang prakowi tawi tangila miuüa maten kowi mang chawng mih Nebuzardan mih Babulawn pren kowi pawla khai. <verse eid="2KI 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 25:12" />Nachenganchepaw Juda pren kowi kowh grep krum natamingkhet kownkow hai nata chang laih nata chang üa kownkow ngaraima miuüa kowi dow pren kowi aia ta towla ne khai.<verse eid="2KI 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 25:13" />Now Babulawn siphaiuüa dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh kri hown kowh thawpah mih kimchüng pre buk, kri hown kowh bia chowm müa hai tui nungra kri hown kowh bia iukma mih ün theuta naknak khai. Now naiawngün uanh dow Babulawn pren kowi pawla büah khai. <verse eid="2KI 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 25:14" />Nami klen kowi amatni dow puh, plawi kuak müi uaibak, maibu kowi kowh bawthi kep müa kaingkep hai Thurai chup kim kowi kowh tawngah kengah mih kri uanh maten pawla büah bowk khai. <verse eid="2KI 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 25:15" />Nami klen kowi kuh hai tai hown kowh akeng mih uanh maten paw Nebuzardan pawla bowk khai. Naiawngün uanh kowi dow mairing towk müa puh hai biatum paw uowi chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 25:16" />Mang Sawlawmawn dow CHAKRAMANG kim vüi kimchüng pre buk, tui nungra kri hown kowh bia iukma mih hai achowm müa ün kri hown thawpah khai. Naiawngün kri dow di lai bowt rakowi ia khaiah dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 25:17" />Now naiawngün kimchüng dow pachüng kowi aklang lairaiat muk chi chekhai, now naiawngün kimchüng luk kowi alu klang dow sum muk chi chekhai. Nami kimchüng lu kowi dow kri leng tapat lut chekhai, now nami kimchüng lu dow dalim uih iawng kri hown thawpah khai.<verse eid="2KI 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Judauüa kowi Nebuzardan khümla mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 25:18" />Now mang chawng mih aluchow Nebuzardan dow Judauüa kowh uamow lang kri mih Seraia, akhowng mih uamow Zefania<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zefania </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow Zefania bowih rui miia nadowi chekhai.</char></note> hai Thurai chup kim kangchawng mih sum ia kowi khümla khai. <verse eid="2KI 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 25:19" />Now Jerusalem marow kowi kowh ta tapet miuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh tasen miuüa luk kowi towah mih aluchow hai mang kowh prengia pek mih tanga ia kowi aia khümla khai. Nami klen kowi aia dow hawt paw siphai sar reng mih cha rui mih siphai aluchow kowi khümla khai, now marow kowi kowh krawi ta ka khümah mih maru 60 ia kowi paw pawla khai. <verse eid="2KI 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 25:20" />Naiawngün khümla mih maru-uüa maten kowi dow Nebuzardan mih Ribla marow kowi Babulawn mang tut-e kowpawla khai. <verse eid="2KI 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 25:21" />Naiawngün maru-uüa kowi dow Babulawn pren mang mih Hamat pren kowi kowh Ribla marow kowi saita bowk khai. Naiawng hai Judauüa kowi dow khümla now amatni pren hownia alakma kowi cham pawla khai.<verse eid="2KI 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ta towla mih Judauüa kowi Gedalia ta kruitown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 25:22" />Juda pren kowi kowh aia ta towla mih maru-uüa kowi nakruitownla kownkow Nebuknezar dow Ahikam kowh chapa Gedalia kowi towah khai. (Gedalia dow Safan kowh chu chekhai). <verse eid="2KI 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 25:23" />Now nami satang tata hanow Juda pren kowi kowh uowi mih siphai aluchowuüa hai amatni kowh maru-uüa dow Mizpa marow kowi Gidalia tut-e uang khai. Naiawngün maru-uüa dow Nethania kowh chapa Ismael, Karea kowh chapa Johanan, Netofa marow hownia kowh Tanhumet kowh chapa Seraia, Makhathi kowh chapa Jazania hai amatni kowh maru-uüa chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 25:24" />Now amatni hai amatni kowh maru-uüa tut-e kham sawi se Gedalia tek pe mih, “Babulawn pren kowi kowh kruitown miuüa kowi hangkow kram büa diah. Mami pren kowi uowi büa diah, now Babulawn mang tek iawng chang büa diah. Naiawng che enni chang hanow enni naiung kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="2KI 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 25:25" />Tawkchedow ranit la khe mih Nethania kowh chapa Ismael dow pawla maru hamüt ia hanow Mizpa marow kowi kowkowi khai, now Gedalia kowi aia saiah khai. (Ismael dow Elisama kowh chu chekhai). Nami klen kowi Gedalia hown kowh taiua uowi mih Judauüa hai Babulawnuüa maten kowi paw saiah khai. Ismael dow mang krungchak maru chekhai. <verse eid="2KI 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 25:26" />Nami kung kowi dow Judauüa mih Babulawnuüa kowi lainowmma kram khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi Judauüa bowkbowk dow maru iuk maru sowm hai siphai aluchowuüa mih Aigupta pren kowi powt khai.<verse eid="2KI 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thawngrum hownia Jehoiakin uang lawt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 25:27" />Juda pren mang Jehoiakin kla thawng mih 37 ning khe Evil-Merodak dow Babulawn pren kowi chowm mang khai. Nami ning laipre la kowi kowh lacher 27 ni khe aia dow Jehoiakin kowi thawngrum hownia lawtta khai. <verse eid="2KI 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 25:28" />Aia dow Jehoiakin kowi klangiungma klowpah klangah khai. Aia dow Babulawn pren kowi Jehoiakin hown tawi taiua uowi mih akeng pren manguüa kowi lak-e Jehoiakin kowi lang towah asung khai. Aia dow Jehoiakin kowi ringkawma mih chowm rah kowi pe chowmah khai. <verse eid="2KI 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 25:29" />Evil-Merodak dow Jehoiakin kowi thawngrum hownia kowh tawnguat pe klüpta hanow pe khupah tawnguat sar khai. Nami hownia bowt now Jehoiakin dow sing uowi mowr atungma mang hown tawi taiua cha chakkham khai. <verse eid="2KI 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 25:30" />Aia sing uowi mowr dow mang mih aia kowi ni towng kowh charek peah reng chekhai.<verse eid="2KI 25:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 25" />
</usx>